window.APEX=window.APEX||{};APEX.services={"breast-augmentation":{"title":"Breast Augmentation: Techniques, Silicone Choices, and Pricing","desc":"Learn about breast augmentation techniques, silicone types and sizes, surgical approaches, prices, and what to consider before surgery","date":"10/02/2025","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Breast-Augmentation-Techniques-Silicone-Choices-and-Pricing.webp","alt":"Breast Augmentation: Techniques, Silicone Choices, and Pricing"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Breast-Augmentation-Techniques-Silicone-Choices-and-Pricing.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Breast-Augmentation-Techniques-Silicone-Choices-and-Pricing.webp","blocks":[{"t":"p","x":"Breast augmentation is a transformative surgical procedure that enhances self-confidence and elevates your overall personality and physical silhouette. This comprehensive guide provides all the essential information you need, from surgical techniques and silicone selection to preparation and recovery, ensuring a beautiful and safe result."},{"t":"h2","x":"What is Breast Augmentation?"},{"t":"p","x":"Gaining a clear understanding of what breast augmentation entails is the first step toward achieving the balanced and proportionate look you desire. This surgical journey combines medical precision with aesthetic artistry to help you feel more confident in your own skin."},{"t":"p","x":"Breast Augmentation is a surgical procedure designed to increase the size or refine the shape of the breasts to better suit the body’s proportions and meet individual goals. This surgery helps build confidence and corrects issues related to uneven size or shape by using enhancement materials, such as silicone gel or autologous fat (fat grafting), ensuring results are both aesthetically pleasing and medically safe."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/What-are-the-Techniques-for-Breast-Augmentation_.webp","alt":"What are the Techniques for Breast Augmentation?"},{"t":"h2","x":"What are the Techniques for Breast Augmentation?"},{"t":"p","x":"Understanding the various surgical placement methods is essential for achieving a result that aligns perfectly with your anatomy and aesthetic goals. Your surgeon will recommend the best approach based on your skin elasticity, existing breast tissue, and desired outcome."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Submuscular Placement: This technique places the silicone implant partially underneath the chest muscle. It provides more coverage for the implant, resulting in a natural look and reducing the risk of capsular contracture. It is ideal for individuals with thin breast tissue or those seeking a soft, natural feel."},{"x":"Subglandular Placement: The implant is placed above the muscle but beneath the breast tissue. This method is suitable for those who already have a significant amount of breast tissue, as it directly increases fullness and offers a faster recovery time. However, it may appear less natural in patients with very thin skin."},{"x":"Dual Plane: This is a highly popular hybrid technique where the upper part of the implant is placed under the muscle for a seamless look, while the lower part is placed above the muscle for a natural teardrop sag. It provides beautiful results and reduces the issue of the implant moving when the chest muscles are flexed."},{"x":"Subfascial Placement: The implant is placed under the thin fascia layer that covers the chest muscle. This serves as a middle ground between subglandular and submuscular techniques, effectively hiding the edges of the implant while offering less pain and a faster recovery than direct submuscular placement."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"What are the Different Types of Breast Implants?"},{"t":"p","x":"The surface texture of a silicone implant is a critical factor that affects tissue adhesion, the risk of capsular contracture, and the overall tactile sensation. Modern medical technology offers three primary surface types, each designed to meet specific clinical and aesthetic needs."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Smooth Surface Silicone: These implants have a slick, smooth surface that allows them to move freely within the breast pocket, providing the softest and most natural movement. While they offer a gentle feel, they may carry a slightly higher risk of capsular contracture if the body reacts to the implant. They are most commonly used in submuscular placements."},{"x":"Textured (Sand) Surface Silicone: Designed with a rougher surface to better grip the surrounding tissue, these implants significantly reduce the risk of displacement or rotation. This makes them the ideal choice for teardrop-shaped implants, which must stay in a specific position to maintain the correct aesthetic."},{"x":"Micro-textured (Velvet) or Nano-textured Silicone: This advanced technology features a fine, velvet-like surface that combines the benefits of both smooth and textured implants. It provides a soft, natural touch while maintaining a high safety profile against capsular contracture and displacement, making it a popular modern choice for patients."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Compare the textures of silicone"},{"t":"table","rows":[["Silicone Surface Type","Advantages","Limitations","Best Suited For"],["Smooth Surface","Provides a soft and natural touchMoves freely, mimicking real tissueThin and flexible shell","Higher risk of capsular contracture compared to other types","Those who prioritize natural movement and a very soft touch."],["Textured (Sand) Surface","Adheres well to surrounding tissueReduces the risk of capsular contractureMaintains shape and position longer","Tactile sensation may not be as smooth as the smooth type","Those concerned about capsular contracture or who have had previous implant displacement issues."],["Micro-textured (Velvet) Surface","Combines the benefits of both smooth and textured surfacesProvides a soft touch while maintaining excellent shape stability","Newer technology with a higher price point","Those seeking a balance between a soft feel and the ability to reduce clinical risks."]]},{"t":"p","x":"↔ Scroll left–right to view more information"},{"t":"h2","x":"Types of Breast Augmentation Surgery"},{"t":"p","x":"Breast augmentation is a widely popular cosmetic surgery designed to enhance the size and shape of the breasts for a more proportionate look. There are currently several techniques and materials available, each with unique advantages and limitations tailored to individual needs and body types."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Silicone Breast Augmentation: This is the most popular method, involving the surgical insertion of medical-grade silicone implants to increase breast volume. Silicone comes in various shapes (round or teardrop), textures, and sizes, providing highly visible and long-lasting results."},{"x":"Fat Grafting Breast Augmentation: This technique involves liposuctioning excess fat from other body areas, such as the abdomen or thighs, purifying it, and then injecting it into the breasts. It offers a very natural result using the patient’s own tissue while simultaneously reducing fat in donor areas."},{"x":"Hybrid Breast Augmentation: A combination technique that uses both a silicone implant and fat grafting. This allows the patient to achieve the desired volume from the implant while using fat to soften the edges, especially in the cleavage area, for a more seamless and natural appearance."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Comparing Breast Augmentation Materials"},{"t":"p","x":"Modern breast surgery primarily utilizes two types of materials: silicone gel and autologous fat. Each material possesses distinct properties and suitability depending on the patient’s aesthetic goals and physical characteristics."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Silicone Gel: This is the most popular material because it provides clear results, creates a beautiful shape, and is highly durable. It is ideal for those wanting a significant increase in size or a more defined breast contour."},{"x":"Autologous Fat: Breast fat grafting is an excellent alternative for those seeking a natural result and only a slight increase in size. While it uses the body’s own cells, a limitation is that some fat may be reabsorbed by the body, meaning results may not be permanent and might require touch-up sessions."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Which Breast Implant Brand is Best?"},{"t":"p","x":"Choosing the right implant brand is a crucial step that directly impacts the final look and feel of your results. At APEX, we provide high-quality implants from two world-class brands, Mentor and Motiva, to meet diverse patient preferences."},{"t":"h3","x":"Mentor Silicone Implants"},{"t":"p","x":"Mentor is renowned for its MemoryGel® technology, a gel that “remembers” and retains its shape perfectly. This provides a soft, resilient feel and comes in several specialized models:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Mentor Smooth Round: A smooth-surface, round implant that offers a soft touch and natural movement. Ideal for a classic, full, and cleavage-centered look."},{"x":"Mentor MemoryGel Xtra: Offers a firmer, more projected feel than the standard smooth model while utilizing MemoryGel technology to maintain shape and safety."},{"x":"Mentor Ultimate: A high-end model providing exceptional durability and a gel consistency that mimics the feel of real breast tissue."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Motiva Silicone Implants"},{"t":"p","x":"Motiva stands out with its Ergonomix® innovation, allowing the implant to change shape naturally with body movement. Their Nano-texture surface, known as SmoothSilk®, reduces tissue irritation. Models include:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Motiva Silk Surface: A nano-textured round implant that lowers the risk of capsular contracture, ideal for a soft and gentle feel."},{"x":"Motiva Ergonomix: A highly popular choice due to its ability to move naturally with the body—whether lying down or standing up—ensuring the breasts look authentic and never stiff."},{"x":"Motiva JOY: The premium flagship model featuring an embedded safety chip (Qid®) for lifetime tracking. It features the most natural tissue integration and high flexibility with TrueMonobloc™ technology."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Choosing the Right Breast Implant Size"},{"t":"p","x":"Selecting the ideal implant size should be a collaborative decision based on the surgeon’s evaluation and the patient’s goals. The surgeon will assess physical factors such as chest wall width, existing breast tissue volume, and skin elasticity to ensure the result is beautiful, natural-looking, and proportionate to the patient’s frame."},{"t":"h2","x":"What Concerns Cannot be Fixed by Breast Augmentation?"},{"t":"p","x":"There are certain physical limitations that silicone implants alone cannot resolve. Understanding these constraints is vital for maintaining realistic expectations regarding the final outcome of your surgery."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Severe Sagging: While implants add fullness, they cannot lift significantly sagging skin or reposition a low nipple. This usually requires a combined Breast Lift (Mastopexy) procedure."},{"x":"Wide Cleavage Spacing: Augmentation cannot change the natural bone structure of the chest wall. If your breasts are naturally wide apart, implants can only bring them closer to a certain extent."},{"x":"Large Areolas: Inserting an implant does not reduce the size of the areola; this requires a specific areola reduction surgery."},{"x":"Nipple Asymmetry: If nipples are naturally at different heights, augmentation alone cannot perfectly align them without additional corrective surgery."},{"x":"Stopping the Aging Process: Implants do not prevent future changes caused by aging, gravity, pregnancy, or weight fluctuations."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Who is a Suitable Candidate for Breast Augmentation?"},{"t":"p","x":"Breast augmentation can significantly boost self-confidence and improve one’s silhouette. Potential candidates should be in good health and have a clear understanding of what the procedure can achieve."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Individuals wanting to increase breast size to better balance their body proportions."},{"x":"Those with visible breast asymmetry looking for better balance."},{"x":"Women experiencing loss of volume or shape after pregnancy, breastfeeding, or significant weight loss."},{"x":"Healthy individuals without serious medical conditions that could hinder recovery."},{"x":"Emotionally mature individuals with realistic expectations."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Who is NOT Suitable for Breast Augmentation?"},{"t":"p","x":"To ensure patient safety and avoid complications, certain groups should avoid or delay breast augmentation. It is essential to consult thoroughly with a medical professional before making any decisions."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Women who are currently pregnant or breastfeeding."},{"x":"Patients with severe chronic illnesses, such as heart or lung disease, or blood clotting disorders."},{"x":"Individuals currently suffering from an active infection."},{"x":"Those with active breast cancer or a very high risk of developing it."},{"x":"Individuals with unrealistic expectations regarding the outcome."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Preparation Before Breast Augmentation Surgery"},{"t":"p","x":"Proper preparation not only ensures a smooth surgical process but also significantly reduces risks and speeds up the recovery phase. Following these guidelines is essential for a safe and successful transformation."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Consultation: Evaluate your health, choose your implant size, and select the right technique with your surgeon."},{"x":"Stop Smoking and Alcohol: Avoid these for at least 2 weeks before surgery to ensure proper blood flow and healing."},{"x":"Adjust Medications/Supplements: Stop blood-thinners like Aspirin and supplements like Fish Oil 1-2 weeks before the procedure."},{"x":"Health Screening: Undergo required blood tests and physical exams as ordered by the doctor."},{"x":"Prepare Clothing: Have loose, button-down shirts and a post-op support bra ready."},{"x":"Plan Recovery: Arrange for time off work and have someone assist you for the first 1-2 days after surgery."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Steps of the Breast Augmentation Procedure"},{"t":"p","x":"Breast augmentation is a detailed process that requires careful planning and surgical precision. Here is a summary of the professional steps involved in the surgery at a high-standard facility."},{"t":"list","o":true,"items":[{"x":"Consultation: Discussing goals, evaluating anatomy, and selecting the size and technique."},{"x":"Pre-op Preparation: Fasting for at least 8 hours and preparing the body for anesthesia."},{"x":"Surgery: The anesthesiologist administers general anesthesia, then the surgeon creates the incision, forms the pocket, and carefully places the implant."},{"x":"Recovery: Waking up in the recovery room, wearing a support bra, and following immediate post-op care."},{"x":"Follow-up: Scheduled appointments to check the wound and monitor the healing process."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Post-Operative Care After Breast Augmentation"},{"t":"p","x":"Appropriate self-care following surgery is vital for fast healing, reducing the risk of complications, and achieving the best aesthetic result. Adhering to these steps will help your body recover efficiently."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Rest: Avoid strenuous activity or heavy lifting for the first 1-2 weeks."},{"x":"Dietary Restrictions: Avoid fermented foods, raw/undercooked meals, and seafood for 2-4 weeks to prevent inflammation."},{"x":"Wear a Support Bra: Use a wireless surgical support bra or sports bra as directed by your surgeon."},{"x":"Sleeping Position: Sleep on your back with your head elevated for 4-6 weeks; avoid side or stomach sleeping."},{"x":"No Smoking/Alcohol: Abstain from these to promote faster wound healing and reduce inflammation."},{"x":"Scar Care: Use prescribed scar gels or sheets once the wound is closed to ensure a smooth, faded scar."},{"x":"Attend Appointments: Ensure you go to all follow-up visits to monitor for any potential issues."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Characteristics of Breast Augmentation Scars"},{"t":"p","x":"The location of the surgical scar depends on the technique chosen by the surgeon. Typically, incisions are placed in discreet areas to make them as unnoticeable as possible over time."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Inframammary Fold (Underfold): The most common location, hidden in the crease under the breast."},{"x":"Periareolar (Around the nipple): Hidden along the border of the dark areola skin."},{"x":"Transaxillary (Armpit): Hidden within the natural folds of the armpit, leaving no scars on the breast itself."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Side Effects and Risks of Breast Augmentation"},{"t":"p","x":"While modern breast augmentation is highly popular and safe, it is a major surgery with inherent risks. Staying informed about these potential side effects is a crucial part of the decision-making process."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Pain and Infection: Standard risks for any surgery; managed with meds and hygiene."},{"x":"Capsular Contracture: When scar tissue hardens around the implant, potentially causing discomfort or shape changes."},{"x":"Rupture or Leakage: Though rare with modern cohesive gel implants, a rupture may require implant replacement."},{"x":"Sensation Changes: Temporary or permanent numbness in the nipples or skin."},{"x":"Asymmetry or Rippling: Visible folds in the silicone, especially in very thin patients."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Choosing the Right Clinic for Breast Augmentation"},{"t":"p","x":"Selecting a surgical facility is a decision that impacts not just your beauty, but your long-term health and safety. Use these criteria to ensure you are in the best possible hands."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Surgeon Credentials: Ensure the doctor is a certified plastic surgeon with specific experience in breast augmentation."},{"x":"Facility Standards: The clinic or hospital must be licensed, feature sterile operating rooms, and have advanced emergency equipment."},{"x":"Material Transparency: Choose a clinic that uses FDA-approved implants and is transparent about their surgical techniques."},{"x":"Real Patient Reviews: Research “before and after” photos and testimonials from actual patients."},{"x":"Aftercare Services: Select a clinic that provides a clear follow-up schedule and accessible post-op support."},{"x":"Risk Protection: Ask about the clinic’s warranty or policies in case revision surgery is needed."}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/How-Much-Does-Breast-Augmentation-Cost_.webp","alt":""},{"t":"h2","x":"How Much Does Breast Augmentation Cost?"},{"t":"p","x":"The cost of breast augmentation surgery varies depending on the specific type of silicone implant, the surgical technique used, and the individual physical evaluation of each patient. Surgeons carefully assess breast structure, chest base width, skin elasticity, and overall safety standards before providing a final price recommendation."},{"t":"h2","x":"Breast Augmentation Pricing at APEX Surgery Hospital"},{"t":"p","x":"Pricing at specialized surgical facilities reflects the quality of the implants, the expertise of the surgical team, and the premium medical standards provided. At APEX Surgery Hospital, we offer transparent pricing tiers categorized by world-class brands and comprehensive care packages."},{"t":"h3","x":"Mentor Silicone Implants"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Mentor Smooth Round: Starting from 79,000 THB"},{"x":"Mentor MemoryGel Xtra: Starting from 119,000 THB"},{"x":"Mentor Ultimate: Starting from 250,000 THB"}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Motiva Silicone Implants"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Motiva Silk Surface: Starting from 109,000 THB"},{"x":"Motiva Ergonomix: Starting from 159,000 THB"},{"x":"Motiva JOY: Starting from 250,000 THB"}]},{"t":"p","x":"All procedures are performed by board-certified plastic surgeons with dedicated 1:1 care from professional anesthesiologists. Every surgery includes a personalized body analysis and custom design, along with a robust long-term post-operative follow-up and monitoring system.Note: Prices are subject to change based on seasonal promotions and specific treatment plans. A medical evaluation is highly recommended before making a final decision."},{"t":"h2","x":"Review of before and after breast augmentation results"},{"t":"gallery","items":["~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_Breast-04.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_Breast-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_Breast-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_Breast-01.webp"]},{"t":"p","x":"The results are individual-based and are used as examples of treatment outcomes for specific patients."},{"t":"h2","x":"Frequently Asked Questions about Breast Augmentation Surgery"},{"t":"p","x":"Addressing common concerns is a vital part of the patient journey toward achieving a more confident and balanced silhouette. This section provides clear insights into the most typical questions regarding pain, recovery, and the long-term maintenance of your results."},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"Is breast augmentation very painful, and how long does the pain last?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"You may experience tightness or soreness during the first 2–3 days, which is normal and manageable with prescribed medication. The discomfort gradually decreases, though the level of pain varies depending on individual anatomy and the surgical technique used."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How many days of recovery are needed before returning to normal life?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Most patients can return to light daily activities within 1–2 weeks. Strenuous exercise or heavy lifting should be avoided for approximately 4–6 weeks, depending on your healing progress and your surgeon’s specific advice."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How long do breast implants last? Do I need to replace them?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Modern implants typically have an average lifespan of 10–20 years. If there are no complications, replacement might not be immediately necessary, but regular check-ups with your surgeon are highly recommended to monitor the integrity of the implants."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"When will the breasts settle into their final shape?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"The breasts will gradually settle and begin to look more natural within 1–3 months. The most stable and definitive results are typically visible once you reach the 3–6 month post-operative mark."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"When can I sleep on my side or stomach?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"It is recommended to sleep on your back for the first 4–6 weeks. After this period, you may begin sleeping on your side; however, sleeping on your stomach should wait until the implants have fully settled and after a consultation with your doctor."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Can I breastfeed after breast augmentation?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"In most cases, breastfeeding is still possible as implants are usually placed beneath the muscle, which does not interfere with the milk ducts. It is important to inform your surgeon if you have plans for pregnancy in the future."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Should I massage my breasts after surgery?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Massage requirements depend entirely on the type of implant and the surgical technique used. Smooth-surface implants may require a specific massage routine, whereas textured or velvet-surface implants generally do not. Always follow your surgeon’s specific instructions."}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Summary"},{"t":"p","x":"Breast augmentation is a versatile cosmetic surgery designed to refine breast size and shape through a variety of options, including different silicone placement techniques, high-quality brands like Mentor or Motiva, or the use of autologous fat. Choosing the most suitable method requires a careful assessment of individual anatomy and expectations through professional consultation. Ultimately, thorough pre-operative preparation and strict adherence to post-operative care are the most essential factors in achieving beautiful, natural-looking results while minimizing potential surgical risks."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Channels","lead":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Tel : 085 000 2001","h":"tel:0850002001"},{"x":"Line : @apexbeauty","h":"https://line.me/R/ti/p/@apexbeauty"},{"x":"Tiktok : apexprofoundbeauty","h":"https://www.tiktok.com/@apexprofoundbeauty"},{"x":"Facebook : APEX Hospital & Beauty Clinic","h":"https://www.facebook.com/ApexProfoundBeauty"},{"x":"Instagram : apexbeauty","h":"https://www.instagram.com/apexbeauty"},{"x":"Youtube : Apex Beauty Clinic","h":"https://www.youtube.com/@Apex.beautyclinic"},{"x":"X (Twitter) : ApexProfound","h":"https://x.com/ApexProfound"}]}]},"coolsculpting-elite":{"title":"Coolsculpting Elite","desc":"Coolsculpting Elite helps break down fat with cold, tightens the body, reduces fat, and covers specific areas.","date":"03/09/2024","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Coolsculpting-Elite-Cover.webp","alt":"Coolsculpting Elite"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Coolsculpting-Elite-en.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Coolsculpting-Elite-Cover.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"CoolSculpting Elite: The Next Level of Fat Reduction for a Sculpted and Confident Body"},{"t":"p","x":"For those struggling with stubborn fat, lack of firmness, or disproportionate body contours, CoolSculpting Elite is a cutting-edge solution. Developed from the original CoolSculpting technology, this advanced fat-freezing treatment enhances fat reduction efficiency while improving body sculpting results—all without surgery or the need for weight loss."},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX Clinic, we’ll introduce you to CoolSculpting Elite, compare it to other fat reduction procedures, and highlight its key benefits, helping you make an informed choice for a well-balanced figure and increased self-confidence."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/What-is-Coolsculpting-Elite-en.webp","alt":"What is Coolsculpting Elite"},{"t":"h2","x":"What is CoolSculpting Elite?"},{"t":"p","x":"CoolSculpting Elite is an advanced fat-freezing technology (Cryolipolysis) that operates at temperatures between -11 to -13 degrees Celsius. This innovative system is designed to effectively target and reduce fat in multiple areas with improved efficiency compared to the previous model."},{"t":"p","x":"Whether you’re looking to slim down your abdomen, thighs, or double chin, this treatment is perfect for those seeking a non-surgical solution to stubborn fat that resists diet and exercise. With no downtime, CoolSculpting Elite allows you to return to daily activities immediately."},{"t":"h2","x":"How CoolSculpting Elite Works"},{"t":"p","x":"This state-of-the-art fat-freezing device precisely controls cooling temperatures to freeze and destroy fat cells through a natural biological process called apoptosis. Once these fat cells are broken down, the body naturally eliminates them through the lymphatic system, resulting in reduced fat layers and a more sculpted figure—without surgery"},{"t":"h2","x":"CoolSculpting Elite vs. Original CoolSculpting"},{"t":"p","x":"While both technologies work on the same Cryolipolysis principle, CoolSculpting Elite features notable enhancements:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"18% Larger Treatment Coverage – Treats a bigger area per session, improving efficiency."},{"x":"Redesigned Applicators – New ergonomic applicators provide better contouring and more precise fat reduction."},{"x":"Faster Treatment Time – Uses dual applicators, allowing treatment of multiple areas at once, reducing session time to 35-45 minutes per area."}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Coolsculpting-Elite-Applicator-en.webp","alt":"Coolsculpting Elite Applicator"},{"t":"h2","x":"CoolSculpting Elite: Enhanced with 3 Applicator Types in 7 Sizes"},{"t":"h3","x":"Applicator Curve Series"},{"t":"p","x":"The Curve Series applicator heads are designed to work well with the body’s curves, such as the abdomen, sides, and thighs, effectively targeting hard-to-reach fat areas."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Applicator Curve 80 is suitable for reducing fat in small areas, such as the double chin, minor breasts, or above the knees."},{"x":"Applicator Curve 120 is suitable for small curved areas, such as the abdomen, waist, flank, banana rolls, or male breasts."},{"x":"Applicator Curve 150 is suitable for areas with less fat, such as the abdomen, waist, flank, banana rolls, or male breasts."},{"x":"Applicator Curve 240 is suitable for larger areas, such as the abdomen or waist. Applicator"}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Flat Series"},{"t":"p","x":"The Flat Series applicator heads are designed for targeting fat pockets under the skin in flat, wide areas."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Applicator Flat 125 is suitable for fat reduction on the inner thighs or arms."},{"x":"Applicator Flat 165 is suitable for reducing belly fat, arms, and inner thighs."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Applicator Surface"},{"t":"p","x":"The Surface 150 applicator head is designed for cold fat reduction in areas where normal applicators have difficulty targeting, such as the outer thighs."},{"t":"h2","x":"Benefits & Considerations Before Treatment"},{"t":"p","x":"Key Benefits of CoolSculpting Elite","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Effectively reduces excess fat in targeted areas"},{"x":"Non-surgical with no recovery time required"},{"x":"Visible results in 3-4 weeks, with peak results in 2-3 months"},{"x":"Covers larger treatment areas, whether small or large"},{"x":"Minimal risk of severe side effects"},{"x":"CoolControl Technology ensures safe and consistent cooling"}]},{"t":"p","x":"Who Should Avoid CoolSculpting Elite?","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Individuals with Cryoglobulinemia or Cold Agglutinin Disease"},{"x":"Those who are significantly overweight"},{"x":"Pregnant or breastfeeding women"},{"x":"Possible mild side effects such as redness, swelling, bruising, or numbness"}]},{"t":"p","x":"Always choose a certified clinic for safety and best results"},{"t":"h2","x":"Real Results, Real Confidence"},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX, we prioritize delivering visible and lasting results for our clients. Clinical studies and real patient experiences confirm that CoolSculpting Elite reduces up to 27% of fat per treated area, with results peaking within 2-3 months after treatment."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"More contoured, balanced body shape"},{"x":"Enhanced confidence in clothing and appearance"},{"x":"Firmer and smoother skin after treatment."}]},{"t":"p","x":"*Results may vary based on individual response."},{"t":"h2","x":"Comparing CoolSculpting Elite to Other Fat Reduction Methods"},{"t":"p","x":"There are various body contouring and fat reduction treatments available. CoolSculpting Elite is a non-surgical, targeted fat-freezing procedure that minimizes the risk of scarring and requires little to no downtime. This differs from liposuction, which effectively removes larger amounts of fat but involves downtime and potential side effects. Meanwhile, Meso Fat injections and HIFU are better suited for minor fat reduction and skin tightening, rather than full-body contouring."},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose CoolSculpting Elite at APEX?"},{"t":"p","x":"APEX Medical Center is the leading destination for high-end aesthetic and wellness solutions in Bangkok. With our commitment to world-class standards, our CoolSculpting Elite treatment is tailored for clients who value cutting-edge technology, expert medical care, and an exclusive VIP experience."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"State-of-the-Art CoolSculpting Elite Technology – Advanced fat-freezing technology for optimal body contouring."},{"x":"Luxury Medical Aesthetics Experience – Personalized treatments in a 5-star clinic setting."},{"x":"Expert-Led & FDA-Approved Treatments – Performed by experienced specialists for clinically proven and FDA-cleared for non-invasive fat reduction."},{"x":"Tailored Sculpting Plans – Customized body contouring to fit your unique shape and goals."},{"x":"Efficient & Time-Saving – Quick sessions with dual applicators to treat multiple areas at once."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Q&A: Everything You Need to Know Before Treatment"},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"Why is CoolSculpting Elite a great choice?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"CoolSculpting Elite is a non-invasive, fat-freezing procedure that targets and reduces stubborn fat cells, which are naturally processed by the body over time. It’s perfect for those wanting a sculpted, toned body safely and effectively."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How many sessions are needed?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Each person is different, but typically 1-2 sessions per area deliver optimal results. A consultation with our specialists will help determine your best treatment plan."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Is CoolSculpting Elite painful?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Most patients experience mild discomfort, such as tightness or cold sensations at the beginning. Numbness may occur, but these effects subside naturally. There’s no downtime, so you can resume activities immediately."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Are the results permanent?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Yes! Once fat cells are eliminated, they do not regenerate. However, maintaining a healthy lifestyle is crucial to preventing new fat accumulation."}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"CoolSculpting Elite: The Ultimate Non-Surgical Fat Reduction Solution"},{"t":"p","x":"CoolSculpting Elite is a highly effective, non-invasive fat reduction treatment that delivers noticeable body sculpting results with minimal downtime. Within a few weeks, you’ll see a more contoured figure, with peak results in 2-3 months. With proper diet and exercise, long-lasting results can be maintained."},{"t":"h2","x":"Book Your VIP CoolSculpting Elite Experience at APEX"},{"t":"p","x":"Your transformation starts with a private consultation at our APEX Medical Center in Bangkok. Our specialist team will assess your body goals and create a customized CoolSculpting Elite plan designed for maximum results."},{"t":"h2","x":"APEX CoolSculpting Reviews"},{"t":"gallery","items":["~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Coolsculpting-Elite-Review-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Coolsculpting-Elite-Review-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Coolsculpting-Elite-Review-04.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Coolsculpting-Elite-Review-03.webp"]},{"t":"p","x":"Results depend on each individual. Services are available at Apex Clinic, Phloen Chit."}]},"double-eyelid-surgery":{"title":"Double Eyelid Surgery","desc":"Double eyelid surgery is a way to adjust your look to suit each person's style. It also provides double eyelid correction services","date":"03/02/2024","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Double-Eyelid-Surgery-Cover.webp","alt":"ศัลยกรรมตาสองชั้น"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Double-eyelid-surgery.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Double-Eyelid-Surgery-Cover.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"What is Double Eyelid Surgery and How Can It Help?"},{"t":"p","x":"Double eyelid surgery is a cosmetic procedure designed to enhance the definition and shape of the upper eyelid crease. Using various surgical techniques tailored to individual needs, this procedure improves facial harmony and boosts self-confidence. It can address multiple concerns, including:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Correction of epicanthal folds or absent upper eyelid crease"},{"x":"Reduction of excess eyelid skin or fat deposits"},{"x":"Enhancement of eye appearance, making them look larger, brighter, and more defined"},{"x":"Boosting self-confidence by improving overall facial aesthetics"},{"x":"Balancing eyelid symmetry to complement facial features"}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/What-is-Double-Eyelid-Surgery.webp","alt":"ศัลยกรรมตาสองชั้นคืออะไร"},{"t":"h2","x":"Popular Double Eyelid Surgery Techniques"},{"t":"p","x":"There are multiple techniques for double eyelid surgery, each tailored to different needs:"},{"t":"h3","x":"1. Full Incision Method"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Best for: Individuals with excess eyelid fat or sagging skin"},{"x":"Process: A precise incision along the desired eyelid crease, removing extra fat if necessary"},{"x":"Benefits: Permanent results, enhanced eye definition"}]},{"t":"h3","x":"2. Suture (Stitching) Method"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Best for: Those with thin eyelids and minimal excess fat"},{"x":"Process: Small stitches are placed to create a crease without cutting"},{"x":"Benefits: Less downtime, minimal scarring, natural-looking results"}]},{"t":"h3","x":"3. Celeb Eyes Technique"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Best for: Those seeking a soft, elegant eye shape"},{"x":"Process: A customized approach combining incision and muscle adjustment"},{"x":"Benefits: Balanced eyelid shape with minimal scarring and faster recovery"}]},{"t":"h3","x":"4. Plexr Laser Technique"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Best for: Minor eyelid adjustments or correcting hooded eyes"},{"x":"Process: Uses plasma energy to tighten the eyelid skin without incisions"},{"x":"Benefits: No major surgery, reduced swelling, quick recovery"}]},{"t":"h3","x":"5. Medial Epicanthoplasty (Inner Corner Eye Surgery)"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Best for: Individuals with a narrow inner eye corner"},{"x":"Process: Removes excess skin covering the inner eye for a larger eye effect"},{"x":"Benefits: Enhances eye symmetry and brightness"}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Incision vs. Suture Method: Which One Is Right for You?"},{"t":"table","rows":[["Technique","Pros","Cons"],["Full Incision","Permanent results, effective for sagging skin","Longer recovery, more swelling"],["Suture Method","Quick recovery, minimal scarring","Not suitable for heavy eyelids, may not last as long"]]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Double-Eyelid-Surgery-Choose.webp","alt":"ศัลยกรรมตาสองชั้นเลือกยังไง"},{"t":"h2","x":"How to Get the Best Double Eyelid Surgery Results"},{"t":"h3","x":"1. Choose Your Eyelid Style:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Natural Look – Soft, subtle crease for a natural appearance"},{"x":"Doll-Like Eyes – Rounded and bright for a youthful glow"},{"x":"Sharp & Defined – Bold and structured for a striking look"},{"x":"Customized Blend – A mix of techniques for personalized results"}]},{"t":"h3","x":"2. Consult a Specialist"},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX, expert surgeons assess your eye structure to recommend the best technique for your goals."},{"t":"h3","x":"3. Select a Trusted Clinic"},{"t":"p","x":"Ensure your surgery is performed by certified professionals with proven results and client testimonials."},{"t":"h2","x":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"Is Double Eyelid Surgery Painful?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Mild discomfort may occur during anesthesia, but the procedure itself is painless."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How Long Is the Recovery Time?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Swelling typically subsides within 5-7 days, with full healing in 2-4 weeks."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How Long Does Swelling Last?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Most swelling resolves in one week, with final results visible in 3-6 months."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How Many Days Should I Apply a Cold Compress?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Apply a cold compress for the first 48 hours, then switch to warm compresses after 4-5 days to reduce swelling faster."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"What Foods Should I Avoid After Surgery?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Avoid spicy foods, fermented products, seafood, alcohol, and caffeine to prevent inflammation and enhance healing."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"What If My Eyelids Are Uneven After Surgery?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Eyelid asymmetry may improve after 3-6 months. If necessary, a minor revision can correct any imbalance."}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Transform Your Eyes with APEX Double Eyelid Surgery"},{"t":"p","x":"Double eyelid surgery can correct hooded eyes, enhance symmetry, and create a more youthful, refreshed appearance. Choosing a skilled surgeon and a trusted clinic ensures natural-looking, long-lasting results."},{"t":"p","x":"Book Your Consultation Today!","b":1},{"t":"h2","x":"Celeb Eyes Review By Apex"},{"t":"yt","id":"Uhbw3-aYJS4"},{"t":"p","x":"Services are available at Apex Clinic, Phloen Chit branch."}]},"face-lift":{"title":"Facelift: Facial Rejuvenation and Sagging Reduction","desc":"Facelift surgery addresses sagging skin, jowls, and deeper facial tissues. Explore facelift techniques, preparation, recovery, and what to expect after surgery","date":"04/08/2025","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Facelift-Facial-Rejuvenation-and-Sagging-Reduction.webp","alt":"Facelift Facial Rejuvenation and Sagging Reduction"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Facelift-Facial-Rejuvenation-and-Sagging-Reduction.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Facelift-Facial-Rejuvenation-and-Sagging-Reduction.webp","blocks":[{"t":"p","x":"Facelift surgery is a premier choice for individuals seeking to restore a youthful appearance by correcting wrinkles and sagging skin in the face and neck. At Apex Surgery, we utilize advanced medical technologies to ensure natural-looking results, minimal scarring, and a faster recovery process for our patients. This guide provides an in-depth look at everything from the types of procedures available to the essential steps for pre-operative preparation and post-surgical care."},{"t":"h2","x":"What is a Facelift?"},{"t":"p","x":"Understanding the mechanics of a facelift is essential for patients seeking a significant and long-lasting rejuvenation of their facial contours. This procedure goes beyond the surface to target the foundational layers of the face to restore a firmer and more youthful appearance."},{"t":"p","x":"A facelift (Rhytidectomy) is a surgical procedure designed to lift and tighten muscles to correct sagging in the face and neck. It focuses on restructuring the deep tissue layer known as the SMAS (Superficial Musculoaponeurotic System)—the fibrous and muscular layer that plays a vital role in skin firmness. By adjusting this deep structure, the surgery restores youthfulness, reduces sagging, and rebalances facial proportions for a natural, refreshed look."},{"t":"h2","x":"What Areas Can be Lifted and What Problems Do They Solve?"},{"t":"p","x":"Facelift surgery is highly customizable, allowing patients to target specific zones of concern across the forehead, face, and neck. Each procedure is designed to address unique signs of aging, ensuring that the results are balanced and harmonious."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Forehead Lift: Tightens the skin and muscles above the brow, reducing forehead wrinkles and lifting sagging eyebrows. This corrects “hooded” eyes, making the eyes appear wider and more vibrant."},{"x":"Upper Facelift: Targets the cheekbones and the area around the eyes. It reduces fine lines and restores fullness to the cheeks, adding dimension and a refreshed glow to the face."},{"x":"Lower Facelift: Focuses on the cheeks and jawline to correct deep nasolabial folds, marionette lines, and jowls. This results in a sharper jawline and a firmer facial structure."},{"x":"Neck Lift: Corrects double chins and loose skin on the neck, as well as sagging neck muscles (platysmal bands). It creates a smooth, firm neck profile that blends naturally with the face."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Who is a Suitable Candidate for a Facelift?"},{"t":"p","x":"Determining if a facelift is the right choice depends on an individual’s skin condition, age, and specific aesthetic goals. Identifying these criteria helps ensure that patients achieve the most satisfying and safe surgical outcomes."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Individuals with visible facial sagging, particularly in the cheeks, jawline, and neck."},{"x":"People with deep wrinkles and a “aged” appearance that cannot be corrected by non-surgical methods."},{"x":"Individuals aged 40 and above who are experiencing age-related skin degradation."},{"x":"Those seeking results that last longer than non-invasive skin-tightening technologies."},{"x":"Individuals looking to improve their self-confidence and overall personality in daily life."},{"x":"Patients with realistic expectations who understand that surgery can rejuvenate but not stop the aging process entirely."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"The Benefits of a Facelift"},{"t":"p","x":"Beyond simply tightening the skin, a facelift provides a comprehensive range of physical and emotional improvements for the patient. From redefining facial contours to boosting self-esteem, the advantages of this procedure are profound and enduring."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Significant Lifting: Effectively lifts sagging tissue to correct a “tired” or drooping facial appearance."},{"x":"Deep Wrinkle Reduction: Provides a more dramatic reduction in deep cheek folds, marionette lines, and jowls compared to other methods."},{"x":"Long-Lasting Results: Results typically last between 5 to 10 years, depending on individual skin quality and post-operative care."},{"x":"Defined Jawline: Sharpens the facial frame, which is ideal for those whose jawlines have become blurred due to sagging skin."},{"x":"Multi-Point Correction: Allows for the correction of sagging and wrinkles in multiple areas during a single surgical session."},{"x":"Restored Confidence: A more youthful and refreshed face often leads to increased confidence in social and professional environments."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"What are the Different Facelift Techniques?"},{"t":"p","x":"Advances in medical technology have led to a variety of specialized facelift methods tailored to different levels of sagging and desired recovery times. Exploring these techniques allows patients to work with their surgeons to find the most effective approach for their needs."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Deep Plane Facelift (DFL): A technique that “unlocks” and repositions the deep SMAS layer for long-lasting, natural results. It is ideal for those with significant sagging who want a major transformation."},{"x":"Mini Facelift: Targeted at patients with mild to moderate sagging. It involves smaller incisions and offers a faster recovery time than a full facelift."},{"x":"Endoscopic Facelift: Uses a tiny camera to assist the surgeon, allowing for smaller incisions and reduced downtime."},{"x":"Facelift with Liposuction: Ideal for patients with excess fat in the face or chin area. This combines fat removal with skin tightening for a more contoured look."},{"x":"Laser Facelift: Utilizes laser technology to tighten the skin and stimulate collagen production. It is best suited for those with minor skin laxity."}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Characteristics-of-Facelift-Scars.webp","alt":"Characteristics of Facelift Scars"},{"t":"h2","x":"Characteristics of Facelift Scars"},{"t":"p","x":"Modern surgical techniques focus heavily on minimizing visibility by strategically placing incisions within natural skin folds and hairlines. This ensures that while the lifting results are dramatic, the evidence of the surgery remains well-hidden from public view."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Hidden along the temporal hairline: The incision begins at the temple or upper hairline, where the surgeon carefully aligns it with the natural hair growth pattern to ensure it blends in."},{"x":"Curving in front of the ear: The incision follows the natural curves and folds in front of the ear. It may also be hidden within the small fold of the ear cartilage (the Tragus)."},{"x":"Wrapping behind the earlobe: From the front of the ear, the incision wraps around the back of the lobe, a soft area that conceals scars exceptionally well."},{"x":"Following the hairline behind the ear: The incision continues upward along the groove behind the ear and terminates within the hairline or at the back of the scalp."},{"x":"Under the chin: If a Neck Lift is performed simultaneously, a small, discreet incision may be placed in the natural crease under the chin."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Risks and Side Effects of a Facelift"},{"t":"p","x":"While a facelift offers the most long-lasting results compared to non-surgical methods, it is still a major operation that carries inherent risks. Understanding these potential side effects is a crucial part of making an informed decision about your rejuvenation journey."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Infection at the surgical site: This can occur if proper hygiene and wound care are not strictly maintained."},{"x":"Visible or hypertrophic (raised) scarring: Some individuals may develop more prominent scars depending on their skin type and healing process."},{"x":"Numbness or nerve impact: Temporary loss of sensation is common, though in rare cases, facial nerves can be affected."},{"x":"Hematoma or excessive swelling: A collection of blood under the skin may occur, often requiring medical attention to prevent further complications."},{"x":"Delayed wound healing: This is more frequently observed in smokers or patients with certain chronic health conditions."},{"x":"Facial asymmetry: Slight differences between the two sides of the face may occur during the healing or surgical process."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Preparing for Facelift Surgery"},{"t":"p","x":"Physical and mental preparation is vital for ensuring a smooth surgical experience and a faster, less painful recovery. By following a strict pre-operative protocol, you can significantly reduce the risk of complications and optimize your final aesthetic results."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Consult with a plastic surgery specialist: Discuss your aesthetic goals and realistic expectations for the outcome."},{"x":"Undergo a detailed physical exam: This includes blood tests and basic health screenings to ensure you are fit for surgery."},{"x":"Discontinue certain medications: Stop taking blood thinners, anti-inflammatory drugs, or specific herbal supplements as directed by your doctor."},{"x":"Abstain from smoking and alcohol: You must stop these at least 2 weeks before surgery to ensure proper blood flow and healing."},{"x":"Plan your recovery time: Arrange for time off work and secure a caregiver to assist you during the initial days of recovery."},{"x":"Study post-operative care: Educate yourself on how to properly clean and protect your incisions to ensure the best possible scar healing."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"The Steps of the Facelift Procedure"},{"t":"p","x":"A facelift is a high-precision procedure that focuses on both deep-tissue structural lifting and the natural concealment of surgical marks. On the day of your surgery, the process is divided into four critical stages to ensure your safety and aesthetic success."},{"t":"list","o":true,"items":[{"x":"Evaluation and Surgical Design: The surgeon will re-evaluate your facial structure and mark the incision lines and SMAS lifting points to ensure the most natural and balanced result."},{"x":"Anesthesia: Generally, the procedure is performed under general anesthesia to ensure patient comfort and safety. The Apex Surgery anesthesiology team monitors you closely throughout the entire process."},{"x":"Incisions and Deep Tissue (SMAS) Lifting: The surgeon makes the incisions around the ears and hairline to access the SMAS layer. This deep muscle layer is lifted and tightened, and excess skin or fat is removed to redefine the facial contours."},{"x":"Suturing and Drainage: Once the deep layers are secured, the surgeon uses fine sutures to close the skin for a seamless look. Drainage tubes may be inserted to prevent blood accumulation, and a compression bandage is applied to minimize swelling."}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/How-to-Care-for-Yourself-After-a-Facelift.webp","alt":"How to Care for Yourself After a Facelift"},{"t":"h2","x":"How to Care for Yourself After a Facelift"},{"t":"p","x":"Diligent self-care following your surgery is the most important factor in achieving optimal results and ensuring a smooth recovery. By strictly adhering to post-operative guidelines, you help your body heal faster and can return to your daily life with confidence."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Strictly follow all medical instructions: Adhere to the specific medication and wound care schedule provided by your surgeon."},{"x":"Avoid exercise and heavy lifting: Refrain from strenuous physical activity for at least 4–6 weeks to prevent strain on the incisions."},{"x":"Maintain wound hygiene: Keep the surgical areas clean and avoid touching the incisions directly to minimize the risk of infection."},{"x":"Sleep with your head elevated: Use extra pillows to keep your head higher than your chest, which significantly helps reduce post-operative swelling."},{"x":"Abstain from smoking and alcohol: These substances can impair blood circulation and delay the healing process, increasing the risk of complications."},{"x":"Protect your skin from the sun: Use high-SPF sunscreen and wear a wide-brimmed hat to shield your sensitive skin from UV damage during the healing phase."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Choosing a Facelift Hospital: Key Considerations"},{"t":"p","x":"A facelift is a sophisticated procedure that requires both a surgeon’s artistic skill and a facility’s high safety standards. When selecting where to have your surgery, it is essential to prioritize medical excellence and a proven track record of patient safety."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Surgeon Expertise: Your surgeon should be a board-certified plastic surgery specialist with extensive experience in facial anatomy and a portfolio of natural-looking results tailored to individual facial structures."},{"x":"Facility Standards: The surgery should take place in a fully licensed hospital or clinic featuring sterile operating rooms and advanced safety systems, such as Apex Medical Center."},{"x":"Individualized Treatment Planning: A high-quality facility does not use a “one size fits all” approach. The surgeon must evaluate your unique facial concerns to design a customized surgical plan."},{"x":"Comprehensive Post-Operative Care: A reliable hospital provides a dedicated follow-up system to monitor your recovery and ensure your safety until you are fully healed."},{"x":"Reliability and Real Reviews: Consider real patient testimonials and “before and after” photos. However, always verify these reviews alongside official medical licenses and the clinic’s professional reputation."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"How Much Does a Facelift Cost?"},{"t":"p","x":"The cost of a facelift is determined by the specific surgical technique used, the extent of the areas being treated, and the unique needs of each patient. Because every face is different, a personal consultation is required to provide an accurate price based on the highest standards of safety and care."},{"t":"p","x":"The final pricing typically includes the following factors:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"The surgeon’s professional fees and the anesthesiology team."},{"x":"The specific technique (e.g., Deep Plane, Mini Facelift, or Neck Lift)."},{"x":"Operating room fees and medical supplies."},{"x":"Post-operative medication and follow-up care packages."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Review Before - After Facelift Program"},{"t":"gallery","items":["~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_DeePathama_New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_DeePathama_-New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_DeePathama_-New-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_TopFacelift_-New-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_AeChutima_-New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_AeChutima_-New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_AeChutima_-New-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_TopFacelift_-New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_TopFacelift_-New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Jan_New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Jan_-New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Jan_New-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Nut_Maxim-New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Nut_Maxim-New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Nut_Maxim-New-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Wanna_-New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Wanna_-New-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Wanna_-New-05.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Wanna_-New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%99-New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%99-New-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_TikKanchana_New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_TikKanchana_New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_TikKanchana_New-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Benjarat_New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Benjarat_-New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Benjarat_New-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Som_New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Som_03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BA_FaceNeck-Lift_Som_New-04.webp"]},{"t":"p","x":"Results vary by individual. These examples represent outcomes for specific patients only."},{"t":"h2","x":"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) about Facelift"},{"t":"p","x":"Finding clear answers to your concerns is a vital part of preparing for surgery and ensuring a smooth recovery. This section addresses the most common questions regarding safety, durability, and the surgical process of a facelift."},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"Is a facelift painful?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Managing physical discomfort is a primary concern for patients considering a major surgical procedure like a facelift. Understanding the anesthetic process and post-operative pain management helps ease anxiety and prepares you for the journey."},{"t":"p","x":"During the surgery, patients will not feel any pain as they are under general anesthesia or sedation. Once the anesthesia wears off, there may be some pain, tightness, and numbness. However, the pain is at a level that can be effectively managed with prescribed pain medication, and these symptoms typically improve within a few days."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How many years does a facelift last?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"The longevity of a facelift’s results is one of its most attractive benefits compared to temporary non-surgical alternatives. While no procedure can stop time, several factors influence how many years of youthfulness you can expect to maintain."},{"t":"p","x":"The duration of facelift results depends on several factors, including the technique used, age, skin condition, lifestyle habits, and post-operative care. Generally, facelift results are long-lasting, typically ranging from 5 to 15 years."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How many days of recovery are needed?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Planning your recovery timeline is essential for coordinating work schedules and ensuring you have sufficient time for tissue healing. Most patients find that they can resume their social activities much sooner than they initially expected."},{"t":"p","x":"Special care is required during the first 7 days, with a total recovery period of approximately 2 to 4 weeks. Patients can return to light activities within one week but should avoid strenuous exercise and intense sunlight during the recovery phase."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Can I have a second facelift if I've had one before?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"As natural aging continues over the decades, some patients consider a secondary procedure to maintain their rejuvenated look. Knowing the appropriate timing and structural considerations for a repeat surgery is key to safety and aesthetics."},{"t":"p","x":"Yes, it is possible, but there must be an appropriate interval from the previous surgery—typically 7 to 10 years or more. As skin and facial structures continue to sag with age, a secondary facelift can be performed, though it requires a thorough evaluation by a plastic surgeon first."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Can a facelift cure aging?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"It is important to distinguish between reversing the visible signs of time and altering the biological aging process. A facelift addresses the external evidence of aging while the body’s natural cellular changes continue to progress."},{"t":"p","x":"A facelift cannot cure aging or stop the aging process; it only makes your external appearance look younger than your actual age. While it corrects visible signs such as sagging and deep wrinkles, the natural aging of cells and bodily structures will continue according to nature."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"What are the risks or complications?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Like any surgical intervention, being aware of potential risks allows for better preparation and swifter action if issues arise. Most common side effects are temporary and part of the normal healing response of the body."},{"t":"p","x":"Common risks include swelling, bruising, or temporary localized numbness, which improve over time. Rare cases may involve infection or scarring that requires additional medical attention or specialized care."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Can a facelift be combined with other surgeries?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Many patients choose to address multiple areas of concern at once to achieve a more comprehensive and balanced facial rejuvenation. Combining procedures can often result in a more harmonious outcome with a single recovery period."},{"t":"p","x":"Yes, it can be combined with eyelid surgery (blepharoplasty), brow lifts, or fat grafting to balance and complete the facial restoration. The surgeon will design a personalized plan tailored to the specific needs and desires of the patient."}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Summary"},{"t":"p","x":"Facelift surgery is an effective choice for those seeking to restore youthfulness with clear and significant results, especially for individuals with sagging skin on the face and neck or deep wrinkles that non-surgical methods cannot resolve. The advantages include long-lasting, natural-looking results that significantly boost self-confidence and personality. However, the decision should involve thorough preparation, a clear understanding of the procedure’s limitations, and strict adherence to the surgeon’s pre- and post-operative advice for the best possible outcome."},{"t":"p","x":"If you are interested in a facelift at Apex Medical Center or wish to consult on whether your case is suitable for a facelift, you can schedule an appointment to speak with our plastic surgeons before making your decision."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Information","lead":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Tel : 085 000 2001","h":"tel:0850002001"},{"x":"Line : @apexbeauty","h":"https://line.me/R/ti/p/@apexbeauty"},{"x":"Tiktok : apexprofoundbeauty","h":"https://www.tiktok.com/@apexprofoundbeauty"},{"x":"Facebook : APEX Hospital & Beauty Clinic","h":"https://www.facebook.com/ApexProfoundBeauty"},{"x":"Instagram : apexbeauty","h":"https://www.instagram.com/apexbeauty"},{"x":"Youtube : Apex Beauty Clinic","h":"https://www.youtube.com/@Apex.beautyclinic"},{"x":"X (Twitter) : ApexProfound","h":"https://x.com/ApexProfound"}]},{"t":"p","x":"Disclaimer : Results vary depending on the individual. Terms and conditions apply as specified by the company.Service Location : Services are available at APEX Surgery Hospital (Ploenchit Branch)."}]},"filler-injection":{"title":"Filler Injection","desc":"Filler is a HA filler. It is popularly injected to help moisturize the skin and make it look younger. Filler is used to solve wrinkles and deep lines.","date":"01/09/2024","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Filler-injections-cover.webp","alt":"ฉีดฟิลเลอร์"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ฉีดฟิลเลอร์-Apex.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Filler-injections-cover.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Filler Injections in Thailand: Hydrate, Rejuvenate & Boost Your Confidence"},{"t":"p","x":"Looking for the best dermal fillers in Thailand? Filler injections are a popular non-surgical treatment to restore skin volume, smooth out wrinkles, and enhance facial contours. By injecting hyaluronic acid (HA) fillers, your skin gains deep hydration, a plumper appearance, and a youthful glow. At APEX, our expert doctors ensure safe and natural-looking results, helping you achieve a more radiant look with confidence."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/What-is-Filler-en.webp","alt":"What is Filler"},{"t":"h2","x":"What Are Dermal Fillers?"},{"t":"p","x":"Dermal fillers are made from hyaluronic acid (HA), a naturally occurring substance in the body that retains moisture and enhances skin elasticity. These injectable treatments help:"},{"t":"p","x":"✔️ Reduce fine lines & wrinkles✔️ Restore volume to hollow areas✔️ Improve hydration & skin texture✔️ Contour the face for a lifted, youthful look"},{"t":"p","x":"Since HA fillers are biodegradable, they gradually dissolve over time, providing a safe, natural-looking enhancement with minimal downtime."},{"t":"h2","x":"How Do Fillers Work?"},{"t":"p","x":"Once injected, HA fillers fill in gaps beneath the skin, targeting wrinkles, volume loss, and tired-looking skin. They also attract water molecules, providing deep hydration and improving skin elasticity. The result? Smoother, firmer, and naturally glowing skin—without the need for surgery or long recovery times."},{"t":"h2","x":"Benefits of Filler Injections"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Instant results: Noticeable improvement within 1-2 weeks"},{"x":"Non-surgical & minimal downtime: Resume daily activities immediately"},{"x":"Customizable treatment: Target specific areas for optimal enhancement"},{"x":"Hydrating & volumizing: Keeps skin plump, radiant, and youthful"},{"x":"Long-lasting but not permanent: Results last 6-18 months"}]},{"t":"h2","x":"3 Things to Know Before Your First Filler Treatment"},{"t":"h3","x":"1. Fillers Last Long, But Not Forever"},{"t":"p","x":"HA fillers naturally break down over time, with results lasting 6-18 months, depending on individual factors. For longer-lasting effects, periodic touch-ups are recommended."},{"t":"h3","x":"2. Results Vary for Each Person"},{"t":"p","x":"Skin type, lifestyle, and the type of filler used affect the outcome. A consultation with a doctor ensures a personalized approach for the best natural-looking results."},{"t":"h3","x":"3. Proper Preparation Improves Results"},{"t":"p","x":"Before your appointment:✔️ Avoid blood-thinning medications & supplements✔️ Refrain from alcohol consumption✔️ Get enough rest to minimize bruising and swelling"},{"t":"h3","x":"Filler Injection Areas & Aftercare Guide"},{"t":"p","x":"At Apex, we offer a variety of filler treatments to help you achieve smooth, youthful, and well-contoured skin. Our expert doctors provide personalized consultations to determine the best approach for each individual."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Filler-injection-position-en.webp","alt":"Filler injection position"},{"t":"h2","x":"Where Can Filler Be Injected?"},{"t":"p","x":"Fillers can be used to restore volume, smooth out wrinkles, and enhance facial features. Popular areas include:"},{"t":"p","x":"✔ Forehead – Creates a naturally rounded, youthful forehead (2-6 CC)✔ Temples – Fills hollow temples for a balanced face shape (1-4 CC per side)✔ Under Eyes – Reduces dark circles and tear troughs (1-2 CC per side)✔ Cheeks – Adds volume for a fuller, healthier look (1-3 CC per side)✔ Nasolabial Folds (Smile Lines) – Softens deep lines for a youthful appearance (1-2 CC per side)✔ Chin – Enhances and sculpts the chin for facial harmony (1-3 CC)✔ Lips – Creates plump, well-defined lips (1-2 CC)✔ Intimate Areas (Female & Male) – Enhances volume & confidence (5-10 CC for women, 10-20 CC for men)"},{"t":"p","x":"Fillers can also be injected in other areas, such as the jawline, marionette lines, and neck, depending on individual needs. A consultation with a doctor is essential to determine the most suitable treatment."},{"t":"h2","x":"How to Take Care of Your Skin After Filler Injections"},{"t":"p","x":"Proper aftercare is crucial to enhance results, reduce swelling, and minimize risks. Follow these steps:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Apply a cold compress to reduce swelling and redness."},{"x":"Avoid touching, pressing, or massaging the treated area."},{"x":"Stay away from heat exposure, such as saunas and hot showers."},{"x":"Drink plenty of water and use hydrating skincare products."},{"x":"Avoid alcohol & smoking for at least 2-3 days post-treatment."},{"x":"Maintain a healthy diet and be mindful of possible allergic reactions."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Precautions & Safety Considerations"},{"t":"p","x":"While filler injections are safe and effective, it’s essential to follow precautions for the best results:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Choose a reputable clinic with certified doctors."},{"x":"Disclose medical history & allergies before treatment."},{"x":"Follow pre- & post-procedure guidelines provided by your doctor."},{"x":"Never self-inject or use unverified practitioners to avoid serious risks."},{"x":"Mild side effects like swelling, redness, and tightness are normal, but if you experience severe reactions, seek medical attention immediately."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose Apex for Filler Injections?"},{"t":"p","x":"A trusted name in aesthetic treatments, Apex ensures safety, professionalism, and high-quality results:"},{"t":"p","x":"✔ Certified Doctors – Our specialists are registered with the Medical Council.✔ Customized Treatment Plans – Tailored procedures for optimal results.✔ Convenient Locations – Over 54 branches nationwide for easy access.✔ Hygienic & Safe Clinics – Strict sterilization and safety standards.✔ Proven Results – Genuine client reviews and before-after transformations."},{"t":"p","x":"At Apex, we’re committed to delivering natural, long-lasting beauty enhancements. If you’re considering filler injections, book a consultation today and let our experts guide you toward a more youthful, confident look!"},{"t":"h2","x":"Is Filler Injection Worth It? What Are the Benefits?"},{"t":"p","x":"Filler injection is a worthwhile option for those looking to enhance facial contours, hydrate the skin, and reduce wrinkles effectively. It delivers quick results without the need for surgery or downtime. The key benefits of fillers include:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Natural-looking results – Adds volume, smoothens the skin, and enhances facial harmony."},{"x":"Boosts confidence – Corrects concerns such as deep nasolabial folds, under-eye hollows, or a receding chin."},{"x":"Customizable treatment – Can be applied to specific areas like the forehead, temples, lips, or chin for a well-balanced appearance."},{"x":"Non-surgical & minimal downtime – A safe and efficient procedure with a quick recovery time."},{"x":"Long-lasting effects – High-quality fillers can last between 6 to 18 months, depending on the type used."}]},{"t":"p","x":"For the best results, it’s essential to choose a certified clinic and a skilled practitioner to ensure safety and satisfaction."},{"t":"h2","x":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"What Are the Side Effects of Dermal Fillers?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"After the procedure, some mild side effects may occur, including:"},{"t":"p","x":"✔️ Temporary redness and swelling ✔️ Minor bruising at the injection site ✔️ Tightness or mild discomfort"},{"t":"p","x":"These effects typically subside within 1-3 days. However, if you experience severe reactions, consult your doctor immediately for proper guidance."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How Long Does It Take to See Filler Results?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"The effects of filler injections are visible immediately after the procedure. However, the final results become more defined within 1-2 weeks as the filler fully integrates with your skin. Results may vary depending on:"},{"t":"li","x":"The treatment area"},{"t":"li","x":"The amount of filler used"},{"t":"li","x":"Individual skin type and metabolism"}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Does Filler Injection Hurt?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Some people experience slight discomfort during the injection process, often described as a mild stinging sensation. However, modern filler treatments often include anesthetic agents to minimize pain and enhance comfort."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How Long Does It Take for Fillers to Settle?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Hyaluronic acid fillers typically settle and fully integrate within 7-14 days. During this period, it is essential to avoid excessive pressure or strong facial massages to ensure optimal results."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"What Foods Should You Avoid After Filler Injections?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"To reduce inflammation and maintain filler longevity, avoid:"},{"t":"li","x":"Alcohol"},{"t":"li","x":"Spicy foods"},{"t":"li","x":"Fermented foods"},{"t":"li","x":"Very hot meals"},{"t":"p","x":"Additionally, refrain from taking blood-thinning medications such as aspirin and vitamin E unless prescribed by a doctor."}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Our Exclusive Clients"},{"t":"gallery","items":["~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Temporal-filler-injection-review-02-en.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Temporal-filler-injection-review-en.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Temporal-filler-injection-review-03-en.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Review-facial-filler-injections-en.webp"]},{"t":"p","x":"Results may vary from person to person."}]},"harmonyca":{"title":"HArmonyCA","desc":"HArmonyCA transforms dull skin into a bright one. It is one of the hottest hybrid filler technologies that helps reduce wrinkles, stimulates collagen production","date":"01/02/2025","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/HArmonyCA-cover.webp","alt":"HArmonyCA Cover"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/HarmonyCa-คืออะไร-เหมาะกับใคร-ก่อนฉีดควรรู้อะไรบ้าง.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/HArmonyCA-cover.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"HArmonyCA: The Next-Gen Filler for Collagen Stimulation & Facial Lifting"},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/what-is-HArmonyCA-en.webp","alt":"what is HArmonyCA"},{"t":"h2","x":"What is HArmonyCA?"},{"t":"p","x":"HArmonyCA is a hybrid filler that combines Hyaluronic Acid (HA) and Calcium Hydroxyapatite (CaHA) to provide both volumizing effects and collagen stimulation. This advanced formula helps lift and firm the skin while restoring elasticity and radiance."},{"t":"h2","x":"How Does HArmonyCA Work?"},{"t":"p","x":"This innovative hybrid filler offers a dual-action approach:"},{"t":"p","x":"1. Instant Volume & Hydration","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Hyaluronic Acid (HA) fills deep wrinkles, such as nasolabial folds and sunken cheeks."},{"x":"Enhances moisture retention, making the skin plumper and smoother.Provides an immediate lifting effect."}]},{"t":"p","x":"2. Long-Term Collagen Stimulation","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Calcium Hydroxyapatite (CaHA) triggers natural collagen production, strengthening skin structure."},{"x":"Helps firm sagging skin, refine texture, and gradually reduce fine lines over time.Provides a long-lasting lifting effect."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Benefits of HArmonyCA"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Instant & long-lasting results – Fills deep wrinkles while lifting and firming."},{"x":"Stimulates collagen production – Encourages long-term skin rejuvenation."},{"x":"Results last 12-18 months – Longer-lasting than traditional fillers."},{"x":"Customizable & natural-looking – Enhances facial volume without stiffness."},{"x":"Minimized discomfort – Contains Lidocaine, reducing injection pain."},{"x":"Versatile application – Suitable for cheeks, jawline, and chin."},{"x":"Clinically safe – Approved by Thailand’s FDA for safety and efficacy."}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/HArmonyCA-for-whom-en.webp","alt":"HArmonyCA for whom"},{"t":"h2","x":"Who Is HArmonyCA For?"},{"t":"p","x":"✔️ Individuals with deep wrinkles (nasolabial folds, sunken cheeks, sagging chin).✔️ Those experiencing mild to moderate skin laxity seeking a non-surgical facelift.✔️ People looking for a longer-lasting filler with collagen-boosting effects.✔️ Those wanting a natural and well-balanced facial enhancement.✔️ Busy individuals who need a low-maintenance skin-rejuvenation solution."},{"t":"h2","x":"How is HArmonyCA Different from Regular Fillers?"},{"t":"p","x":"Unlike traditional fillers that only contain HA for volume, HArmonyCA offers both volumization and collagen stimulation, leading to a longer-lasting and more comprehensive facial rejuvenation."},{"t":"h2","x":"Pre-Treatment Preparation"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Avoid aspirin, ibuprofen, vitamin E, and fish oil 1 week before the procedure."},{"x":"Refrain from alcohol consumption 24 hours before the injection."},{"x":"Avoid laser treatments or facial scrubs 1 week before."},{"x":"Get adequate rest (6-8 hours of sleep) the night before the treatment."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Post-Treatment Care"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Avoid touching or massaging the treated area for 24 hours."},{"x":"Refrain from intense exercise or sauna sessions for 48 hours."},{"x":"Protect your skin from direct sunlight and excessive heat for a week."},{"x":"If slight swelling occurs, apply a cold compress gently."},{"x":"Stay hydrated to enhance the effects of Hyaluronic Acid."},{"x":"If unusual swelling, redness, or pain occurs, contact your doctor immediately."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose Apex for HArmonyCA?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Certified & Trusted Clinic – We adhere to high safety standards in Thailand."},{"x":"Expert Doctors – Specialists trained in advanced dermal filler techniques."},{"x":"Convenient Locations – Easy access to our clinics for a seamless experience."},{"x":"Personalized Approach – Tailored treatments for natural-looking results."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"What is the ideal age for HArmonyCA?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Suitable for individuals 25 years and older, particularly those with fine lines, volume loss, or mild sagging."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Does the injection hurt?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Minimally painful – The formula contains Lidocaine, a local anesthetic for comfort."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Can it fix severe sagging?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"It effectively lifts mild to moderate sagging, but for severe cases, additional treatments may be required."}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"What is the HACa™ Program ?"},{"t":"yt","id":"1MlH8d1spQQ"},{"t":"h2","x":"Our Exclusive Clients"},{"t":"gallery","items":["~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/HArmonyCA-review-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/HArmonyCA-review-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/HArmonyCA-review-01.webp"]},{"t":"p","x":"Results may vary from person to person."}]},"hormone-therapy":{"title":"Hormone Therapy","desc":"Hormone therapy solves physical and sexual health problems through the Hormone Therapy program, repairs, replenishes, and balances the body through hormone therapy.","date":"01/02/2024","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hormone-therapy-cover.webp","alt":"ฮอร์โมนบำบัด"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hormone-therapy.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hormone-therapy-cover.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Hormone Therapy: The Key to Restoring Balance and Enhancing Well-being"},{"t":"p","x":"Hormones play a crucial role in regulating various bodily functions, including metabolism, mood, emotions, and organ functions. However, when hormonal balance is disrupted, it can lead to various health issues. In this article, we will explore hormone therapy, a solution designed to restore hormonal balance and improve overall health, helping individuals make informed decisions about their wellness journey."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/what-is-hormone-therapy.webp","alt":"ฮอร์โมนบำบัด คือ"},{"t":"h2","x":"What is Hormone Therapy?"},{"t":"p","x":"Hormone therapy (HT) is a treatment that involves the use of hormones or hormone-affecting medications to regulate or inhibit hormonal activity in the body. It is commonly used to treat hormonal imbalances linked to certain conditions such as breast cancer, prostate cancer, and age-related hormonal changes."},{"t":"h2","x":"Types of Hormone Therapy"},{"t":"p","x":"Hormone therapy is available in multiple forms, tailored to individual needs and treatment goals. Here are the most common types:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Injectable Hormone Therapy: Delivers rapid and highly effective results, requiring administration every 1-4 weeks."},{"x":"Oral Hormone Therapy: A convenient option taken daily, though it may have a slower onset compared to injections."},{"x":"Transdermal Patches: Provide steady hormone release through the skin, reducing liver-related side effects."},{"x":"Topical Gels & Creams: Ensure consistent hormone levels but require caution to prevent skin contact with others."},{"x":"Hormone Implants: Long-term solutions that release hormones over several months, reducing the need for frequent medication."}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hormone-therapy-for-cancer.webp","alt":"ฮอร์โมนบำบัด"},{"t":"h2","x":"Hormone Therapy for Cancer Treatment"},{"t":"p","x":"Hormone therapy is widely used in treating hormone-sensitive cancers:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Breast Cancer: Certain breast cancers grow in response to estrogen and progesterone. Hormone therapy blocks these hormones to slow cancer progression."},{"x":"Prostate Cancer: Prostate cancer thrives on testosterone. Hormone therapy reduces testosterone levels to hinder cancer growth."}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hormone-therapy-for-menopause.webp","alt":"ฮอร์โมนบำบัด"},{"t":"h2","x":"Hormone Therapy for Menopause and Andropause"},{"t":"h3","x":"Hormone Therapy for Women (Menopause Treatment)"},{"t":"p","x":"As women approach menopause (typically between ages 45-55), estrogen and progesterone levels decline, leading to symptoms such as hot flashes, night sweats, mood swings, vaginal dryness, and osteoporosis."},{"t":"p","x":"Treatment options include:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Estrogen Therapy: Suitable for women who have had a hysterectomy, available as pills, patches, gels, or sprays."},{"x":"Combination Estrogen-Progesterone Therapy: Recommended for women with an intact uterus to reduce the risk of endometrial cancer."},{"x":"Localized Hormone Therapy: Includes vaginal creams or gels to relieve vaginal dryness."},{"x":"Bioidentical Hormones: Structurally identical to natural hormones, offering personalized solutions."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Hormone Therapy for Men (Andropause Treatment)"},{"t":"p","x":"Testosterone levels in men decline after the age of 40, leading to symptoms like fatigue, reduced energy, sexual dysfunction, mood changes, and muscle loss."},{"t":"p","x":"Treatment options include:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Testosterone Injections: Fast-acting and available in short-term and long-term formulations."},{"x":"Testosterone Gels: Absorbed through the skin for gradual hormone release."},{"x":"Testosterone Patches: Provide continuous hormone delivery."},{"x":"Oral Testosterone: Less commonly used due to potential liver effects."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Hormone Therapy for Gender Transition"},{"t":"p","x":"Hormone therapy plays a vital role in aligning physical characteristics with gender identity for transgender individuals."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hormone-therapy-for-transgender.webp","alt":"ฮอร์โมนบำบัดข้ามเพศ"},{"t":"h3","x":"Hormone Therapy for Transgender Women (MTF)"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Estrogen Therapy: Enhances breast development, smoothens skin, and reduces body hair."},{"x":"Anti-Androgens: Suppress testosterone production for a more feminine appearance."},{"x":"Progesterone (Optional): May aid in breast development and mood stabilization."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Hormone Therapy for Transgender Men (FTM)"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Testosterone Therapy: Stimulates body hair growth, deepens the voice, and increases muscle mass."},{"x":"Expected Timeline of Changes:3-6 months: Increased body hair, acne, and voice deepening.6-12 months: Muscle growth, cessation of menstruation.1-2 years: Chest and facial hair growth, permanent voice deepening."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Pros and Considerations of Hormone Therapy"},{"t":"p","x":"Benefits:","lead":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Restores hormonal balance and improves quality of life."},{"x":"Alleviates menopause and andropause symptoms."},{"x":"Supports cancer treatment for hormone-sensitive tumors."},{"x":"Facilitates gender transition."},{"x":"Provides anti-aging benefits, enhancing skin health and vitality."},{"x":"Strengthens bone health and prevents osteoporosis."},{"x":"Enhances sexual health and performance."}]},{"t":"p","x":"Considerations:","lead":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Requires medical supervision to prevent side effects."},{"x":"May increase the risk of blood clots (especially with estrogen therapy)."},{"x":"Possible link to certain cancers (e.g., breast and prostate cancer)."},{"x":"Potential cardiovascular risks, including heart disease and high blood pressure."},{"x":"Possible weight gain, mood swings, and fertility reduction."},{"x":"Not suitable for individuals with pre-existing heart, liver, or vascular conditions."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"Is It Safe to Take Hormones Without Medical Supervision?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"No. Self-medicating with hormones can lead to serious health complications. Hormone levels vary among individuals, making professional evaluation essential. Always consult a specialist to assess your needs and monitor your treatment safely."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Are Birth Control Pills Considered Hormone Therapy?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Yes. Birth control pills contain estrogen and/or progesterone to prevent pregnancy. Some transgender women use them as a form of hormone therapy, though this is not recommended due to potential side effects."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How to Balance Hormones Naturally?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Hormonal imbalance can affect overall health and well-being. To naturally restore balance, try:"},{"t":"li","x":"Getting enough sleep – Helps regulate hormone production"},{"t":"li","x":"Eating a healthy diet – Reduce sugar and processed foods, and include protein, healthy fats, and fiber"},{"t":"li","x":"Exercising regularly – A mix of cardio and strength training supports hormonal health"},{"t":"li","x":"Managing stress – Meditation, yoga, and relaxation techniques can help"}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How Long Does Hormone Therapy Take?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"The duration of hormone therapy depends on individual needs and treatment goals. Regular medical evaluations ensure optimal results and necessary adjustments."}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose Hormone Therapy at Apex Medical Center?"},{"t":"p","x":"Apex Medical Center offers premium hormone therapy services with the following advantages:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Expert Medical Team: Specialists in hormone therapy provide personalized care and professional consultations."},{"x":"Customized Treatment Plans: Tailored hormone solutions based on individual health needs."},{"x":"Certified and Safe Hormones: FDA-approved, high-quality hormone treatments."},{"x":"Proven Results: Real success stories from satisfied clients."}]},{"t":"p","x":"Achieve optimal hormonal balance and improve your overall well-being with Apex Medical Center. For more information, contact us through any of our channels. We look forward to assisting you!"},{"t":"p","x":"Results may vary based on individual condition"}]},"laser-hair-removal":{"title":"Laser Hair Removal","desc":"Transform your skin into smooth skin with laser hair removal, a long-term hair removal method that is suitable for all skin types.","date":"26/01/2024","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Laser-Hair-Removal-cover.webp","alt":"เลเซอร์ขน Apex"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Laser-Hair-Removal-ch-05.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Laser-Hair-Removal-cover.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Laser Hair Removal: A Popular Choice for Smooth, Hair-Free Skin"},{"t":"p","x":"Ever wondered why laser hair removal is such a popular choice? If you’re looking for an effective way to say goodbye to unwanted hair, this guide will help you understand what laser hair removal is, how it works, its benefits, and why it has become a top choice for many."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/What-is-laser-hair-removal-en.webp","alt":"What is laser hair removal"},{"t":"h2","x":"What is Laser Hair Removal?"},{"t":"p","x":"Laser hair removal is an advanced technology that uses laser light to target and destroy melanin in the hair follicles. This process inhibits hair growth over time, leading to finer, lighter, and fewer hairs."},{"t":"h2","x":"How Does Laser Hair Removal Work?"},{"t":"h3","x":"Targeting Hair Follicles"},{"t":"p","x":"High-intensity laser beams are absorbed by melanin in the hair follicle, generating heat that effectively destroys the follicle’s ability to grow hair. Over time, treated hairs naturally fall out."},{"t":"h3","x":"Protecting the Skin"},{"t":"p","x":"Modern laser devices include cooling systems or gels to minimize discomfort and prevent skin irritation during the treatment, making it a safe and comfortable experience."},{"t":"h3","x":"Disrupting the Hair Growth Cycle"},{"t":"p","x":"Laser treatment targets hair in the anagen (growth) phase when the hair is still attached to the follicle. Repeated sessions gradually reduce hair regrowth, leading to smoother skin without ingrown hairs, stubble, or irritation from shaving or waxing."},{"t":"h2","x":"Benefits & Things to Know About Laser Hair Removal"},{"t":"h3","x":"Benefits:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Long-Term Hair Reduction – Significant hair reduction after 5-6 sessions, depending on individual hair growth."},{"x":"Works on Various Body Areas – Effective for the face, underarms, arms, legs, bikini line, and more."},{"x":"Reduces Ingrown Hairs – Helps prevent painful ingrown hairs and stubble from shaving or waxing."},{"x":"Smoother Skin – Improves skin texture and reduces dark spots caused by friction or shaving."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Things to Consider:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Requires Multiple Sessions – For optimal results, multiple sessions are necessary."},{"x":"Mild Discomfort – Feels like a slight rubber band snap, but cooling technology minimizes discomfort."},{"x":"Avoid Sun Exposure – Protect skin from direct sunlight before and after treatment to prevent irritation."}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Popular-Areas-for-Laser-Hair-Removal-en.webp","alt":"Popular Areas for Laser Hair Removal"},{"t":"h2","x":"Popular Areas for Laser Hair Removal"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Underarms – Reduces sweat buildup and odor while keeping skin smooth."},{"x":"Legs – Eliminates ingrown hairs and thick regrowth after shaving."},{"x":"Bikini Area & Brazilian – Enhances hygiene and confidence."},{"x":"Face & Upper Lip – Removes fine hair for clearer, more radiant skin."},{"x":"Beard & Neck – Minimizes shaving frequency and reduces irritation."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"5 Essential Steps to Prepare for Laser Hair Removal"},{"t":"list","o":true,"items":[{"x":"Avoid Plucking or Waxing – Stop waxing or plucking at least 2-4 weeks before treatment to ensure the follicles remain intact."},{"x":"Skip Harsh Skincare Products – Avoid AHA/BHA-based skincare products for at least one week before treatment."},{"x":"Minimize Sun Exposure – Stay out of direct sunlight for at least 1-2 weeks before your appointment."},{"x":"Shave the Treatment Area – Shave the targeted area 1-2 days before treatment for better laser penetration."},{"x":"Inform Your Technician About Medications – Some medications can make your skin more sensitive to laser treatment."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Post-Treatment Care Tips"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Avoid Sun Exposure – Apply sunscreen and avoid direct sunlight for at least 1-2 weeks."},{"x":"Let Hair Shed Naturally – Do not pluck, wax, or shave between sessions."},{"x":"Use Gentle Skincare – Moisturize with fragrance-free products to prevent irritation."},{"x":"Skip Hot Showers & Saunas – Avoid heat exposure for at least 48 hours post-treatment."},{"x":"Monitor Skin Reactions – If redness or irritation persists for more than 2-3 days, consult a specialist."}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Top-Laser-Hair-Removal-Machines-en.webp","alt":"Laser Hair Removal"},{"t":"h2","x":"Top Laser Hair Removal Technologies"},{"t":"p","x":"Different laser types suit different skin tones and hair textures. Here are three of the most widely used laser technologies:"},{"t":"h3","x":"Diode Laser"},{"t":"p","x":"Suitable for most skin types, especially fair to medium tones."},{"t":"h3","x":"IPL (Intense Pulsed Light)"},{"t":"p","x":"Not a true laser but effective for hair reduction and skin rejuvenation."},{"t":"h3","x":"ND:YAG Laser"},{"t":"p","x":"Ideal for darker skin tones and thick hair, penetrating deeper into the follicles."},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose Apex for Laser Hair Removal?"},{"t":"p","x":"At Apex, we offer top-tier laser hair removal services backed by the latest technology and expert care."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Certified Skin Specialists – Our trained professionals ensure safe and effective treatments."},{"x":"FDA-Approved Laser Equipment – We use advanced laser machines that meet medical safety standards."},{"x":"Personalized Skin Assessments – Customized treatment plans tailored to your skin and hair type."},{"x":"Hygienic & Sterile Environment – High-standard cleanliness and equipment sterilization."},{"x":"Proven Results & Client Reviews – Trusted by thousands with positive testimonials."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"Is Laser Hair Removal Painful?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Most clients describe it as a light rubber band snap. Advanced cooling technology makes the process more comfortable."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Is Laser Hair Removal Permanent?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"While not completely permanent, it significantly reduces hair growth long-term. Regular maintenance sessions enhance lasting results."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Do I Need to Shave Before Treatment?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Yes, shave the targeted area 1-2 days before your session to allow better laser absorption."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Can Pregnant Women Get Laser Hair Removal?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"It’s not recommended during pregnancy due to hormonal fluctuations that may affect treatment efficacy."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How Many Sessions Do I Need?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Most clients see results within the first session, but 5-8 treatments are recommended for the best outcome."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How Often Should I Get Laser Hair Removal?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Treatments are typically scheduled every 4-6 weeks, depending on the hair growth cycle."}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Conclusion: Laser Hair Removal for Smooth, Hair-Free Skin"},{"t":"p","x":"Laser hair removal is a highly effective, long-term solution for reducing unwanted hair. It works by targeting the root of the hair follicle, ensuring smoother skin with minimal regrowth. Suitable for various body areas, it helps eliminate ingrown hairs, irritation, and shaving discomfort."},{"t":"p","x":"For the best results, Apex provides expert treatments using advanced technology. Book your session today and enjoy long-lasting, silky-smooth skin"},{"t":"h2","x":"Our Exclusive Clients"},{"t":"gallery","items":["~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Armpit-hair-laser-review-04.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Leg-hair-laser-review-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Leg-hair-laser-review-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Leg-hair-laser-review-04.webp"]},{"t":"p","x":"Results may vary from person to person."}]},"micro-boost":{"title":"Hair Loss Treatment","desc":"Treat hair loss, thinning hair, Micro Boost program can help you. Technology that helps stimulate new hair growth, reduce hair loss.","date":"13/01/2024","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/micro-boost-program-cover.webp","alt":"รักษาผมร่วง"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/micro-boost-program.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/micro-boost-program-cover.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Hair Loss Treatment & Hair Regrowth with Micro Boost Technology"},{"t":"p","x":"Hair loss and thinning hair are common concerns caused by genetics, hormones, or external factors. Fortunately, modern technology offers effective solutions. One of the most advanced treatments is Micro Boost Technology, a revolutionary method that stimulates hair regrowth, making hair appear fuller, healthier, and stronger."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/what-is-micro-boost.webp","alt":"โปรแกรม Micro Boost รักษาผมร่วง คืออะไร"},{"t":"h2","x":"What is the Micro Boost Hair Loss Treatment?"},{"t":"p","x":"Micro Boost is a specialized treatment that uses Microneedling technology to stimulate collagen production and blood circulation in the scalp. Tiny micro-needles create controlled micro-injuries, encouraging new hair growth while strengthening existing hair strands. This treatment can be combined with Platelet-Rich Plasma (PRP) or nutrient-rich serums to enhance hair restoration and maximize results."},{"t":"p","x":"By improving scalp blood flow, Micro Boost ensures that oxygen and essential nutrients reach the hair follicles, helping weak or dormant follicles regenerate. This process reduces hair shedding and boosts natural hair growth, making it ideal for those experiencing early-stage hair thinning or hair loss due to nutritional deficiencies, stress, or other factors."},{"t":"h2","x":"How Does Microneedling for Hair Loss Work?"},{"t":"p","x":"Step 1: Microneedling StimulationA micro-needle device is used to create tiny punctures in the scalp, triggering the body’s natural healing response. This promotes collagen and elastin production, essential proteins that support stronger, healthier hair growth."},{"t":"p","x":"Step 2: Growth Factors ApplicationAfter microneedling, growth factor serums are applied to nourish the hair follicles, accelerating hair regrowth and strengthening weak hair roots."},{"t":"p","x":"Step 3: Essential Nutrient InfusionTo ensure sustainable hair health, vital vitamins, minerals, and proteins are infused into the scalp, enhancing hair strength, thickness, and resilience."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/who-should-do-micro-boost.webp","alt":"ใครบ้างที่ควรทำโปรแกรม Micro Boost"},{"t":"h2","x":"Who is Micro Boost Hair Restoration Suitable For?"},{"t":"p","x":"✔ Individuals with hair thinning or excessive hair sheddingCaused by hormonal changes, stress, nutritional deficiencies, or harsh hair products.✔ People experiencing hereditary hair loss (Androgenic Alopecia)A common condition in both men and women.✔ Individuals with weak, brittle hairHair that lacks strength or density can benefit from collagen stimulation.✔ Those seeking to promote new hair growthIdeal for early-stage hair loss, where hair follicles are still active."},{"t":"h2","x":"Who Should Avoid Microneedling for Hair Loss?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"People with scalp conditions (eczema, psoriasis, or open wounds)"},{"x":"Individuals with blood clotting disorders or on blood-thinning medications"},{"x":"Pregnant or breastfeeding women (due to limited safety data)"},{"x":"Those allergic to metal (nickel sensitivity)"}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Is-micro-boost-different-for-men-and-women.webp","alt":"รักษาผมร่วง"},{"t":"h2","x":"Differences Between Micro Boost for Men vs. Women"},{"t":"p","x":"Treatment Areas:Men typically focus on the hairline and crown, while women target overall thinning areas, especially the center part."},{"t":"p","x":"Needle Depth:Men often require deeper penetration due to thicker scalps, while women may need a gentler approach."},{"t":"p","x":"Number of Sessions:Men may require more sessions since male pattern baldness tends to be more severe than female hair thinning."},{"t":"h2","x":"How to Prepare for a Micro Boost Hair Regrowth Treatment"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Consult a specialist to assess your hair and scalp condition."},{"x":"Avoid certain medications (especially blood thinners) before treatment."},{"x":"Cleanse your scalp 1 day before the procedure."},{"x":"Avoid hair styling products (hair spray, dry shampoo, heavy serums) before treatment."},{"x":"Skip other chemical hair treatments (coloring, straightening) for 1-2 weeks prior to the session."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Micro Boost Hair Loss Treatment Process"},{"t":"p","x":"Step 1: Consultation and scalp analysisStep 2: Cleansing the scalp to remove buildupStep 3: Microneedling to stimulate hair folliclesStep 4: Application of hair growth serums or PRPStep 5: Post-treatment care and aftercare instructions"},{"t":"h2","x":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"Is Micro Boost painful?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Mild discomfort may occur, but it’s minimized by expert techniques."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"When will I see results?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Visible improvement starts within 4-6 weeks, with optimal results after 2-4 sessions."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How many sessions are needed?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Typically 4-6 treatments, spaced 2-4 weeks apart for best results."}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose Micro Boost at Apex Hair Center?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Experienced hair specialists trained in advanced hair restoration techniques."},{"x":"Personalized treatment plans tailored to individual hair loss conditions."},{"x":"Cutting-edge technology ensuring safe, effective, and long-lasting results."},{"x":"Comprehensive follow-up care for sustained hair health."}]},{"t":"p","x":"Take control of your hair loss and regain thicker, healthier hair with Micro Boost Technology.📞 Book a Free Consultation Today!"}]},"nose-surgery":{"title":"Which Rhinoplasty Technique is Best? Suitable Methods with Updated Reviews and Latest Prices","desc":"Rhinoplasty can enhance nose shape and facial balance. Compare techniques, suitable nose shapes, patient reviews, prices, and key factors before surgery.","date":"27/11/2024","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Which-Rhinoplasty-Technique-is-Best_-Suitable-Methods-with-Updated-Reviews-and-Latest-Prices.webp","alt":"Which Rhinoplasty Technique is Best_ Suitable Methods with Updated Reviews and Latest Prices"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Which-Rhinoplasty-Technique-is-Best_-Suitable-Methods-with-Updated-Reviews-and-Latest-Prices.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Which-Rhinoplasty-Technique-is-Best_-Suitable-Methods-with-Updated-Reviews-and-Latest-Prices.webp","blocks":[{"t":"p","x":"Rhinoplasty is a highly popular cosmetic surgery designed to adjust the facial structure for better dimension and balance. Today, rhinoplasty technologies and techniques have advanced significantly, offering a variety of programs to choose from. Each method is suited to different original nose structures, skin conditions, and individual needs. Choosing the right technique for your specific concerns ensures that the results meet your expectations. Today, we will explore the different types of rhinoplasty, the techniques available, and who each one is suitable for."},{"t":"h2","x":"What is Rhinoplasty?"},{"t":"p","x":"Rhinoplasty is a surgical procedure to reshape and restructure the nose to improve its appearance and balance it with other facial features. Whether it is raising the nasal bridge, refining the tip, correcting a crooked or deviated nose, or reducing the size of the nostrils (Alarplasty), the goal is to achieve a natural-looking result that enhances the individual’s personality."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Rhinoplasty-Techniques-Which-One-is-Right-for-You.webp","alt":""},{"t":"h2","x":"Rhinoplasty Techniques: Which One is Right for You?"},{"t":"p","x":"Beyond choosing the desired shape, the surgical technique is a crucial factor directly affecting the success of the surgery. Currently, there are several techniques used to address different structural issues:"},{"t":"h3","x":"Closed Rhinoplasty"},{"t":"p","x":"This technique involves making incisions entirely inside the nostrils, leaving no visible external scars. The advantages include a shorter surgery time and less swelling or bruising, leading to a faster recovery. It is ideal for those who only need to raise the bridge or make minor structural adjustments."},{"t":"h3","x":"Open Rhinoplasty"},{"t":"p","x":"In this technique, the surgeon makes an incision across the columella (the base of the nose) which connects to internal incisions. This allows the surgeon to lift the skin and clearly see the internal structure. It enables precise adjustments for complex cases, such as bone rasping, tip reconstruction, or using rib cartilage. It is suitable for revision cases or individuals with complex structural problems."},{"t":"h3","x":"Semi-Open Rhinoplasty"},{"t":"p","x":"A middle-ground technique between Closed and Open. Incisions are made inside both nostrils, providing more space for the surgeon to work and visualize the structure than a standard closed technique. This allows for more accurate tip adjustment and silicone placement. It is suitable for those who need tip refinement but do not have highly complex structural issues."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Materials-Used-in-Rhinoplasty.webp","alt":""},{"t":"h2","x":"Materials Used in Rhinoplasty"},{"t":"p","x":"Choosing the right material is vital for the beauty and long-term durability of the result. Materials include both synthetic options and the patient’s own biological tissue. A surgeon will evaluate the most suitable choice based on individual anatomy."},{"t":"h3","x":"Silicone"},{"t":"p","x":"The most popular material because it is easy to mold and comes in various grades. Medical-grade silicone is highly flexible and biocompatible. It can be removed or adjusted in the future. It is ideal for those wanting a beautifully shaped, natural-looking high bridge."},{"t":"h3","x":"Ear Cartilage"},{"t":"p","x":"A natural material often used in conjunction with silicone, specifically at the nasal tip. It helps reduce pressure from the silicone, preventing the skin from thinning or the implant from perforating (poking through) in the future. Since it is the patient’s own tissue, there is no risk of allergic reaction or rejection."},{"t":"h3","x":"Rib Cartilage"},{"t":"p","x":"A popular material for Structural Rhinoplasty. It is ideal for those with very little nasal tissue, those who want a very high projection, or those who have had multiple previous surgeries (revisions). Rib cartilage is very strong and highly versatile but requires a highly skilled surgeon to harvest and shape."},{"t":"h3","x":"Synthetic Tissue (Acellular Dermal Matrix)"},{"t":"p","x":"A biological material designed to add softness to the nasal tip and act as a buffer between the silicone and the skin. It is perfect for individuals with thin skin or those who have experienced redness at the tip from previous implants."},{"t":"h3","x":"Hybrid Technique"},{"t":"p","x":"This technique combines the benefits of silicone and cartilage—usually silicone for the bridge and ear cartilage for the tip. This increases strength and safety against perforation while providing a soft, natural look."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Which-Technique-Suits-Your-Specific-Problem.webp","alt":"Which Technique Suits Your Specific Problem?"},{"t":"h2","x":"Which Technique Suits Your Specific Problem?"},{"t":"p","x":"Identifying the right surgical technique is essential to effectively address your unique nasal structure and achieve a perfectly balanced profile."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Want a slight increase in height: Closed technique is best as it doesn’t require major structural changes."},{"x":"Short, flat, or upturned tip: Semi-Open technique allows the surgeon to adjust the tip length for a more natural look."},{"x":"Crooked nose or deviated tip: Open technique provides full visibility to correct the underlying cartilage and bone structure."},{"x":"Short nose or very thin skin (perforation risk): Open technique combined with ear or rib cartilage to add strength and protection."},{"x":"Want a dimensional, “pointy” tip: Semi-Open technique allows for detailed tip adjustment with minimal scarring."},{"x":"Unbalanced structure (wide base, thick nostrils, or hump): Open technique combined with Alarplasty or hump reduction allows for comprehensive reconstruction."},{"x":"First-time surgery with minor adjustments: Closed technique offers safety, small wounds, and fast recovery."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Popular Nose Shapes"},{"t":"p","x":"Selecting the perfect nose shape is key to enhancing your natural beauty and achieving overall facial harmony. Discover today’s most popular styles, from subtle slopes to defined tips, to find the look that best suits your profile."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Natural Look: Harmonizes with the original face; not too high or sharp."},{"x":"Teardrop Shape: Features a rounded tip that drops slightly, creating a soft, feminine look."},{"x":"Elevated Tip: Slightly lifts the tip from the bridge to create a charming, youthful appearance."},{"x":"Slope with Pointy Tip: A beautiful curved slope leading to a clearly projected tip."},{"x":"Upturned (Barbie) Shape: A noticeably upturned tip that makes the face look bright and cute."},{"x":"Mantis (Sharp/Defined) Shape: Focuses on a very sharp bridge and a high, projected tip for a fierce, defined look."}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/How-to-Choose-the-Right-Rhinoplasty-for-You.webp","alt":""},{"t":"h2","x":"How to Choose the Right Rhinoplasty for You"},{"t":"p","x":"Choosing the ideal rhinoplasty program requires a careful balance between your unique facial structure and your personal aesthetic goals. This guide highlights the essential factors to consider, ensuring you select a procedure that delivers both beauty and long-term safety."},{"t":"list","o":true,"items":[{"x":"Consider original structure and flaws: Minor issues may only need Closed surgery; complex issues or revisions require Open surgery."},{"x":"Evaluate skin and tissue condition: Thin skin requires caution with silicone height; cartilage may be necessary to prevent thinning."},{"x":"Define your desired result: Communicate clearly with your doctor. If unsure, ask for a facial analysis."},{"x":"The Surgeon: Regardless of the technique, the surgeon’s skill in Plastic Surgery is the most critical factor for safety and beauty."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Who is suitable for Rhinoplasty?"},{"t":"p","x":"Rhinoplasty is ideal for healthy individuals seeking to enhance their facial harmony, boost self-confidence, or correct functional structural concerns. Understanding the criteria for candidacy is the first step toward achieving a successful transformation that aligns with your aesthetic goals."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"People wanting to boost confidence or balance facial proportions."},{"x":"Those concerned about a flat bridge, large tip, hump, or crooked nose."},{"x":"Those needing to correct deformities from accidents or genetics."},{"x":"Those with functional issues, such as difficulty breathing due to a deviated septum."},{"x":"Healthy individuals with no serious medical conditions."},{"x":"Individuals whose facial structure is fully developed (typically age 18+)."},{"x":"Those with realistic expectations."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Who is NOT Suitable for Rhinoplasty?"},{"t":"p","x":"While rhinoplasty offers transformative results, certain medical conditions, age factors, and lifestyle habits may make the procedure unsuitable for some. Evaluating these limitations is crucial to ensuring patient safety and avoiding potential complications throughout the surgical and recovery process."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"People with uncontrolled chronic diseases (Heart disease, high blood pressure, diabetes)."},{"x":"Individuals with bleeding disorders or those taking blood-thinning medications."},{"x":"Minors under 18–20 (whose facial bones are still growing)."},{"x":"Pregnant or breastfeeding women."},{"x":"People with active skin or nasal infections."},{"x":"Heavy smokers (as it hinders healing and increases infection risk)."},{"x":"Individuals with unrealistic expectations or Body Dysmorphic Disorder."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Benefits of Rhinoplasty"},{"t":"p","x":"Rhinoplasty offers more than just aesthetic improvements; it can significantly boost self-confidence and enhance nasal function. Discover how this procedure harmonizes your facial features while providing long-term benefits for your overall well-being."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Balances facial features."},{"x":"Boosts self-confidence and personality."},{"x":"Corrects structural flaws from birth or trauma."},{"x":"Improves breathing functions."},{"x":"Provides long-lasting results."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Precautions and Risks"},{"t":"p","x":"Understanding the potential risks and necessary precautions is an essential part of making an informed decision about surgery. Being aware of these factors helps you manage expectations and ensures a safer journey toward your desired results."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Post-op side effects: Swelling, bruising, pain, or temporary numbness."},{"x":"Infection risk: If post-op care is poor or the facility is substandard."},{"x":"Dissatisfaction: Results may vary due to original structural limitations."},{"x":"Implant migration: The material may shift if the nose is hit before it has settled."},{"x":"Perforation: Risk of the silicone poking through if it is too high for thin skin."},{"x":"Scar tissue (Fibrosis): Can cause the nose to change shape over time."},{"x":"Breathing issues: If internal structures are impacted during surgery."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Preparation Before Rhinoplasty"},{"t":"p","x":"Proper preparation is the foundation of a successful surgery and a smooth, uncomplicated recovery process. Following these essential guidelines will ensure your body is fully ready and optimized for your upcoming transformation."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Consult the surgeon: To evaluate structure and set realistic goals."},{"x":"Provide detailed health history: Allergies, chronic diseases, and all medications/supplements."},{"x":"Stop blood-thinning agents: Avoid Aspirin, Ibuprofen, Vitamin E, Fish Oil, and Ginkgo for at least 2 weeks."},{"x":"Stop smoking and alcohol: At least 2–4 weeks before surgery to ensure proper healing."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Steps of the Surgical Procedure"},{"t":"p","x":"Knowing what to expect during each stage of the operation can help ease anxiety and set clear expectations for the process. This section breaks down the professional steps taken by surgeons to ensure precision, safety, and aesthetic success."},{"t":"list","o":true,"items":[{"x":"Evaluation: The doctor analyzes the face and designs the shape."},{"x":"Preparation: Following pre-op instructions (fasting if necessary, stopping meds)."},{"x":"Surgery: The surgeon performs the procedure using the chosen technique and materials."},{"x":"Follow-up: Appointments to monitor healing and remove stitches."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Post-Operative Care Advice"},{"t":"p","x":"The final outcome of your rhinoplasty depends heavily on how well you care for yourself during the critical healing phase. Adhering to professional recovery tips will help minimize swelling, prevent complications, and protect your new nose shape."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Cold Compress: Use for the first few days (avoiding the wound) to reduce swelling."},{"x":"Sleep with head elevated: Use high pillows for 1–2 weeks to minimize swelling."},{"x":"Soft Diet: Eat easy-to-chew foods; avoid spicy, fermented, or seafood items that might cause inflammation."},{"x":"Avoid Impact: No heavy exercise or heavy lifting."},{"x":"Do not blow your nose hard: Pat dry gently or sneeze with your mouth open."},{"x":"No alcohol/smoking: For at least 1 month."},{"x":"Glasses caution: Avoid resting glasses on the bridge; use tape to support them on the forehead if necessary."},{"x":"Attend all appointments: For stitch removal and progress checks."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Choosing a Clinic: What to Look For?"},{"t":"p","x":"Selecting the right clinic is a vital decision that directly impacts both the safety and the beauty of your surgical results. Use these key criteria to identify a high-standard facility and an expert medical team you can fully trust."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Certified Surgeons: Verify the doctor’s plastic surgery license."},{"x":"Standards & Technology: Certified by the Ministry of Public Health with sterile operating rooms."},{"x":"Real Reviews: Look at before-and-after cases from actual patients."},{"x":"Detailed Consultation: The doctor should personally analyze your face and explain the plan."},{"x":"Aftercare: Continuous follow-up services."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"How Much Does Rhinoplasty Cost?"},{"t":"p","x":"The investment for rhinoplasty varies depending on the surgical technique, the complexity of the case, and the surgeon’s expertise. Get a clear overview of the current pricing to help you plan your budget for this life-changing procedure. Prices vary based on complexity and technique:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Closed Technique (Starting from 35,000.-): Focuses on the bridge, small incision, fast recovery."},{"x":"Open Technique (Starting from 120,000.-): Focuses on structural tip adjustment and correction."},{"x":"Open Rib Technique (300,000.-): 100% autologous (no silicone), highest safety, ideal for major revisions."}]},{"t":"p","x":"Note: Prices usually include hospital-standard operating room fees. A physical evaluation is required for an exact quote."},{"t":"h2","x":"Before & After Reviews Rhinoplasty"},{"t":"gallery","items":["~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-ken-New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-ken-New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-ken-New-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-fifa-New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-fifa-New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-fifa-New-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-milk-New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-milk-New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-milk-New-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-hmuy-New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-hmuy-New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-hmuy-New-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-carot-New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-carot-New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-carot-New-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-np-New-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-np-New-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/BA-Nose-np-New-03.webp"]},{"t":"p","x":"Results vary by individual. These examples represent outcomes for specific patients only."},{"t":"h2","x":"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) about Rhinoplasty"},{"t":"p","x":"Finding answers to common concerns is a crucial step in preparing for your cosmetic journey and making an informed decision. This section addresses the most frequently asked questions about rhinoplasty to provide clarity on recovery, safety, and expected results."},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"Does it hurt?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Local anesthesia or general anesthesia is used. You may feel pressure but not pain. Post-op soreness is manageable with meds."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How long for swelling to go down?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Major swelling lasts 3–7 days; it significantly subsides within 2–4 weeks."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How long does it last?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"It can last a lifetime if high-quality materials and proper techniques are used."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Is a tip graft necessary?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Not always; it depends on your skin thickness and how “pointy” you want the tip."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Can people with thin skin get a nose job?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Yes, but the height is limited, and cartilage or synthetic tissue is usually used to prevent perforation."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Recovery time?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"7–14 days for initial recovery; 2 weeks for stitches to heal."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"When will the shape be final?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"You will see a clearer shape in 1–3 months, with full settling at 6–12 months."}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Conclusion"},{"t":"p","x":"Rhinoplasty enhances facial balance and confidence. Success depends on choosing the right shape, technique, and material. Proper preparation and post-op care are equally vital. Thorough research and professional consultation are the most important first steps."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Channels","lead":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Tel : 085 000 2001","h":"tel:0850002001"},{"x":"Line : @apexbeauty","h":"https://line.me/R/ti/p/@apexbeauty"},{"x":"Tiktok : apexprofoundbeauty","h":"https://www.tiktok.com/@apexprofoundbeauty"},{"x":"Facebook : APEX Hospital & Beauty Clinic","h":"https://www.facebook.com/ApexProfoundBeauty"},{"x":"Instagram : apexbeauty","h":"https://www.instagram.com/apexbeauty"},{"x":"Youtube : Apex Beauty Clinic","h":"https://www.youtube.com/@Apex.beautyclinic"},{"x":"X (Twitter) : ApexProfound","h":"https://x.com/ApexProfound"}]}]},"profhilo":{"title":"Profhilo","desc":"Profhilo helps restore the skin along with the process of creating collagen under the skin, helping the skin to be full, can increase moisture to the face","date":"01/07/2024","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Profhilo-cover.webp","alt":"Profhilo Cover"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Profhilo.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Profhilo-cover.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Profhilo: The Ultimate Solution for Radiant, Youthful Skin"},{"t":"p","x":"Dull, tired-looking skin is a common concern for many. If you’re searching for a way to rejuvenate and restore your skin’s glow, Profhilo could be the perfect solution. Unlike traditional fillers that simply add volume, Profhilo works by stimulating collagen and elastin production, giving your skin a naturally youthful and healthy appearance. Let’s dive into what makes Profhilo the go-to skin-rejuvenation treatment chosen by many!"},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/what-is-profhilo-en.webp","alt":"what is profhilo"},{"t":"h2","x":"What is Profhilo?"},{"t":"p","x":"Profhilo is an innovative skin bio-remodeling treatment designed to improve skin hydration, firmness, and elasticity. Unlike conventional dermal fillers, Profhilo doesn’t just fill wrinkles—it stimulates collagen and elastin production from within."},{"t":"p","x":"It uses NAHYCO® Hybrid Technology, combining a high concentration of Hyaluronic Acid (HA) (64 mg) to deeply hydrate and improve skin structure. This process restores youthful radiance, tightens sagging skin, and enhances overall skin quality."},{"t":"h2","x":"How Does Profhilo Work?"},{"t":"p","x":"Profhilo works through a biological process that restructures the skin at a deep level using high-concentration HA injections. Here’s how:"},{"t":"h3","x":"Injection at Bio Aesthetic Points (BAP)"},{"t":"p","x":"Profhilo is injected into specific facial areas called Bio Aesthetic Points (BAP), ensuring optimal distribution, minimal discomfort, and maximum rejuvenation."},{"t":"h3","x":"Deep Penetration of Hyaluronic Acid (HA)"},{"t":"p","x":"Unlike traditional fillers, Profhilo’s non-crosslinked HA spreads evenly through the skin layers, ensuring intense hydration and restoration."},{"t":"h3","x":"Bio-Remodeling & Skin Regeneration"},{"t":"p","x":"3. Bio-Remodeling & Skin RegenerationOnce absorbed, Profhilo stimulates natural collagen and elastin production, helping to tighten, firm, and restore skin elasticity."},{"t":"h3","x":"Intense Hydration & Radiance Boost"},{"t":"p","x":"The ultra-pure HA in Profhilo locks in moisture, leaving the skin plump, smooth, and naturally glowing."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/what-is-profhilo-difference-en.webp","alt":"Profhilo"},{"t":"h2","x":"How is Profhilo Different from Dermal Fillers?"},{"t":"table","rows":[["Feature","Profhilo","Dermal Fillers"],["Purpose","Hydration, tightening, collagen stimulation","Volume restoration, contouring"],["How It Works","Bio-remodels skin, stimulates collagen & elastin","Fills specific areas for shaping"],["Longevity","6-12 months","6-18 months"],["Best For","Skin rejuvenation, firmness, hydration","Cheek volume, lip enhancement, facial sculpting"]]},{"t":"h2","x":"Benefits of Profhilo"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Firms & tightens skin, reducing sagging"},{"x":"Deep hydration, making skin plumper and radiant"},{"x":"Reduces fine lines & wrinkles"},{"x":"Boosts collagen & elastin production"},{"x":"Improves overall skin texture & tone"},{"x":"Non-invasive & minimal downtime"}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Who Should Get Profhilo?"},{"t":"p","x":"Profhilo is ideal for:✔️ Those with dry, dehydrated, or dull skin✔️ Individuals with loss of skin elasticity & sagging✔️ People in their 30s+ looking to slow aging✔️ Those wanting natural skin rejuvenation without fillers✔️ Busy individuals looking for a quick, no-downtime treatment"},{"t":"h2","x":"Where Can Profhilo Be Injected?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Cheeks – Tightens & restores volume"},{"x":"Forehead – Smooths fine lines"},{"x":"Chin & Jawline – Enhances definition"},{"x":"Nasolabial Folds – Softens deep lines"},{"x":"Under Eyes – Reduces dark circles & wrinkles"},{"x":"Temples – Adds plumpness & hydration"},{"x":"Neck & Hands – Revitalizes & smooths skin"}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/profhilo-quantity-en.webp","alt":"profhilo quantity"},{"t":"h2","x":"How Much Profhilo Should Be Injected? How Many CCs?"},{"t":"p","x":"Profhilo is typically injected at 2 cc per session, with two sessions spaced one month apart. For deeper skin rejuvenation, a third session may be added, also spaced one month apart."},{"t":"p","x":"To maintain results, follow-up treatments can be done every 6 to 12 months. The injection is administered in five strategic points on each side of the face."},{"t":"p","x":"After the treatment, skin hydration and smoothness may be noticeable within a few days, with full results visible after 1-2 months. These include firmer skin, reduced fine lines, and a radiant glow, lasting approximately 6-12 months, depending on individual skin conditions and care routines."},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose Apex for Profhilo?"},{"t":"p","x":"✔️ Experienced Medical Team – Certified specialists trained in advanced Bio Aesthetic Points (BAP) techniques✔️ Premium-Quality Products – 100% authentic, FDA-approved Profhilo✔️ Visible Results – Natural, long-lasting transformation✔️ Personalized Consultation & Aftercare – Tailored treatments for optimal results✔️ Hygienic & Accredited Clinic – Government-certified facility in a convenient location✔️ Trusted Client Reviews – See real before & after results"},{"t":"h2","x":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"Does Profhilo Injection Hurt?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"The injection causes only minimal discomfort since a fine needle is used and the procedure targets just 10 specific points on the face (5 points per side). Additionally, a numbing cream may be applied by the doctor to further reduce any pain, making the experience generally comfortable."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"What Can Profhilo Help With?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Profhilo helps rejuvenate the skin from within by deeply hydrating it, making it plumper and more radiant. It also enhances skin firmness, reduces sagging caused by aging, and improves overall skin texture, leaving it smooth, bright, and naturally youthful."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How Many Sessions Are Needed to See Results?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"It is recommended to have two sessions spaced one month apart to allow the HA to work effectively in stimulating skin renewal. Noticeable results typically appear within 1-2 months after the injections."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Can I Get Laser Treatments After the Injection?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"It is advised to avoid laser treatments or heat-based procedures for at least 1-2 weeks after the injection. This helps prevent interference with the skin’s recovery process and ensures optimal HA distribution."},{"t":"p","x":"At Apex, we are committed to providing an exceptional injection experience with expert care. If you would like more information, feel free to contact us. We look forward to seeing you!"}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Our Exclusive Clients"},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/profhilo-review.webp","alt":"Profhilo รีวิว"},{"t":"p","x":"Results may vary from person to person."}]},"service/apex-technologies":{"title":"APEX Technologies","desc":"Discover cutting-edge skin and cosmetic solutions at Apex. Utilize advanced technologies for effective treatments, enhancing beauty and confidence.","date":"17/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"CO2 Laser:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Carbon dioxide gas is used to generate the laser beam."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for skin resurfacing to treat wrinkles, scars, and age spots. Can also be used for mole removal and to tighten the skin."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Typically 1-3 treatments are required, spaced out over several weeks or months."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Moderate to high depending on the intensity of the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: First introduced in the 1990s."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-approved for skin resurfacing and the removal of benign skin growths."},{"t":"h2","x":"Scarlet SRF:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Radiofrequency waves are used to heat the skin and stimulate collagen production."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for skin tightening, wrinkle reduction, and to improve skin texture."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: 3-4 treatments, spaced out 4-6 weeks apart."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal discomfort during the treatment, with some redness and swelling afterward."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed in Korea."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for non-invasive treatment of wrinkles and fine lines."},{"t":"h2","x":"Elos Plus:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses a combination of bi-polar radiofrequency and optical energy (IPL or laser) to target different layers of the skin."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Can be used for hair removal, skin rejuvenation, pigmentation reduction, and acne treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Varies depending on the specific treatment, typically several sessions are required."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Syneron Candela."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-approved for hair removal, skin rejuvenation, and pigmentation reduction."},{"t":"h2","x":"Fotona 4D:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses two types of lasers – an Er:YAG laser for skin resurfacing and a Nd:YAG laser for deeper tissue tightening."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for skin tightening, wrinkle reduction, and to improve skin texture."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: 3-4 treatments, spaced out 4-6 weeks apart."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Fotona."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for the non-invasive treatment of wrinkles and fine lines."},{"t":"h2","x":"StarWalker MaQX:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses a combination of laser and light energies to target various skin concerns."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Can be used for tattoo removal, pigmentation reduction, and skin rejuvenation."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Varies depending on the specific treatment, typically several sessions are required."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Moderate to high depending on the intensity of the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Lutronic."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for the treatment of pigmented lesions, tattoos, and skin rejuvenation."},{"t":"h2","x":"Med Lite Laser:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses a Q-switched laser to target pigmentation and tattoo ink."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for pigmentation reduction and tattoo removal."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Multiple treatments are required, spaced out several weeks apart."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by ConBio."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for the treatment of pigmented lesions and tattoo removal."},{"t":"h2","x":"Spectra Laser:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses a Q-switched laser to target pigmentation and tattoo ink."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for pigmentation reduction and tattoo removal."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Multiple treatments are required, spaced out several weeks apart."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Lutronic."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for the treatment of pigmented lesions and tattoo removal."},{"t":"p","x":"Sure, here are some more lasers with their details:"},{"t":"h2","x":"Alma Laser Harmony XL Pro:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses a variety of laser and light-based technologies, including IPL, Nd YAG, and Er YAG, for multiple skin concerns."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Can treat various skin conditions, such as pigmentation, vascular lesions, acne, and skin rejuvenation."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Multiple treatments may be required, depending on the condition being treated."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Alma Lasers."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for various skin conditions, including hair removal, pigmented lesions, vascular lesions, and wrinkle reduction."},{"t":"h2","x":"Cutera Xeo:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses a multi-application platform with various laser and IPL technologies for a wide range of skin concerns."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for the treatment of pigmentation, hair removal, vascular lesions, acne, and skin rejuvenation."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Varies depending on the specific treatment, but multiple sessions may be required."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Cutera."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for various skin conditions."},{"t":"h2","x":"Ulthera:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses micro focused ultrasound to lift and tighten the skin."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for non-surgical facelift, brow lift, and neck lift."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Usually only requires one treatment, with results continuing to improve for up to 6 months."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Merz Aesthetics."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for non-invasive eyebrow lift, submental (under-chin) lift, and décolletage lines and wrinkles."},{"t":"h2","x":"Thermage:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses radiofrequency energy to heat the deeper layers of skin to stimulate collagen production and tighten existing collagen."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for non-surgical skin tightening, smoothing wrinkles and fine lines, and improving skin texture."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Usually only requires one treatment, with results continuing to improve for up to 6 months."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Solta Medical."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for non-invasive treatment of wrinkles and rhytids, including the eyelids and periorbital area."},{"t":"h2","x":"HIFU (High-Intensity Focused Ultrasound):"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses high-intensity ultrasound waves to target deep tissue layers and stimulate collagen production."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for non-surgical facelift, brow lift, and neck lift."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Usually only requires one treatment, with results continuing to improve for up to 6 months."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Ulthera."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for non-invasive eyebrow lift, submental (under-chin) lift, and décolletage lines and wrinkles."},{"t":"h2","x":"Ultraformer:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses micro-focused ultrasound to target multiple layers of skin and underlying tissue."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for non-surgical facelift, brow lift, and neck lift."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Usually only requires one treatment, with results continuing to improve for up to 6 months."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Classys Inc."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for non-invasive eyebrow lift, submental (under-chin) lift, and décolletage lines and wrinkles."},{"t":"h2","x":"Ultracel:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses a combination of high-intensity focused ultrasound (HIFU) and radiofrequency (RF) technology to heat the skin and promote collagen production."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for skin tightening, lifting, and contouring."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: One to two treatments may be needed."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Wontech."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for skin tightening and lifting."},{"t":"h2","x":"Pico Sure:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses picosecond laser technology to target tattoo ink and pigmentation."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for tattoo removal, pigmentation reduction, and skin rejuvenation."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Multiple treatments are required, spaced out several weeks apart."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Cynosure."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for the treatment of pigmented lesions and tattoo removal."},{"t":"h2","x":"Venus Viva:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses NanoFractional Radio Frequency and SmartScan technology to heat the skin and promote collagen production."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for skin resurfacing, wrinkle reduction, and acne scar treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Multiple treatments may be needed, spaced out several weeks apart."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Venus Concept."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for skin resurfacing and wrinkle reduction."},{"t":"h2","x":"eMatrix:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses sublative radiofrequency technology to heat the skin and promote collagen production."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for skin rejuvenation, wrinkle reduction, and acne scar treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Multiple treatments may be needed, spaced out several weeks apart."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Syneron Candela."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for the treatment of acne scars and skin resurfacing."},{"t":"h2","x":"Scarlet SRF:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Radiofrequency waves are used to heat the skin and stimulate collagen production."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for skin tightening, wrinkle reduction, and to improve skin texture."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: 3-4 treatments, spaced out 4-6 weeks apart."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal discomfort during the treatment, with some redness and swelling afterward."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed in Korea."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for non-invasive treatment of wrinkles and fine lines."},{"t":"h2","x":"EndyMed 3DEEP"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses radiofrequency energy to heat the skin and stimulate collagen production."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for skin tightening, wrinkle reduction, and cellulite treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Usually requires 3-6 sessions spaced 2-4 weeks apart."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by EndyMed Medical Ltd."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for the treatment of wrinkles and skin tightening."},{"t":"h2","x":"Fractora"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses micro-needling and radiofrequency energy to promote collagen production and improve skin texture."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for skin resurfacing, wrinkle reduction, and scar treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Usually requires 3-4 sessions spaced 4-6 weeks apart."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by InMode Aesthetic Solutions."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for the treatment of wrinkles, rhytides, and skin resurfacing."},{"t":"h2","x":"HIFU (High-Intensity Focused Ultrasound)"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses focused ultrasound energy to heat the skin and promote collagen production."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for skin tightening, wrinkle reduction, and non-surgical facelift."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Usually requires one session, with touch-ups every 1-2 years."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Mild to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Hironic Co., Ltd."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for the treatment of wrinkles and skin tightening."},{"t":"h2","x":"Morpheus 8:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Combines micro needling and radiofrequency (RF) technology to penetrate deep into the skin to stimulate collagen production and tighten skin."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for non-surgical facelift, skin tightening, and improvement in the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Usually, three treatments are recommended, spaced one month apart, with maintenance sessions every 6-12 months."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by In Mode Aesthetic Solutions."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for subdermal adipose remodeling (SARDS) and dermal heating."},{"t":"h2","x":"Pico Sure:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses picosecond laser technology to break down pigmentation and tattoo ink particles into smaller pieces than traditional lasers."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for pigmentation reduction and tattoo removal."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Multiple treatments are required, spaced out several weeks apart."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Cynosure."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for the treatment of benign pigmented lesions, acne scars, and tattoo removal."},{"t":"h2","x":"Fotona 4D:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses NdYAG and ErYAG lasers to heat deeper layers of skin, tighten skin, and stimulate collagen production."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for non-surgical facelift, skin tightening, and improvement in the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Typically, four treatments are recommended, spaced two weeks apart, with maintenance sessions every 6-12 months."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Fotona."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for the treatment of wrinkles, skin resurfacing, and acne scars."},{"t":"h2","x":"Star Walker MaQX:"},{"t":"p","x":"Energy Type: Uses multiple wavelengths of laser and pulsed light technology to target pigmentation and hair removal."},{"t":"p","x":"Clinical Benefit: Used for pigmentation reduction and hair removal on various skin types."},{"t":"p","x":"Frequency of Treatment: Multiple treatments are required, spaced out several weeks apart."},{"t":"p","x":"Pain Level: Minimal to moderate discomfort during the treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"Origin: Developed by Fotona."},{"t":"p","x":"FDA Approval: FDA-cleared for the treatment of pigmented lesions and hair removal."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/bio-lift":{"title":"Filler Injection","desc":"Smooth wrinkles and tighten skin with Apex’s Bio-Lift. Non-surgical solution for a more youthful appearance.","date":"17/02/2025","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Bio-Lift.webp","alt":"Bio Lift"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Bio-Lift.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Bio-Lift.webp","blocks":[{"t":"p","x":"Anyone who is facing the problem of aging on the face Because as everyone knows, the older you get, the more your skin sags. Faced with aging skin problems, wrinkled skin, uneven skin tone, sagging skin It can happen to anyone and is unavoidable. But nowadays, there are many tools and methods to help stimulate collagen under the skin. Even injecting collagen stimulating substances under the skin. which is quite popular among teenagers In this article, Pepsi will introduce a clear face injection program that helps strengthen collagen under the skin. That helps tighten the skin, tighten, reduce wrinkles and also make the skin healthy as well. That is the Bio lift program. Oh, the quality of this great property, many people would want to know what it is. Then follow Pexy."},{"t":"h2","x":"BIO LIFT program"},{"t":"p","x":"Bio lift is Apex’s unique facial injection program that focuses on skin lifting and clear face in one. Substances used in this program can be used for a long time, durable, safe, can be called a rival of the filler. Suitable for people with dry, wrinkled, and tired skin. Want to add collagen to make your skin look full, full, juicy, tighten pores The face is lifted up and firmer."},{"t":"p","x":"Who wants young skin like Korean girls? Skin work for many people who dream of The drug of the Bio lift program that we use is Gouri. Today, Pepsi will introduce Gouri (Guri) about how good he is. Who should inject Gouri? Actually, Gouri is the latest skin whitening injection. Gouri (Guri) is just a trade name for a name. Patented Gouri Cesabp, water-soluble and biodegradable polymer technology, safe and biocompatible. If you want to know the details We have seen it."},{"t":"h2","x":"What is Gouri?"},{"t":"p","x":"It is a type of Collagen Stimulator in the form of PCL (Polycaprolactone) which is the first brand of liquid that can be injected under the problem skin layer. Which is safer than other forms that are gel or solid, able to dissolve 100% and has been certified by the Thai FDA safety standards Its special feature is that it is the first liquid injected to revitalize the skin. and stimulate collagen can be spread naturally over the face Helps create collagen synthesis that decreases due to aging of the skin that starts to deteriorate."},{"t":"p","x":"PCL (Polycarpolactone) is a large molecule polymer substance in the form of a liquid that dissolves in water and is biodegradable. Produced with CESABP (Collagenesis-Enabled Solubilized Active and Biodegradable Polymer Technology) technology, it is different from others and does not contain Microparticles. that will cause side effects such as blood clots And there have never been reports of problems with swelling and inflammation after treatment like other substances. Including being able to quickly spread and blend into the skin after injection."},{"t":"h3","x":"Gouri Properties"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Makes skin firmer, firmer, stronger"},{"x":"Improved skin elasticity"},{"x":"Rejuvenate the skin from the inside out."},{"x":"Collagen stimulation"},{"x":"Helps reduce deep wrinkles to look faded."},{"x":"Makes the face brighter, fuller"},{"x":"Helps the skin look firmer and tighter."},{"x":"Delay aging, stay youthful, safe"},{"x":"Can break down by itself Does not destroy tissue, does not clog blood vessels"}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Who is the BIO LIFT or Gouri program suitable for?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"People whose faces have wrinkles due to age"},{"x":"People with tired facial skin The face doesn’t look bright."},{"x":"People whose facial skin has wrinkles Sagging due to loss of collagen"},{"x":"People who want their face to look youthful without wanting to inject fillers"},{"x":"People who want their facial skin to be moisturized and plump naturally."},{"x":"People who are looking for a facial procedure The type where results last longer"}]},{"t":"h2","x":"How many times should Gouri be injected to see results?"},{"t":"p","x":"After injecting Gouri (Guri), results will begin to become evident at 2-4 weeks after injection. and can last for 6-12 months per 1 treatment cycle. It is recommended to inject Gouri 3 times, each time using Gouri 2 CC, with an injection interval of 4 weeks in 1 treatment cycle. After the 3rd time, it can be repeated 1 or 2 more times. times, which must be spaced 3-6 months apart to maintain the rate of collagen in the body"},{"t":"h2","x":"Preparation before injecting Gouri"},{"t":"p","x":"Avoid exposure to heat and radiation such as face wash and sunlight. Refrain from swimming and consuming alcoholic beverages in the 24 hours before injection. You should wash your face thoroughly before injecting Gouri or don’t wear makeup before coming to the clinic. Take antihistamines 30 minutes before the procedure in case the patient is afraid of an allergic reaction. However, no serious side effects have been found during the testing period of using Gouri, but minor side effects such as swelling, itching, and redness may be observed at the injection site. Happens immediately or 7-10 days after the procedure, when collagen support begins. It is a result of natural immunity and all symptoms will disappear within 2-3 days. However, if you experience any adverse symptoms, please see a doctor immediately."},{"t":"h2","x":"Who cannot have Gouri injections?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"People who take anticoagulant drugs Anti-inflammatory drugs or NSAIDs such as aspirin, ibuprofen, diclofenac"},{"x":"People who are sensitive to various stimuliPregnant women breastfeeding"},{"x":"Immunocompromised"},{"x":"People with a history of allergic reactions to PCL"}]},{"t":"h2","x":"What problem does Gouri solve? Where can I inject?"},{"t":"p","x":"What problem does Gouri solve? Where can I inject?The main function of Gouri is to stimulate collagen under the skin, resulting in solving wrinkle problems caused by wrinkled skin. Helps make the skin layer thicker, the skin more flexible, making the skin look firmer, smoother, and pores smaller. There are also reports that it can reduce pigmentation, make dark spots and blemishes fade, as well as reduce redness in rosacea. It can be injected all over the face, neck, back of the hands, or areas of the skin that need to stimulate collagen."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/blepharoplasty":{"title":"Blepharoplasty","desc":"Apex is the leading blepharoplasty clinic, offering state-of-the-art treatment and surgery, based in the heart of Bangkok Thailand","date":"18/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Everything You Need to Know About Blepharoplasty with APEX"},{"t":"p","x":"Blepharoplasty is a popular cosmetic surgery procedure designed to rejuvenate the appearance of the eyes. APEX, a renowned brand in the world of plastic surgery, offers cutting-edge solutions for this transformative surgery. In this comprehensive guide, we will delve into the world of blepharoplasty and explore how APEX can help you achieve your aesthetic goals."},{"t":"h2","x":"What is Blepharoplasty?"},{"t":"p","x":"Blepharoplasty, commonly known as eyelid surgery, is a surgical procedure that focuses on improving the appearance of the eyelids. This surgery can be performed on the upper eyelids, lower eyelids, or both, depending on the patient’s specific needs and desires. Blepharoplasty can address a variety of concerns, including:"},{"t":"h3","x":"Upper Eyelid Concerns"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Excess skin that creates a heavy, drooping appearance."},{"x":"Puffiness caused by fat deposits."},{"x":"Sagging or loose skin that can impair vision."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Lower Eyelid Concerns"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Bags under the eyes due to fat deposits."},{"x":"Wrinkles and fine lines."},{"x":"Dark circles and discoloration."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose APEX for Your Blepharoplasty?"},{"t":"p","x":"APEX has earned a reputation for excellence in the field of plastic surgery. Here are some compelling reasons to consider APEX for your blepharoplasty procedure:"},{"t":"h3","x":"Board-Certified Surgeons"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX employs a team of highly skilled and board-certified plastic surgeons with extensive experience in performing blepharoplasty."},{"x":"Our surgeons stay updated with the latest techniques and advancements in eyelid surgery to provide you with the best possible results."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Personalized Treatment Plans"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"We understand that each patient is unique. APEX tailors each blepharoplasty procedure to address your specific concerns and achieve your aesthetic goals."},{"x":"Our surgeons work closely with you to create a personalized treatment plan that ensures a natural and harmonious result."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"State-of-the-Art Facilities"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX operates in state-of-the-art surgical facilities equipped with the latest technology and safety measures."},{"x":"Our commitment to maintaining a safe and comfortable environment for our patients is unwavering."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Exceptional Patient Care"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"At APEX, we prioritize patient satisfaction and comfort throughout the entire surgical journey."},{"x":"Our dedicated staff provides comprehensive pre-operative and post-operative care to ensure a smooth and successful recovery."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"The Blepharoplasty Procedure"},{"t":"p","x":"Let’s explore the typical steps involved in a blepharoplasty procedure:"},{"t":"h3","x":"Consultation"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"The process begins with a consultation with one of our expert plastic surgeons."},{"x":"During this consultation, your surgeon will discuss your goals, evaluate your eyelids, and explain the procedure in detail."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Anesthesia"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Blepharoplasty can be performed using local anesthesia with sedation or general anesthesia, depending on your comfort and the extent of the surgery."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Incisions"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"For upper eyelid surgery, incisions are typically made along the natural creases of the eyelids, which helps conceal any scarring."},{"x":"For lower eyelid surgery, incisions may be made just below the lower lash line or inside the lower eyelid (transconjunctival approach), again minimizing visible scarring."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Tissue Adjustment"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Excess skin, muscle, and fat are carefully removed or repositioned to achieve the desired eyelid contour."},{"x":"The surgeon pays meticulous attention to symmetry and ensuring a natural appearance."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Closure"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Once the necessary adjustments are made, the incisions are closed with sutures or surgical adhesive."},{"x":"Your surgeon will take great care to ensure minimal scarring and proper alignment."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Recovery and Results"},{"t":"p","x":"The recovery process after blepharoplasty can vary from person to person. However, here is a general overview of what to expect:"},{"t":"h3","x":"Immediate Post-Operative Period"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"You may experience mild swelling and bruising around the eyes, which is normal and expected."},{"x":"Discomfort can be managed with prescribed pain medication."},{"x":"It’s essential to follow post-operative instructions provided by your surgeon."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Long-Term Results"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"The full results of blepharoplasty become evident as swelling subsides and incisions heal."},{"x":"You can expect a refreshed and more youthful appearance with improved eyelid contour."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"t":"p","x":"Let’s address some common questions about blepharoplasty:"},{"t":"h3","x":"Is Blepharoplasty Suitable for Everyone?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Blepharoplasty is generally suitable for adults who have concerns about the appearance of their eyelids."},{"x":"A thorough consultation with a qualified surgeon will determine if you are a good candidate."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"How Long Do the Results Last?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"The results of blepharoplasty are long-lasting, and the improvements can be enjoyed for many years."},{"x":"However, the natural aging process will continue, and some maintenance may be required over time."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Are There Any Risks or Complications?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Like all surgical procedures, blepharoplasty carries some inherent risks, such as infection, scarring, or unsatisfactory results."},{"x":"Choosing a board-certified surgeon and following post-operative care instructions can minimize these risks."}]},{"t":"p","x":"Blepharoplasty with APEX offers a pathway to enhancing the appearance of your eyes and achieving a more youthful and vibrant look. With a team of expert surgeons, personalized treatment plans, and state-of-the-art facilities, APEX is dedicated to providing you with the highest standard of care and exceptional results. If you’re considering blepharoplasty, schedule a consultation with APEX to embark on your journey to rejuvenation and renewed confidence."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/body-hifu":{"title":"Body HIFU","desc":"Apex is the leading HIFU and body contouring clinic, offering state-of-the-art non-invasive treatment and therapies, based in the heart of Bangkok Thailand","date":"17/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"p","x":"The Body HIFU, which features MMFU (Micro & Macro Focused Ultrasound) technology, is used to achieve outstanding results for body contouring. The non-invasive treatment can be applied on all parts of the body with no downtime. The procedure, which has been tested and certified for safety is now used worldwide."},{"t":"h2","x":"WHAT IS MMFU?"},{"t":"p","x":"The Micro & Macro Focused Ultrasound technology is specially designed so that it can also be combined with previous cartridges (1.5, 3.0, 4.5mm) in order to enhance the effect."},{"t":"p","x":"Currently, 4 & 7Mhz transducers create Micro coagulation into dermis and SMAS while 2Mh transducers deliver Macro energy into subcutaneous fat to selectively remove fat cells. This innovation of transducers generates 8 times the ultrasound energy than procedures used previously maximizing customer satisfaction and reducing."},{"t":"h2","x":"WHICH PARTS OF THE BODY CAN THE BODY HIFU TREAT?"},{"t":"p","x":"The Body HIFU can be used to treat any part of the body such as the chin, abdomen, buttocks, upper arms, knees and etc. The practitioner selects the appropriate cartridge which is best suited to the body part that is being treated."},{"t":"h2","x":"WHAT HAPPENS TO THE FAT?"},{"t":"p","x":"During the Body HIFU treatment, the membranes of the fat cells are damaged. The fat cell content, primarily consisting of triglycerides, is dispersed into the fluid cell and then transported through the vascular and lymphatic systems to the liver. The liver makes no distinction between fat coming from the Body HIFU treatment and fat originating from past food consumption. It is therefore processed via the body’s natural mechanisms."},{"t":"h2","x":"DO PATIENTS EXPERIENCE PAIN WHEN TREATED?"},{"t":"p","x":"The Body HIFU is a comfortable procedure due to its special transducer system, which was developed by Classys."},{"t":"p","x":"Most patients that have had similar body contouring treatments agree that the Body HIFU procedure is a much more tolerable experience. The only discomfort they feel is usually when the ultrasound energy is being delivered, once the treatment is complete any pain or discomfort subside"},{"t":"h2","x":"ARE THERE ANY SIDE EFFECTS?"},{"t":"p","x":"There may be slight redness for a few hours following the treatment, and it is common to experience slight swelling or a tingling sensation for a few weeks. These are mild and temporary. In addition, patients may experience minimal bruising and numbness in applied areas however this tends to be uncommon and will resolve within 2~4 weeks following the procedure."},{"t":"p","x":"“Apex Profound Beauty is recognized as the No.1 health institute that performs the most Thermage and Ulthera procedures worldwide."},{"t":"p","x":"The consultation will be free of charge via :"},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/botox":{"title":"Botox","desc":"Apex is the leading Botox clinic, offering state-of-the-art injections and treatment, based in the heart of Bangkok Thailand","date":"17/02/2025","hero":null,"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/botox-en.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/botox-en.webp","blocks":[{"t":"p","x":"Botox is a popular cosmetic treatment that has been used for decades to treat a variety of medical and cosmetic conditions. Botox is made from a purified form of botulinum toxin, which is a neurotoxin that temporarily paralyzes muscles. When used in cosmetic treatments, Botox can help reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles by relaxing the muscles that cause them."},{"t":"p","x":"If you’re considering Botox for cosmetic reasons, it’s important to understand what the treatment entails and what to expect. Here are some key points to keep in mind when considering Botox for cosmetic purposes:","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Safety : Botox is a safe and effective treatment when performed by a trained and licensed medical professional. However, as with any medical procedure, there are potential risks and side effects to consider. These may include temporary bruising, swelling, or redness at the injection site, as well as more serious complications if the treatment is not administered properly. Be sure to choose a reputable provider who has experience with Botox injections."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/botox-en.webp","alt":"a woman with her hands on her cheeks"},{"t":"p","x":"Treatment Areas : Botox is most commonly used to treat wrinkles and fine lines in the forehead, between the eyebrows, and around the eyes (crow’s feet). However, Botox can also be used to treat other areas of the face, such as the lips and chin, to create a more youthful and rejuvenated appearance."},{"t":"p","x":"Procedure : Botox injections are relatively quick and simple, with each treatment session lasting around 10-15 minutes. The injection is administered using a fine needle, and most patients report minimal discomfort during the procedure. You may experience some redness or swelling at the injection site immediately after the treatment, but this should subside within a few hours."},{"t":"p","x":"Results : The results of Botox injections typically take a few days to appear, with the full effects becoming visible within 7-10 days. The results of Botox typically last for 3-4 months, after which time the treatment can be repeated to maintain the desired results."},{"t":"p","x":"Cost : The cost of Botox injections can vary depending on the provider, the location of the clinic, and the number of areas being treated. Generally, Botox injections can range from a few hundred to a few thousand dollars per session. However, it’s important to choose a provider who offers competitive pricing without sacrificing quality or safety."},{"t":"h2","x":"Botox injection results at Apex Medical Center"},{"t":"p","x":"In conclusion, Botox is a safe and effective cosmetic treatment that can help reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. By understanding the treatment process, expected results, and potential risks and side effects, you can make an informed decision about whether Botox is right for you. Be sure to choose a reputable provider who has experience with Botox injections, and don’t hesitate to ask questions or voice any concerns you may have before undergoing treatment.","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/breast-surgery":{"title":"Superior Breast Surgery in Thailand","desc":"Apex is the leading breast surgery and breast augmentation clinic, offering state-of-the-art treatment and surgery, based in the heart of Bangkok Thailand","date":"18/02/2023","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/APEX-Breast-Surgery-Clinic.webp","alt":"Superior Breast Surgery in Thailand"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/APEX-Breast-Surgery-Clinic.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/APEX-Breast-Surgery-Clinic.webp","blocks":[{"t":"p","x":"As the technologies involved have advanced and cosmetic surgeons have perfected the techniques, breast surgery in Bangkok has become more popular with each passing year. Apex Medical Center has a team of highly skilled, experienced plastic surgeons specializing in breast enhancement in Thailand. We offer a variety of procedures designed to achieve the desired breast shape and size and incorporate the latest techniques and innovations to produce flawless results. Our focus is always on the safety and comfort of our clients, and we treat each potential Thailand breast augmentation as a unique case to be carefully assessed and planned."},{"t":"h2","x":"APEX Medical Center: Your Trusted, Reputable Breast Clinic in Thailand"},{"t":"p","x":"Our commitment to providing the best available products led us to the outstanding, ergonomic Motiva breast implants. APEX Medical Center is widely recognized as a premium breast clinic in Thailand, and we proudly offer unparalleled expertise in this area. Dedicated to implementing the latest, least invasive techniques and procedures, we are experts in endoscopic breast augmentation in Thailand, designed to minimize scarring and enhance recovery times."},{"t":"gallery","items":["~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/the-ultimate-in-breast-augmentation.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/APEX-SURGERY-ENG.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/APEX-SURGERY-ENG-03.webp"]},{"t":"h2","x":"Breast Enhancement in Thailand: Your Options"},{"t":"p","x":"Not all breast surgery in Thailand is designed to increase size, and APEX also performs expert breast reduction services. We have an impressive record of success in reducing oversized breasts and giving them a new, natural shape and feel. Some premium options for breast surgery in Thailand include:"},{"t":"h3","x":"Breast lift procedures"},{"t":"p","x":"When you undergo a breast lift in Thailand with APEX, the aim is to restore an attractive breast shape and reduce levels of sagging. Our team of plastic surgeons specializes in endoscopic surgery techniques, providing patients with the most precise, natural-looking results possible."},{"t":"h3","x":"Breast removal surgery"},{"t":"p","x":"This option is perfect for transgender men but is also favored by women unfortunate enough to be diagnosed with breast cancer or a family history of the disease they wish to mitigate the effects of. We recognize the emotional, psychological trauma this kind of procedure can involve and are committed to providing a safe, supportive environment for patients undergoing breast removal surgery."},{"t":"p","x":"All our breast surgery in Bangkok is performed by peerless experts using years of experience and the latest technology and techniques. We aim to provide our clients with the most effective, natural-looking results possible and are dedicated to ensuring their satisfaction and safety."},{"t":"gallery","items":["~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/procedures-performed-by-decorated.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/sterile-operating-rooms.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/minimally-invasive-techniques.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/oversight-by-specialized-physicians.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/vip-recovery-rooms.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/highest-accolades.webp"]},{"t":"h2","x":"Breast Enhancement in Thailand: Your Options"},{"t":"p","x":"When you take advantage of our incredible Thailand breast augmentation at Apex Surgery Hospital, you can expect the following benefits and assurances:"},{"t":"h3","x":"Expert, in-depth consultation"},{"t":"p","x":"We never undertake any augmentation or breast lift in Thailand without a full, frank consultation with our clients. Our experts will provide all the advice and guidance required, answer any questions, and address concerns and issues."},{"t":"h3","x":"Board-certified plastic surgeons"},{"t":"p","x":"Our plastic surgeons are the industry’s most skilled, experienced, and decorated. Our chief surgeon achieved the highest surgical award, the Global Health Asia Pacific Award, for four consecutive years and leads an unrivaled team of professionals."},{"t":"h3","x":"Immaculate, sterile operating room"},{"t":"p","x":"All our operating rooms at APEX meet the highest possible standards, with a designated level 10K accreditation."},{"t":"h3","x":"State-of-the-art technology and tools"},{"t":"p","x":"At Apex Surgery Hospital, we constantly assess and implement the latest technologies and techniques that make our breast surgery in Bangkok the safest and most reliable anywhere."},{"t":"h3","x":"Choice of incision placement"},{"t":"p","x":"By consulting with the surgeon, patients can choose the optimum placement of incisions in the breasts for the insertion of breast implants."},{"t":"h3","x":"VIP recovery room"},{"t":"p","x":"Post-procedure, our patients can access a comfortable, fully equipped VIP recovery room. They experience 24/7 professional nursing care and all the support and supervision they need here."},{"t":"h2","x":"Lifetime warranty on silicone breast implants in Thailand"},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX Medical Center, we have such confidence in the quality of our Thailand breast implants that we offer a comprehensive, lifetime guarantee."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/chin-augmentation":{"title":"Chin Augmentation with Silicone Impant","desc":"Enhance your facial profile with chin augmentation using silicone implants at Apex for a balanced, sculpted look.","date":"19/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"p","x":"Chin augmentation has become increasingly popular, especially among women, as it offers the potential to achieve a slimmer and more youthful appearance while boosting self-confidence. This cosmetic procedure can significantly impact the facial structure, making it an attractive option for individuals with concerns like a short chin, receding chin, or a cleft chin. In this comprehensive guide, we will explore various aspects of chin augmentation with a focus on APEX Clinic’s specialized approach."},{"t":"h2","x":"Types of Chin Augmentation"},{"t":"h3","x":"1. Non-surgical Chin Augmentation"},{"t":"p","x":"Non-surgical chin augmentation presents an option for those seeking temporary results. This category includes two primary methods:"},{"t":"p","x":"Injectables:","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Fillers and fat injections are commonly used to enhance chin appearance."},{"x":"Results are temporary, typically lasting for a few years, and may require annual maintenance."}]},{"t":"p","x":"Surgical Chin Augmentation:","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Surgical procedures involve the insertion of permanent silicone implants."},{"x":"Silicone implants offer a long-lasting solution, providing enduring results."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"2. Surgical Chin Augmentation"},{"t":"p","x":"Surgical chin augmentation is a minor procedure that introduces silicone implants into the chin. These implants can be customized to achieve the desired chin shape, ensuring a harmonious fit with the patient’s facial structure. There are two primary techniques for surgical chin augmentation:"},{"t":"h2","x":"Chin Augmentation with Submental Incision"},{"t":"p","x":"Submental incision is an external chin augmentation technique.The incision is made under the chin and typically measures about 1-1.5 cm in length."},{"t":"p","x":"Pros:","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Reduces the risk of infection as it avoids contact with food residues and saliva in the mouth."},{"x":"Facilitates precise and accurate implant placement."},{"x":"Results in a small incision that is easy to care for and heals quickly."},{"x":"Surgeons use lasers during the procedure to minimize bleeding and swelling."},{"x":"Suitable for cases requiring filler correction, ensuring smoother results."},{"x":"Can address excess skin under the chin in cases of sagging."}]},{"t":"p","x":"Precautions:","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"May not be suitable for individuals prone to scarring, as it may cause scarring."},{"x":"However, with proper care and regular application of scar cream, scars typically fade within 1-3 months."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Chin Augmentation with Intraoral Incision"},{"t":"p","x":"Intraoral incision involves making an incision within the mouth, near the lower lip and inner gum area.The length of the incision varies, typically around 2 cm, depending on the size of the silicone implant."},{"t":"p","x":"Pros:","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"The incision remains hidden within the mouth, making it suitable for individuals prone to raised scars."},{"x":"This technique is favored by doctors and dentists who need to assess the jawbone and occlusion."}]},{"t":"p","x":"Precautions:","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Requires meticulous oral hygiene to prevent infection or complications."},{"x":"Care should be taken to avoid any impact on the chin that might displace the silicone implant."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Who is Suitable for Chin Augmentation?"},{"t":"p","x":"Chin augmentation is a versatile procedure suitable for both men and women. It addresses various concerns, including:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Short or receding chin"},{"x":"Square chin"},{"x":"Cleft chin"},{"x":"Round face in need of lengthening"},{"x":"Desire for a V-shaped face"}]},{"t":"p","x":"For men, chin augmentation can create a more obtuse and square chin, enhancing a masculine appearance. In contrast, women often seek a slender chin to achieve a sweet and V-shaped look. Beyond aesthetic benefits, chin augmentation can help individuals express their personality and self-assurance."},{"t":"p","x":"APEX Clinic offers cost-effective chin augmentation with silicone chin implants. The clinic’s medical team is also readily available to provide free consultations, addressing any questions or concerns patients may have."},{"t":"h2","x":"Types and Grades of Silicone Chin Implants"},{"t":"p","x":"APEX Clinic stands out in the field of chin augmentation due to its use of specialized silicone chin implants (long type). These implants are meticulously tailored to the individual’s facial shape, ensuring a precise and harmonious fit. The clinic’s approach includes:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Positioning the silicone implant precisely to cover the base of the chin bone."},{"x":"Securing the implant to prevent shifting and the formation of lumps or sagging."},{"x":"Utilizing stitches that are discreet and blend seamlessly with the patient’s skin tone."}]},{"t":"p","x":"Silicone implants used in chin augmentation must meet stringent medical grade standards. There are two main characteristics of silicone implants:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Silicone chin long"},{"x":"Silicone chin short"}]},{"t":"p","x":"In addition to these characteristics, the type of silicone used also contributes to achieving a well-proportioned face shape. APEX Clinic offers two types of silicone for chin implants:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Korean silicone"},{"x":"USA silicone"}]},{"t":"p","x":"APEX Clinic’s approach to chin augmentation with silicone implants provides patients with a comprehensive and tailored solution to enhance their facial harmony and confidence. Whether you are looking to address a short chin, create a V-shaped face, or achieve a more masculine or feminine appearance, the clinic’s specialized techniques and medical-grade silicone implants offer lasting results. With affordable prices and a commitment to patient satisfaction, APEX Clinic is a trusted destination for those seeking chin augmentation in Bangkok. Experience the transformation with APEX and discover a more confident, youthful, and proportional facial structure."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/coolsculpting-elite":{"title":"Coolsculpting Elite","desc":"Coolsculpting Elite helps break down fat with cold, tightens the body, reduces fat, and covers specific areas.","date":"03/09/2024","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Coolsculpting-Elite-Cover.webp","alt":"Coolsculpting Elite"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Coolsculpting-Elite-en.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Coolsculpting-Elite-Cover.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"CoolSculpting Elite: The Next Level of Fat Reduction for a Sculpted and Confident Body"},{"t":"p","x":"For those struggling with stubborn fat, lack of firmness, or disproportionate body contours, CoolSculpting Elite is a cutting-edge solution. Developed from the original CoolSculpting technology, this advanced fat-freezing treatment enhances fat reduction efficiency while improving body sculpting results—all without surgery or the need for weight loss."},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX Clinic, we’ll introduce you to CoolSculpting Elite, compare it to other fat reduction procedures, and highlight its key benefits, helping you make an informed choice for a well-balanced figure and increased self-confidence."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/What-is-Coolsculpting-Elite-en.webp","alt":"What is Coolsculpting Elite"},{"t":"h2","x":"What is CoolSculpting Elite?"},{"t":"p","x":"CoolSculpting Elite is an advanced fat-freezing technology (Cryolipolysis) that operates at temperatures between -11 to -13 degrees Celsius. This innovative system is designed to effectively target and reduce fat in multiple areas with improved efficiency compared to the previous model."},{"t":"p","x":"Whether you’re looking to slim down your abdomen, thighs, or double chin, this treatment is perfect for those seeking a non-surgical solution to stubborn fat that resists diet and exercise. With no downtime, CoolSculpting Elite allows you to return to daily activities immediately."},{"t":"h2","x":"How CoolSculpting Elite Works"},{"t":"p","x":"This state-of-the-art fat-freezing device precisely controls cooling temperatures to freeze and destroy fat cells through a natural biological process called apoptosis. Once these fat cells are broken down, the body naturally eliminates them through the lymphatic system, resulting in reduced fat layers and a more sculpted figure—without surgery"},{"t":"h2","x":"CoolSculpting Elite vs. Original CoolSculpting"},{"t":"p","x":"While both technologies work on the same Cryolipolysis principle, CoolSculpting Elite features notable enhancements:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"18% Larger Treatment Coverage – Treats a bigger area per session, improving efficiency."},{"x":"Redesigned Applicators – New ergonomic applicators provide better contouring and more precise fat reduction."},{"x":"Faster Treatment Time – Uses dual applicators, allowing treatment of multiple areas at once, reducing session time to 35-45 minutes per area."}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Coolsculpting-Elite-Applicator-en.webp","alt":"Coolsculpting Elite Applicator"},{"t":"h2","x":"CoolSculpting Elite: Enhanced with 3 Applicator Types in 7 Sizes"},{"t":"h3","x":"Applicator Curve Series"},{"t":"p","x":"The Curve Series applicator heads are designed to work well with the body’s curves, such as the abdomen, sides, and thighs, effectively targeting hard-to-reach fat areas."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Applicator Curve 80 is suitable for reducing fat in small areas, such as the double chin, minor breasts, or above the knees."},{"x":"Applicator Curve 120 is suitable for small curved areas, such as the abdomen, waist, flank, banana rolls, or male breasts."},{"x":"Applicator Curve 150 is suitable for areas with less fat, such as the abdomen, waist, flank, banana rolls, or male breasts."},{"x":"Applicator Curve 240 is suitable for larger areas, such as the abdomen or waist. Applicator"}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Flat Series"},{"t":"p","x":"The Flat Series applicator heads are designed for targeting fat pockets under the skin in flat, wide areas."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Applicator Flat 125 is suitable for fat reduction on the inner thighs or arms."},{"x":"Applicator Flat 165 is suitable for reducing belly fat, arms, and inner thighs."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Applicator Surface"},{"t":"p","x":"The Surface 150 applicator head is designed for cold fat reduction in areas where normal applicators have difficulty targeting, such as the outer thighs."},{"t":"h2","x":"Benefits & Considerations Before Treatment"},{"t":"p","x":"Key Benefits of CoolSculpting Elite","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Effectively reduces excess fat in targeted areas"},{"x":"Non-surgical with no recovery time required"},{"x":"Visible results in 3-4 weeks, with peak results in 2-3 months"},{"x":"Covers larger treatment areas, whether small or large"},{"x":"Minimal risk of severe side effects"},{"x":"CoolControl Technology ensures safe and consistent cooling"}]},{"t":"p","x":"Who Should Avoid CoolSculpting Elite?","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Individuals with Cryoglobulinemia or Cold Agglutinin Disease"},{"x":"Those who are significantly overweight"},{"x":"Pregnant or breastfeeding women"},{"x":"Possible mild side effects such as redness, swelling, bruising, or numbness"}]},{"t":"p","x":"Always choose a certified clinic for safety and best results"},{"t":"h2","x":"Real Results, Real Confidence"},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX, we prioritize delivering visible and lasting results for our clients. Clinical studies and real patient experiences confirm that CoolSculpting Elite reduces up to 27% of fat per treated area, with results peaking within 2-3 months after treatment."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"More contoured, balanced body shape"},{"x":"Enhanced confidence in clothing and appearance"},{"x":"Firmer and smoother skin after treatment."}]},{"t":"p","x":"*Results may vary based on individual response."},{"t":"h2","x":"Comparing CoolSculpting Elite to Other Fat Reduction Methods"},{"t":"p","x":"There are various body contouring and fat reduction treatments available. CoolSculpting Elite is a non-surgical, targeted fat-freezing procedure that minimizes the risk of scarring and requires little to no downtime. This differs from liposuction, which effectively removes larger amounts of fat but involves downtime and potential side effects. Meanwhile, Meso Fat injections and HIFU are better suited for minor fat reduction and skin tightening, rather than full-body contouring."},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose CoolSculpting Elite at APEX?"},{"t":"p","x":"APEX Medical Center is the leading destination for high-end aesthetic and wellness solutions in Bangkok. With our commitment to world-class standards, our CoolSculpting Elite treatment is tailored for clients who value cutting-edge technology, expert medical care, and an exclusive VIP experience."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"State-of-the-Art CoolSculpting Elite Technology – Advanced fat-freezing technology for optimal body contouring."},{"x":"Luxury Medical Aesthetics Experience – Personalized treatments in a 5-star clinic setting."},{"x":"Expert-Led & FDA-Approved Treatments – Performed by experienced specialists for clinically proven and FDA-cleared for non-invasive fat reduction."},{"x":"Tailored Sculpting Plans – Customized body contouring to fit your unique shape and goals."},{"x":"Efficient & Time-Saving – Quick sessions with dual applicators to treat multiple areas at once."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Q&A: Everything You Need to Know Before Treatment"},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"Why is CoolSculpting Elite a great choice?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"CoolSculpting Elite is a non-invasive, fat-freezing procedure that targets and reduces stubborn fat cells, which are naturally processed by the body over time. It’s perfect for those wanting a sculpted, toned body safely and effectively."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How many sessions are needed?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Each person is different, but typically 1-2 sessions per area deliver optimal results. A consultation with our specialists will help determine your best treatment plan."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Is CoolSculpting Elite painful?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Most patients experience mild discomfort, such as tightness or cold sensations at the beginning. Numbness may occur, but these effects subside naturally. There’s no downtime, so you can resume activities immediately."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Are the results permanent?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Yes! Once fat cells are eliminated, they do not regenerate. However, maintaining a healthy lifestyle is crucial to preventing new fat accumulation."}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"CoolSculpting Elite: The Ultimate Non-Surgical Fat Reduction Solution"},{"t":"p","x":"CoolSculpting Elite is a highly effective, non-invasive fat reduction treatment that delivers noticeable body sculpting results with minimal downtime. Within a few weeks, you’ll see a more contoured figure, with peak results in 2-3 months. With proper diet and exercise, long-lasting results can be maintained."},{"t":"h2","x":"Book Your VIP CoolSculpting Elite Experience at APEX"},{"t":"p","x":"Your transformation starts with a private consultation at our APEX Medical Center in Bangkok. Our specialist team will assess your body goals and create a customized CoolSculpting Elite plan designed for maximum results."},{"t":"h2","x":"APEX CoolSculpting Reviews"},{"t":"gallery","items":["~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Coolsculpting-Elite-Review-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Coolsculpting-Elite-Review-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Coolsculpting-Elite-Review-04.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Coolsculpting-Elite-Review-03.webp"]},{"t":"p","x":"Results depend on each individual. Services are available at Apex Clinic, Phloen Chit."}]},"service/dermal-fillers":{"title":"Dermal Fillers","desc":"Smooth wrinkles and restore volume with Apex’s dermal fillers. Achieve a youthful, rejuvenated appearance with expert care.","date":"17/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Dermal Fillers at Apex Medical Center – Restore Volume, Smooth Wrinkles, and Enhance Your Natural Beauty"},{"t":"p","x":"Looking for a non-surgical solution to smooth wrinkles, restore lost volume, or enhance facial features? Apex Medical Center offers top-tier dermal filler treatments tailored to your specific needs. Our expert team uses FDA-approved fillers to provide safe, effective, and long-lasting results that help you look youthful and refreshed."},{"t":"h2","x":"What Are Dermal Fillers?"},{"t":"p","x":"Dermal fillers are injectable treatments designed to address multiple signs of aging and enhance facial features. At Apex Medical Center, our fillers are composed of hyaluronic acid, a naturally occurring substance that boosts skin hydration and elasticity. Popular for their natural-looking results and minimal downtime, dermal fillers are an excellent option for both men and women looking to rejuvenate their appearance."},{"t":"h2","x":"Benefits of Dermal Fillers"},{"t":"p","x":"1. Smooth Wrinkles: Target fine lines, crow’s feet, and deeper wrinkles like nasolabial folds and marionette lines.2. Restore Volume: Plump up areas like the cheeks, under-eye hollows, and lips.3. Contour and Sculpt: Enhance and define facial features, including the jawline, chin, and cheekbones.4. Quick and Convenient: Achieve youthful results with a minimally invasive procedure that requires no downtime."},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose Apex Medical Center for Dermal Fillers?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Experienced Doctors: Our highly trained specialists have years of experience in dermal filler procedures, ensuring precise and safe application for natural-looking results."},{"x":"Customized Treatment Plans: We understand that every face is unique. That’s why we offer personalized consultations to tailor treatments specifically to your aesthetic goals."},{"x":"FDA-Approved Products: We use only the best brands in the industry, including Juvederm, Restylane, and Radiesse, to ensure high-quality and long-lasting results."},{"x":"Natural-Looking Results: Our approach focuses on subtle enhancements that complement your natural beauty without looking overdone."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Popular Areas for Dermal Fillers"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Lip Enhancement: Add volume and definition to thin or uneven lips."},{"x":"Cheek Fillers: Lift and add fullness to sagging or hollow cheeks."},{"x":"Under-Eye Fillers: Minimize dark circles and restore a refreshed appearance."},{"x":"Jawline and Chin Fillers: Achieve a sharper, more defined jawline or add volume to a receding chin."},{"x":"Nasolabial Folds & Marionette Lines: Smooth deep lines around the mouth for a rejuvenated look."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"What to Expect During Your Dermal Filler Treatment"},{"t":"p","x":"we prioritize your comfort and safety. During your initial consultation, our doctors will assess your facial anatomy, discuss your goals, and develop a customized filler treatment plan. The actual procedure typically takes 30-60 minutes, and results are visible immediately, with full effects seen after a few days as any swelling subsides."},{"t":"h2","x":"FAQ About Dermal Fillers"},{"t":"h3","x":"How long do dermal fillers last?"},{"t":"p","x":"Most dermal fillers last between 6 to 18 months, depending on the product used and the treatment area."},{"t":"h3","x":"Is there downtime after filler treatment?"},{"t":"p","x":"Dermal fillers are a minimally invasive procedure, and most clients can return to their daily activities immediately. Some mild swelling or bruising may occur, but this usually subsides within a few days."},{"t":"h3","x":"Are fillers safe?"},{"t":"p","x":"Yes, we use only FDA-approved fillers that are safe and effective when administered by our trained medical professionals."},{"t":"h3","x":"Schedule Your Consultation at Apex Medical Center"},{"t":"p","x":"Ready to rejuvenate your appearance and boost your confidence? Schedule your personalized consultation today at Apex Medical Center. Our expert team is here to guide you through the entire process, ensuring you achieve the natural, youthful look you desire with dermal fillers."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/endotine-forehead-lift":{"title":"Endotine forehead lift","desc":"Rejuvenate your look with Apex's Endotine Forehead Lift. Achieve a youthful, lifted appearance with advanced techniques for lasting confidence and beauty.","date":"19/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Achieve a Youthful Look with Endotine Forehead Lift at APEX Clinic"},{"t":"p","x":"If you’re looking to rejuvenate your appearance and achieve a more youthful look, consider the Endotine Forehead Lift procedure at APEX Clinic. Our skilled surgeons specialize in this innovative technique, helping you regain your confidence and enhance your facial features."},{"t":"h2","x":"The Endotine Forehead Lift Advantage"},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX Clinic, we understand that aging can affect various areas of your face, including the forehead and brow. That’s why we offer the Endotine Forehead Lift, a minimally invasive procedure designed to address sagging and drooping in the upper face."},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose APEX for Your Endotine Forehead Lift?"},{"t":"p","x":"When you choose APEX Clinic for your Endotine Forehead Lift surgery, you benefit from:","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Skilled Surgeons: Our experienced surgeons are experts in the Endotine technique, ensuring natural-looking and long-lasting results."},{"x":"Personalized Treatment: We customize the procedure to meet your unique needs and goals, delivering the outcome you desire."},{"x":"Minimal Downtime: With a minimally invasive approach, you’ll experience a quicker recovery and can return to your daily activities sooner."},{"x":"Lasting Results: Endotine devices are made to be absorbed by the body over time, providing a lasting lift and youthful appearance."},{"x":"Enhanced Confidence: Our Endotine Forehead Lift can help improve your self-confidence and overall well-being."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Bullet Points: Benefits of Endotine Forehead Lift at APEX Clinic"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Minimally invasive procedure"},{"x":"Natural-looking and gradual results"},{"x":"Customized treatment for your unique needs"},{"x":"Shorter recovery period compared to traditional methods"},{"x":"Long-lasting lift for a more youthful appearance"}]},{"t":"p","x":"Regain your youthful look and boost your confidence with the Endotine Forehead Lift at APEX Clinic. Consult with our expert surgeons today to learn more about this innovative procedure and take the first step toward a rejuvenated appearance."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/eye-bags":{"title":"Eye Bags","desc":"Apex is the leading eye bags clinic, offering state-of-the-art treatment and surgery, based in the heart of Bangkok Thailand","date":"18/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"APEX Eye Bag Surgery: Your Path to Youthful and Brighter Eyes"},{"t":"p","x":"When it comes to achieving a youthful and vibrant appearance, your eyes play a significant role. As time goes by, the delicate skin around your eyes can lose its elasticity, resulting in the development of eye bags, excess fat, and wrinkles. APEX Eye Bag Surgery, also known as blepharoplasty of the lower eyelid, is a revolutionary cosmetic procedure designed to address these concerns and enhance your overall look."},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose APEX Eye Bag Surgery?"},{"t":"h2","x":"Youthful Transformation"},{"t":"p","x":"APEX Eye Bag Surgery is specifically designed to tackle loose skin, excess fat, and wrinkles in the lower eye area. The procedure can provide you with a smoother and more youthful appearance."},{"t":"h2","x":"Say Goodbye to Puffy Eyes"},{"t":"p","x":"As you age, the appearance of puffy, baggy lower eyelids can become more pronounced. APEX Eye Bag Surgery effectively eliminates these concerns, giving your eyes a refreshed and rejuvenated look."},{"t":"h2","x":"Brighter Eyes"},{"t":"p","x":"APEX Eye Bag Surgery doesn’t just address eye bags; it can also help reduce the appearance of dark circles, making your face look noticeably brighter."},{"t":"h2","x":"The APEX Eye Bag Surgery Process"},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX, we take pride in offering a comprehensive and effective eye bag surgery process. Here’s what you can expect:"},{"t":"h2","x":"Initial Consultation"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Schedule a consultation with our experienced APEX surgeon to discuss your goals and expectations."},{"x":"Our surgeon will examine your eye area, assess your skin’s condition, and recommend a tailored treatment plan."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Surgery Day"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"On the day of your APEX Eye Bag Surgery, you’ll be in the hands of skilled professionals."},{"x":"The procedure involves the removal of excess fat and the adjustment of fat distribution in the eye bags area."},{"x":"APEX surgeons use advanced techniques to ensure natural-looking results."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Rapid Results"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Experience immediate results after the surgery, as your eye bags are reduced, and your eyes appear more youthful."},{"x":"The effects of APEX Eye Bag Surgery are dramatic and long-lasting."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Minimal Scarring"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX Eye Bag Surgery is performed with precision and care, ensuring minimal scarring."},{"x":"Incisions are discreetly placed inside the upper eyelid tissue, leaving no visible marks on the skin."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"The APEX Difference"},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX, we set ourselves apart from the competition with our commitment to excellence and patient satisfaction:"},{"t":"h2","x":"Skilled Surgeons"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX is home to a team of highly skilled and experienced surgeons who specialize in eye bag surgery."},{"x":"Our surgeons are dedicated to delivering natural-looking results that enhance your appearance."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Personalized Approach"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"We understand that every patient is unique, and that’s why we tailor our procedures to meet your individual needs."},{"x":"Your APEX surgeon will work closely with you to achieve the results you desire."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Cutting-Edge Techniques"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX stays at the forefront of cosmetic surgery by utilizing the latest techniques and technology."},{"x":"Our commitment to innovation ensures that you receive the best possible care."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Long-Lasting Results"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX Eye Bag Surgery delivers results that stand the test of time."},{"x":"Enjoy a more youthful and refreshed appearance that lasts for years to come."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"APEX Eye Bag Surgery: Before and After"},{"t":"p","x":"Witness the transformative power of APEX Eye Bag Surgery through these impressive before-and-after photos:"},{"t":"h2","x":"Before Surgery"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Image: Patient with prominent eye bags, loose skin, and dark circles."},{"x":"Description: The patient’s eyes appear tired and aged."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"After Surgery"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Image: Same patient with smooth, rejuvenated lower eyelids and brighter eyes."},{"x":"Description: The patient’s eyes look significantly more youthful and refreshed."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Is APEX Eye Bag Surgery Right for You?"},{"t":"p","x":"Wondering if APEX Eye Bag Surgery is the right choice for you? Consider the following:"},{"t":"h2","x":"Ideal Candidates"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Individuals with noticeable eye bags, excess fat, and wrinkles in the lower eyelid area."},{"x":"Those seeking a more youthful and refreshed appearance."},{"x":"Patients looking to reduce the appearance of dark circles under their eyes."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Consultation"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Schedule a consultation with APEX to determine your candidacy for the procedure."},{"x":"Our skilled surgeon will assess your specific concerns and recommend a personalized treatment plan."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Realistic Expectations"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Understand the expected outcomes and discuss your goals with your APEX surgeon."},{"x":"APEX Eye Bag Surgery can provide remarkable results, but it’s essential to have realistic expectations."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"APEX Eye Bag Surgery FAQs"},{"t":"p","x":"Have questions about APEX Eye Bag Surgery? We have answers:"},{"t":"h2","x":"How long is the recovery period?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Typically, patients can resume their normal activities within a week after surgery."},{"x":"Full recovery may take a few weeks, with mild bruising and swelling gradually subsiding."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Are the results permanent?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX Eye Bag Surgery provides long-lasting results."},{"x":"However, the natural aging process will continue, and some changes may occur over time."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Is the procedure painful?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX surgeons prioritize patient comfort and use anesthesia to minimize discomfort during the surgery."},{"x":"Any post-operative discomfort can usually be managed with prescribed medications."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"What are the risks involved?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX Eye Bag Surgery is generally safe when performed by experienced surgeons."},{"x":"Risks may include infection, scarring, or temporary changes in eyelid sensation, which will be discussed during your consultation."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Schedule Your APEX Eye Bag Surgery Consultation Today!"},{"t":"p","x":"Are you ready to transform your appearance and enjoy brighter, more youthful eyes? Contact APEX today to schedule your consultation and take the first step toward achieving your cosmetic goals. Our experienced surgeons and personalized approach make APEX Eye Bag Surgery the premier choice for enhancing your natural beauty. Join the ranks of satisfied APEX patients who have experienced remarkable transformations. Discover the APEX difference for yourself!"},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/face-and-neck-lift":{"title":"Face and Neck Lift","desc":"Rediscover youth with Apex's Face and Neck Lift. Achieve a rejuvenated look with expert care for firmer, smoother skin and a timeless appearance.","date":"19/02/2025","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Face-and-Neck-Lift.webp","alt":"Face and Neck Lift"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Face-and-Neck-Lift.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Face-and-Neck-Lift.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"APEX Facelift and Neck Lift Procedures: Rediscover Your Youth"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Facial aging is a natural process."},{"x":"Over time, the skin loses its elasticity, resulting in various signs of aging."},{"x":"APEX, a renowned brand in cosmetic surgery, offers advanced facelift and neck lift procedures in Bangkok, Thailand."}]},{"t":"p","x":"We are dedicated to helping you achieve a youthful and rejuvenated appearance"},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose APEX?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX specializes in full facelift surgeries, including neck lifts."},{"x":"Our expertise spans various age groups, from 20s to 80s."},{"x":"Ideal candidates for APEX procedures exhibit specific aging concerns."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Office syndrome"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Deep nasolabial folds (lines from nose to mouth)."},{"x":"Loss of a well-defined jawline."},{"x":"Sagging cheekbones, often referred to as jowls."},{"x":"Loose skin, wrinkles, or excess fatty tissue in the neck."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Facelift Surgery with APEX"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Facelift surgery, or rhytidectomy, targets sagging and drooping skin on the face."},{"x":"APEX’s procedure involves:– Elevating and redraping facial skin.– Tightening the underlying platysma muscle.– Removing excess fat."},{"x":"Most patients requiring a neck lift also benefit from a facelift to address neck tissues effectively."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"APEX Neck Lift"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"The neck area is delicate and prone to aging effects."},{"x":"A neck lift, also called cervicoplasty or platysmaplasty, can address these concerns."},{"x":"The procedure includes:– Elevating and redraping neck skin.– Tightening the underlying platysma muscle.– Removing excess neck fat."},{"x":"APEX neck lifts help restore a smoother, firmer, and well-defined neckline."},{"x":"The procedure also contributes to tightening facial skin, reducing wrinkles and jowls."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Ideal Candidates"},{"t":"p","x":"APEX’s neck lift is ideal for individuals bothered by:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Excess neck fat."},{"x":"Jowls."},{"x":"Abnormal contours due to muscle banding."},{"x":"Double chin caused by fat deposits."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Neck Lift Procedure in Thailand"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"During neck lift surgery, incisions are strategically placed around and behind the ear and under the chin."},{"x":"The surgeon accesses the underlying platysma muscle and neck structure."},{"x":"Loose neck muscles are tightened and stitched together."},{"x":"Excess skin is trimmed, and liposuction may be performed to remove fat."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Recovery"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"After surgery, patients may experience:– Swelling.– Bruising.– Tightness.– Numbness in the surgical area."},{"x":"Recovery typically spans a few weeks."},{"x":"It’s important to keep the head elevated and avoid straining neck muscles."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Who Needs APEX Facelift Surgery?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX facelift surgery is designed for individuals aiming to improve the signs of aging in the face and neck."},{"x":"Common concerns include:– Deep nasolabial folds.– Lost jawline definition.– Sagging cheekbones.– Excess neck fat."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Full Facelift Surgery Procedure"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Patients are placed under anesthesia."},{"x":"Surgery time varies (1 to 4 hours) depending on the treatment area."},{"x":"APEX’s facelift procedure involves incisions that are strategically hidden:– Temples.– In front of and behind the ears.– Lower scalp.– Neck lift incision starts in front of the earlobe and continues around the ear to the lower scalp."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"The surgery includes:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Elevating and tightening facial and neck tissues."},{"x":"Sculpting or repositioning fat deposits."},{"x":"Removing excess skin."},{"x":"Inserting sutures to aid in healing."}]},{"t":"p","x":"With APEX, you can embark on a journey to rediscover your youthful beauty and confidence. Schedule a consultation with our skilled surgeons at APEX Clinic in Bangkok to discuss your unique needs, expected results, recovery timeline, and the cost of these life-enhancing procedures in Thailand."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/facial-face-toning-pigmentation":{"title":"Facial, Face Toning & Pigmentation","desc":"Apex is the leading clinic for facial toning and pigmentation, offering state-of-the-art surgery and therapies, based in the heart of Bangkok Thailand","date":"17/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Facial Treatments:"},{"t":"p","x":"Facial treatments include a wide range of techniques and technologies designed to improve the overall health and appearance of the skin. These treatments can include deep cleansing, exfoliation, hydration, and other targeted therapies."},{"t":"p","x":"Apex technologies used for facial treatments include Pro Facial, Micro Dermabrasion, Derma infusion, HydraFacial, Oxygen Infusion facial, Plasma energy and Light chemical peel."},{"t":"h2","x":"Laser Skin Rejuvenation:"},{"t":"p","x":"Laser skin rejuvenation treatments use laser technology to improve skin texture, reduce the appearance of pigmentation, and stimulate collagen production. These treatments are designed to provide a noninvasive alternative to traditional skin resurfacing procedures."},{"t":"p","x":"Apex technologies used for laser skin rejuvenation include IPL, Dual yellow, Fraxel fine, Fotona, Pico laser, Q switch Yag laser (spectra, med lite, Biaxis) micro needling, Venus Viva, E Matrix, Scarlet, Endymed, Fractora, and Morpheus8, Erbium yag"},{"t":"h2","x":"Plasma skin rejuvenation:"},{"t":"p","x":"Plasma Energy for Facial Toning: During the procedure, the device emits a controlled burst of plasma energy, which is a highly energized gas. This energy is focused on the treatment area, creating small, controlled burns that stimulate collagen production and promote the regeneration of healthy skin cells."},{"t":"p","x":"Plasma energy treatment can be effective for facial toning, as it can help to tighten loose or sagging skin, reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, and improve overall skin texture"},{"t":"p","x":"The frequency of treatments will depend on the patient’s desired results and the severity of their skin concerns, but typically multiple sessions are needed to achieve optimal results. The procedure is generally well-tolerated, with minimal pain and downtime."},{"t":"h2","x":"Skin Pigmentation Treatment:"},{"t":"p","x":"Skin pigmentation treatments are designed to reduce the appearance of dark spots, sun damage, and other forms of pigmentation on the face. These treatments use technology to target pigmentation at a cellular level, resulting in a more even and uniform skin tone."},{"t":"p","x":"Apex technologies used for skin pigmentation treatment include Pico Sure, Pico care, Pico-nano Star walker, Q switch Nd yag (Spectra, Med lite, Biaxis), IPL (Intense Pulsed Light) therapy"},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/ha-skin-booster":{"title":"HA Skin Booster","desc":"HA Skin Booster | At Apex, we pride ourselves on being at the forefront when it comes to new advancements and innovations in health and cosmetic surgery.","date":"17/02/2025","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/HA-skinboosters.webp","alt":"HA Skin Booster"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/HA-skinboosters.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/HA-skinboosters.webp","blocks":[{"t":"p","x":"Volite or Juvederm HA Skin Booster is a new type of cross-linked hyaluronic acid called VYCROSS, which is a special technology invented by Allergan consisting of short and long cross-linked hyaluronic chains. The hyaluronic gel texture of Volite or Juvederm HA Skin Booster is stable and has a uniform gel texture. Easy to inject and produces natural results, Volite or JUVEDERM HA Skin Booster formulas contain lidocaine to make the patient more comfortable during the injection. The injection process of Volite or Juvederm HA Skin Booster is an injection that pushes the drug under the upper surface of the skin and does not require recovery. Commercial products that contain hydrating ingredients like hyaluronic acid only coat the skin. make the result not last long Frequent injections are required every 1-3 months, but Volite or Juvederm HA Skin Booster are the only ones that restore hyaluronic acid in the skin. It restores natural elasticity for healthy, plump, radiant skin while also enhancing its lifting and firming effect."},{"t":"p","x":"Volite or Juvederm HA Skin Booster is a product specially created to increase hydration, elasticity, suppleness and improve the health of the skin. Skin looks younger. In addition to injections on the face, it can also be injected around the neck. Chest and back of the hands as well. Volite or Juvederm HA Skin Booster products, in addition to properties that are different from other products on the market mentioned above. After the injection, there is no swelling or bruising. The results still last for almost a year and make the skin look smoother, more beautiful, and more natural. Volite or Juvederm HA Skin Booster deeply moisturizes the skin. Revitalizes and rejuvenates the skin."},{"t":"p","x":"Volite or Juvederm HA Skin Booster is the only product whose results last up to 9 months after just one injection and results and differences can be seen immediately in the first month. The working process of Volite or Juvederm HA Skin Booster is 3 times more than similar products currently on the market. The Volite or Juvederm HA Skin Booster product is pushed under the skin by poking the skin with a very small and thin needle. While injecting, you feel comfortable, reduce pain, swelling, and there is almost no bleeding during the procedure."},{"t":"p","x":"Volite or Juvederm HA Skin Booster is the newest innovation that creates natural, long-lasting results after just one injection. Volite or Juvederm HA Skin Booster can be used alone as a standalone procedure or as a custom injection. skin condition Prevent and protect the skin from free radicals before injecting fillers for beautiful, natural results."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/hair-transplant-center":{"title":"Advanced Hair Transplant in Bangkok with Cutting-Edge Technology","desc":"Restore your hair with Apex’s hair transplant services. Our skilled team provides natural results using advanced techniques.","date":"18/02/2025","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/what-is-a-hair-transplant.webp","alt":"What is a Hair Transplant"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/what-is-a-hair-transplant.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/what-is-a-hair-transplant.webp","blocks":[{"t":"p","x":"When you engage the services of APEX Medical Center for your premium Thailand hair transplant, you gain access to a world of sophisticated technology, experience, and expertise. Our fast, efficient process uses state-of-the-art technology, such as computer assistance, to harvest hair follicles and a semi-robotic arm to remove and replace the follicular units accurately. However, a human touch is still required because each person’s hairline is unique. Your doctor’s skill and artistic execution are essential for a more natural look. Combining innovative modern techniques and supremely skillful, experienced medical staff is an unbeatable option for hair transplantation surgery."},{"t":"h2","x":"What is a Hair Transplant?"},{"t":"p","x":"Since their inception in the early 1900s, hair transplant procedures have undergone several significant evolutionary changes. Traditional hair transplant surgery involves removing viable hair (grafts) from their existing location (donor area) and placing them where the patient lacks hair (recipient area). Typically, hair is removed from the back and sides of the head and moved to the top and front. There are two options for harvesting the grafts for transplantation, namely:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Follicular Unit Extraction (FUE)—More advanced and less invasive than FUSS, and the implanted hair generally looks more natural. Instead of removing the skin and preparing grafts, the surgeon shaves the donor area and removes individual follicles before planting them into the target area. Removing and replanting the follicles correctly is the most challenging aspect of the surgery, but FUE leaves microscopic wounds that heal with no significant scarring. Although basic FUE has some limitations because of its complexity, the advanced version uses automated robots to increase accuracy, reduce surgery times, and create outstanding natural looks."}]},{"t":"p","x":"Apex Medical Center never accepts anything less than the best, so we use Neograft for our advanced FUE, the best hair transplant in Thailand."},{"t":"h2","x":"Is a Robot Hair Transplant Superior to Traditional Hair Implants in Thailand?"},{"t":"p","x":"With traditional follicular unit extraction, removing units of hair has always proved to be the most challenging aspect. Several hours are often required, sometimes spread over several sessions, to remove enough follicles to facilitate a natural-looking hair transplant. The introduction of automated machinery significantly speeds up this process, improving accuracy as it does so."},{"t":"p","x":"Another challenge comes in the shape of placing the follicular unit correctly and naturally. Again, the robot negates this issue, grafting a higher-quality hair unit in place with incredible accuracy. This gives the doctor a better standard of hair to work with, resulting in more natural growth. Although automated robots are transforming the Thai hair transplant industry, the ultimate look of your transplant still depends on your doctor’s expertise."},{"t":"p","x":"The other advantage of this new technology is that it is the least invasive of its kind, meaning there are no scalpel incisions, sutures, or linear scars. This makes surgery less painful and recovery times much faster. Many clients return to their normal activities the next day, and with no scarring to contend with, pain and skin tightening are taken out of the equation."},{"t":"h2","x":"The top 5 reasons people choose Robot Hair Transplants to combat hair loss"},{"t":"list","o":true,"items":[{"x":"With no stitches or staples, it is the least invasive procedure for hair restoration"},{"x":"As no scalpel is required, there is little to no discomfort involved"},{"x":"The results are healthier and more natural-looking"},{"x":"No incisions mean no associated linear scars"},{"x":"Recovery times are much faster, with patients resuming their normal activities as early as the next day"}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Who Can Get Hair Implants in Bangkok?"},{"t":"p","x":"There are many reasons why people opt for hair transplant surgery in Thailand and beyond. Patients who experience scalp damage due to accidents or lose their hair through illness may get hair transplants to retain their original appearance. Patients experiencing natural hair loss and baldness often choose hair transplantation surgery to regain their original appearance and even encourage some hair growth."},{"t":"p","x":"Whatever your reasons for choosing APEX as your preferred hair clinic in Bangkok, you can relax knowing that you are in the best hair transplant clinic in Thailand. Our experienced, knowledgeable team will consult with you in-depth before making decisions and offer information, advice, and guidance at every step."},{"t":"h2","x":"Contact APEX Medical Center about a Hair Transplant Package in Thailand"},{"t":"p","x":"If you’re interested in learning more or experiencing natural-looking results with Apex Medical Center’s robot hair transplant for yourself, please do not hesitate to contact us today. With highly trained, discreet, and courteous staff and Thailand’s best hair transplant facility, you will not be disappointed you chose APEX."},{"t":"p","x":"Put yourself in the expert hands of the team at APEX Medical Center, and let us handle the rest. Our experience, professionalism, cutting-edge techniques, and technology perfectly combine for your seamless, game-changing transformation."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/iv-drip-weight-loss":{"title":"IV Drip Weight Loss","desc":"Enhance weight loss with Apex's IV drip treatment. Experience a fast, effective solution to burn fat and boost metabolism with cutting-edge technology.","date":"17/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"THE ULTIMATE FAT BURNER"},{"t":"p","x":"Vanquish, the latest in innovative high-tech treatments, is the first of its kind that uses selective radio frequency to kill fat cells without damaging skin or muscle."},{"t":"p","x":"“Some procedures are painful and may take a long time; others are effective only on small areas of body fat that can be sucked up through a small vacuum. Vanquish combats all those problem. It can treat a large surface area evenly. It’s fast, efficient, and comfortable,” Dr. Nantapat Supapannachart, founder of Apex Profound Beauty states, adding, ” This is a big technological breakthrough.”"},{"t":"p","x":"“This new technique is a real game changer—it’s the safest, easiest way to remove fat,” says Robert Weiss, a President-Elect at American Society for Laser Medicine and Surgery , a former associate professor of dermatology at Johns Hopkins Hospital and a past president of the American Society for Dermatologic Surgery (ASDS)."},{"t":"p","x":"“As the panels heat up, the radio frequency waves they transmit differentiate between fat cells (which are denser and hold less water) and skin and muscle cells,” he explains. “The heat causes cell death in the fat cells; some die instantly, some in a matter of weeks.” The dead cells are filtered through the lymphatic system, metabolized in the liver, and excreted in the urine. “"},{"t":"p","x":"“It is a remarkable piece of engineering that I really didn’t think was even possible. Not only is it possible, but it works well and is comfortable; patients feel a little warmth around the abdomen. Our initial clinical results have been quite remarkable.”"},{"t":"h2","x":"HOW DOES IT WORK?"},{"t":"p","x":"This Czech-made technology distinguishes between fat and muscle tissue and the radio frequency waves do not penetrate deep enough to harm any internal organs. During the procedure patients lie underneath the device with the panels positioned close to, but not touching, the treatment area. What makes this device revolutionary is that it uses focused-field radio frequency to zap fat without the need to touch the patient’s body."},{"t":"h2","x":"HOW SAFE IS IT?"},{"t":"p","x":"Several animal and human studies published in a medical journal (Lasers in Surgery and Medicine) between 2009 and 2013 have shown that Vanquish ll targets only the fat layer, without hurting or affecting the skin, sweat glands, hair follicles, muscle, or internal organs. Because it is not a laser, there is no skin peeling, pigment change, or prolonged healing. Depending on your skin, the area may be pink for 1-2 hours’ post treatment or at the worst theremay be mild redness or swelling for a few days but the skin color quickly returns to normal."},{"t":"h2","x":"WHO IS THIS GOOD FOR?"},{"t":"p","x":"The ideal candidates for Vanquish are people above the age of 21, with overall good health and the desire to eliminate fat from their midsection without surgery. It is not recommended for those with metal implants. Cool sculpting or liposuction would be a better choice in that case."},{"t":"h2","x":"HOW MANY TREATMENTS ARE REQUIRED?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"4 to 6 sessions"},{"x":"45 minutes per session"}]},{"t":"h2","x":"HOW TO PREPARE?"},{"t":"p","x":"Hydration is the key to successful treatment. Patients should drink two liters of water the day before, day of, and two days following the treatment. Your fat does not absorb significant amounts of water, so Vanquish is better able to target it when your other tissues are well hydrated."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/laser-hair-removal":{"title":"Laser Hair Removal","desc":"Transform your skin into smooth skin with laser hair removal, a long-term hair removal method that is suitable for all skin types.","date":"26/01/2024","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Laser-Hair-Removal-cover.webp","alt":"เลเซอร์ขน Apex"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Laser-Hair-Removal-ch-05.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Laser-Hair-Removal-cover.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Laser Hair Removal: A Popular Choice for Smooth, Hair-Free Skin"},{"t":"p","x":"Ever wondered why laser hair removal is such a popular choice? If you’re looking for an effective way to say goodbye to unwanted hair, this guide will help you understand what laser hair removal is, how it works, its benefits, and why it has become a top choice for many."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/What-is-laser-hair-removal-en.webp","alt":"What is laser hair removal"},{"t":"h2","x":"What is Laser Hair Removal?"},{"t":"p","x":"Laser hair removal is an advanced technology that uses laser light to target and destroy melanin in the hair follicles. This process inhibits hair growth over time, leading to finer, lighter, and fewer hairs."},{"t":"h2","x":"How Does Laser Hair Removal Work?"},{"t":"h3","x":"Targeting Hair Follicles"},{"t":"p","x":"High-intensity laser beams are absorbed by melanin in the hair follicle, generating heat that effectively destroys the follicle’s ability to grow hair. Over time, treated hairs naturally fall out."},{"t":"h3","x":"Protecting the Skin"},{"t":"p","x":"Modern laser devices include cooling systems or gels to minimize discomfort and prevent skin irritation during the treatment, making it a safe and comfortable experience."},{"t":"h3","x":"Disrupting the Hair Growth Cycle"},{"t":"p","x":"Laser treatment targets hair in the anagen (growth) phase when the hair is still attached to the follicle. Repeated sessions gradually reduce hair regrowth, leading to smoother skin without ingrown hairs, stubble, or irritation from shaving or waxing."},{"t":"h2","x":"Benefits & Things to Know About Laser Hair Removal"},{"t":"h3","x":"Benefits:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Long-Term Hair Reduction – Significant hair reduction after 5-6 sessions, depending on individual hair growth."},{"x":"Works on Various Body Areas – Effective for the face, underarms, arms, legs, bikini line, and more."},{"x":"Reduces Ingrown Hairs – Helps prevent painful ingrown hairs and stubble from shaving or waxing."},{"x":"Smoother Skin – Improves skin texture and reduces dark spots caused by friction or shaving."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Things to Consider:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Requires Multiple Sessions – For optimal results, multiple sessions are necessary."},{"x":"Mild Discomfort – Feels like a slight rubber band snap, but cooling technology minimizes discomfort."},{"x":"Avoid Sun Exposure – Protect skin from direct sunlight before and after treatment to prevent irritation."}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Popular-Areas-for-Laser-Hair-Removal-en.webp","alt":"Popular Areas for Laser Hair Removal"},{"t":"h2","x":"Popular Areas for Laser Hair Removal"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Underarms – Reduces sweat buildup and odor while keeping skin smooth."},{"x":"Legs – Eliminates ingrown hairs and thick regrowth after shaving."},{"x":"Bikini Area & Brazilian – Enhances hygiene and confidence."},{"x":"Face & Upper Lip – Removes fine hair for clearer, more radiant skin."},{"x":"Beard & Neck – Minimizes shaving frequency and reduces irritation."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"5 Essential Steps to Prepare for Laser Hair Removal"},{"t":"list","o":true,"items":[{"x":"Avoid Plucking or Waxing – Stop waxing or plucking at least 2-4 weeks before treatment to ensure the follicles remain intact."},{"x":"Skip Harsh Skincare Products – Avoid AHA/BHA-based skincare products for at least one week before treatment."},{"x":"Minimize Sun Exposure – Stay out of direct sunlight for at least 1-2 weeks before your appointment."},{"x":"Shave the Treatment Area – Shave the targeted area 1-2 days before treatment for better laser penetration."},{"x":"Inform Your Technician About Medications – Some medications can make your skin more sensitive to laser treatment."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Post-Treatment Care Tips"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Avoid Sun Exposure – Apply sunscreen and avoid direct sunlight for at least 1-2 weeks."},{"x":"Let Hair Shed Naturally – Do not pluck, wax, or shave between sessions."},{"x":"Use Gentle Skincare – Moisturize with fragrance-free products to prevent irritation."},{"x":"Skip Hot Showers & Saunas – Avoid heat exposure for at least 48 hours post-treatment."},{"x":"Monitor Skin Reactions – If redness or irritation persists for more than 2-3 days, consult a specialist."}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Top-Laser-Hair-Removal-Machines-en.webp","alt":"Laser Hair Removal"},{"t":"h2","x":"Top Laser Hair Removal Technologies"},{"t":"p","x":"Different laser types suit different skin tones and hair textures. Here are three of the most widely used laser technologies:"},{"t":"h3","x":"Diode Laser"},{"t":"p","x":"Suitable for most skin types, especially fair to medium tones."},{"t":"h3","x":"IPL (Intense Pulsed Light)"},{"t":"p","x":"Not a true laser but effective for hair reduction and skin rejuvenation."},{"t":"h3","x":"ND:YAG Laser"},{"t":"p","x":"Ideal for darker skin tones and thick hair, penetrating deeper into the follicles."},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose Apex for Laser Hair Removal?"},{"t":"p","x":"At Apex, we offer top-tier laser hair removal services backed by the latest technology and expert care."},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Certified Skin Specialists – Our trained professionals ensure safe and effective treatments."},{"x":"FDA-Approved Laser Equipment – We use advanced laser machines that meet medical safety standards."},{"x":"Personalized Skin Assessments – Customized treatment plans tailored to your skin and hair type."},{"x":"Hygienic & Sterile Environment – High-standard cleanliness and equipment sterilization."},{"x":"Proven Results & Client Reviews – Trusted by thousands with positive testimonials."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"Is Laser Hair Removal Painful?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Most clients describe it as a light rubber band snap. Advanced cooling technology makes the process more comfortable."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Is Laser Hair Removal Permanent?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"While not completely permanent, it significantly reduces hair growth long-term. Regular maintenance sessions enhance lasting results."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Do I Need to Shave Before Treatment?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Yes, shave the targeted area 1-2 days before your session to allow better laser absorption."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Can Pregnant Women Get Laser Hair Removal?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"It’s not recommended during pregnancy due to hormonal fluctuations that may affect treatment efficacy."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How Many Sessions Do I Need?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Most clients see results within the first session, but 5-8 treatments are recommended for the best outcome."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How Often Should I Get Laser Hair Removal?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Treatments are typically scheduled every 4-6 weeks, depending on the hair growth cycle."}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Conclusion: Laser Hair Removal for Smooth, Hair-Free Skin"},{"t":"p","x":"Laser hair removal is a highly effective, long-term solution for reducing unwanted hair. It works by targeting the root of the hair follicle, ensuring smoother skin with minimal regrowth. Suitable for various body areas, it helps eliminate ingrown hairs, irritation, and shaving discomfort."},{"t":"p","x":"For the best results, Apex provides expert treatments using advanced technology. Book your session today and enjoy long-lasting, silky-smooth skin"},{"t":"h2","x":"Our Exclusive Clients"},{"t":"gallery","items":["~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Armpit-hair-laser-review-04.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Leg-hair-laser-review-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Leg-hair-laser-review-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Leg-hair-laser-review-04.webp"]},{"t":"p","x":"Results may vary from person to person."}]},"service/laser-hair-removal-bangkok":{"title":"Laser Hair Removal Bangkok","desc":"Apex is the leading laser hair removal clinic, offering state-of-the-art surgery and therapies, based in the heart of Bangkok Thailand","date":null,"hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Home","h":"index.html"},{"x":"Services","h":"services.html"},{"x":"Laser Hair Removal Bangkok","h":"service.html?p=service/laser-hair-removal-bangkok"}]},{"t":"h2","x":"LASER HAIR REMOVAL IN THAILAND"},{"t":"h2","x":"Fast and Easy treatment of unwanted hair on your: Face • Underarms • Arms • Chest • Back • Bikini • Legs"},{"t":"p","x":"In these busy modern times, most people find it frustrating dealing with time-consuming tasks like shaving, waxing and wasting time on ineffective hair removal treatments. The good news is that now hair removal doesn’t have to be so challenging because at APEX, we’ve mastered the process of permanent laser hair removal. We offer the best treatments for laser hair removal in Bangkok and have the most experienced nurses and laser practitioners in the country working with us, so you can rest assured that you are in safe hands and getting the safest, most effective treatment."},{"t":"h2","x":"WHAT KIND OF LASERS DOES APEX USE?"},{"t":"p","x":"We only use effective technologies, and to ensure safe, effective results, we always test your suitability for any of our laser treatments."},{"t":"p","x":"We have many types of FDA-cleared lasers. Our two decades of experience in laser hair removal in Thailand has shown that no one laser can accommodate all skin types and colors. Dark skin types require a specific YAG laser to be safe and effective. For lighter skin types APEX uses the Alexandrite laser, which is considered the gold standard in laser hair removal."},{"t":"h2","x":"WHO PERFORMS LASER HAIR REMOVAL?"},{"t":"p","x":"All laser hair removal treatments are performed by one of APEX’s well-trained medical professionals. Each practitioner is extensively trained before performing any procedure. Additionally, a licensed medical doctor serves as a medical director at each individual location, and oversees all treatments and supervises the medical staff."},{"t":"h2","x":"WHAT EXPERIENCE DOES APEX HAVE WITH LASER HAIR REMOVAL?"},{"t":"p","x":"APEX opened its first location in 1995 and quickly became the pioneer of laser hair removal in Thailand. Since then we have performed over 3 million laser hair removal treatments. When it comes to Laser hair removal, we are the nation’s industry leader. APEX is the only national laser hair removal company with a fully operational laser hair removal training center. We are committed to providing the best practices for laser hair removal in Bangkok and the rest of Thailand; we set the standard of excellence and the pace for others to follow."},{"t":"h2","x":"WHAT TYPES OF HAIR COLOR AND SKIN COLOR CAN BE TREATED WITH LASER HAIR REMOVAL?"},{"t":"p","x":"While laser hair removal can be performed on virtually any skin color and hair type, hair color is the most important factor. The light emitted from the laser is attracted to the melanin, or dark pigment, in the hair follicle. This means that dark hair is treated most effectively. Treatments performed on red, blonde, and gray hair are not generally as effective. Our multiple laser modalities at each APEX location, allow us great versatility for accommodating the wide variance in hair and skin color."},{"t":"h2","x":"HOW MUCH DOES LASER HAIR REMOVAL COST?"},{"t":"p","x":"Laser hair removal requires a series of treatments to be effective. There are no short cuts to this process. Each treatment removes a progressive percentage of the hair until ultimately the skin becomes smooth and hair free. APEX accurately prices its treatment packages through completion of the process, and beyond."},{"t":"p","x":"You’ll be happy to know we offer the best package for laser hair removal in Thailand. We recommend a free consultation to make sure we customize the right amount of treatments for each of our guests. We have several different payment options to fit your personal situation, which makes removing unwanted hair easy and affordable for EVERYONE!"},{"t":"p","x":"Things to consider when choosing a laser hair removal provider:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"The medical degree and experience level of the treatment provider"},{"x":"The number of years the company has been in business"},{"x":"The quality of the hair removal equipment (lasers)"},{"x":"The ability to safely treat all skin colors"},{"x":"Convenient locationsAccurate pricing to"},{"x":"procedure completion"}]},{"t":"h2","x":"WHY IS OUR COMPLIMENTARY CONSULTATION IMPORTANT"},{"t":"p","x":"Coming in for a complimentary APEX consultation is the most important step towards solving your unwanted hair problem. Your guest consultant will determine whether you’re an appropriate candidate for successful treatment. Additionally, you will learn how laser treatment works and how much it costs. Our consultants have been asked every question imaginable and are committed to handling all your concerns about laser hair removal in Bangkok. Your personal information and case details will be regarded in strict confidence."},{"t":"p","x":"LASER HAIR REMOVAL with Thailand’s Most Experienced Laser Clinic.Choose APEX because we can guarantee you’ll be getting the Latest & Best state-of-the-art technology!"},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/line-wrinkle":{"title":"Line & Wrinkle","desc":"Apex is the leading line, anti-aging and anti-wrinkle clinic, offering state-of-the-art surgery and treatments, based in the heart of Bangkok Thailand","date":"17/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Understanding Lines and Wrinkles"},{"t":"p","x":"As the sands of time continue to trickle, our skin undergoes a natural transformation that’s written in the form of lines and wrinkles. These subtle signs of aging are a testament to the experiences and stories our skin carries with it. However, with advancements in skincare and a deeper understanding of the aging process, there’s a lot we can do to embrace the passage of time gracefully. In this article, we delve into the world of lines and wrinkles, exploring their causes, prevention, and treatment to help you put your best face forward."},{"t":"h3","x":"Understanding Lines and Wrinkles:"},{"t":"p","x":"Lines and wrinkles are the result of multiple factors that influence the skin’s structure and elasticity. Here’s a breakdown of the main contributors:"},{"t":"list","o":true,"items":[{"x":"Aging: The primary cause of lines and wrinkles is the natural aging process. As we age, our skin produces less collagen and elastin, which are essential proteins responsible for maintaining skin’s firmness and elasticity."},{"x":"Sun Exposure: Prolonged and unprotected sun exposure can lead to premature aging. UV rays break down collagen and elastin fibers, causing the skin to sag and wrinkle. This is why using sunscreen daily is crucial."},{"x":"Facial Expressions: Repetitive facial movements, such as squinting, frowning, and smiling, can create creases over time. These are known as dynamic wrinkles and are most common around the eyes, forehead, and mouth."},{"x":"Environmental Factors: Pollution, smoking, and poor diet can contribute to the breakdown of collagen and elastin, accelerating the formation of lines and wrinkles."},{"x":"Genetics: Genetic predisposition plays a role in how quickly lines and wrinkles appear. Some people naturally have more resilient skin, while others might experience signs of aging earlier."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Preventing Lines and Wrinkles:"},{"t":"p","x":"While we can’t stop the aging process, there are steps we can take to slow down the development of lines and wrinkles:"},{"t":"list","o":true,"items":[{"x":"Healthy Lifestyle: Adopt a balanced diet rich in antioxidants, vitamins, and minerals. Stay hydrated and limit processed foods, sugar, and excessive alcohol consumption."},{"x":"Sun Protection: Apply a broad-spectrum sunscreen daily, even on cloudy days. Wearing protective clothing, sunglasses, and wide-brimmed hats can further shield your skin from UV rays."},{"x":"Skincare Routine: Establish a consistent skincare routine that includes cleansing, moisturizing, and using products with proven anti-aging ingredients like retinoids, hyaluronic acid, and peptides."},{"x":"Hydration: Well-hydrated skin appears plumper and more youthful. Use a quality moisturizer and consider incorporating a humidifier into your living spaces, especially in drier climates."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Treating Lines and Wrinkles:"},{"t":"p","x":"If lines and wrinkles have already made an appearance, there are several effective treatments available:"},{"t":"list","o":true,"items":[{"x":"Topical Treatments: Over-the-counter and prescription creams containing retinoids, antioxidants, and peptides can help reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles."},{"x":"Medical Procedures: Dermatological treatments like Botox injections, dermal fillers, chemical peels, and laser therapy can provide more dramatic results by targeting specific areas.","h":"service.html?p=service/botox"},{"x":"Microneedling: This procedure involves using fine needles to create controlled micro-injuries in the skin, stimulating collagen production and improving overall skin texture."},{"x":"Lifestyle Changes: Improving sleep quality, managing stress, and maintaining a healthy weight can contribute to healthier, more youthful-looking skin."}]},{"t":"p","x":"In conclusion, lines and wrinkles are natural signs of aging that can be influenced by various factors. By understanding their causes, taking preventive measures, and exploring available treatments, you can embrace aging gracefully and confidently. Remember, every line on your face tells a story, and the journey is worth celebrating at every stage."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/mens-womens-health":{"title":"Men’s & Women’s Health","desc":"Apex’s Men’s & Women’s Health programs focus on your unique wellness needs. Get personalized care for optimal health.","date":"17/02/2025","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/portrait-happy-young-couple-sitting-smiling-bed-hand-make-heart-shape-together.webp","alt":"Men’s & Women’s Health"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/portrait-happy-young-couple-sitting-smiling-bed-hand-make-heart-shape-together.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/portrait-happy-young-couple-sitting-smiling-bed-hand-make-heart-shape-together.webp","blocks":[{"t":"p","x":"At Apex Anti-Aging Center, we understand that men and women have unique health concerns that require specialized care. We offer a range of services tailored to address the specific health needs of both men and women."},{"t":"p","x":"For men, we offer a variety of treatments to improve sexual health and address concerns such as erectile dysfunction and low testosterone. Our treatments include shockwave therapy, stem cell therapy, and hormone replacement therapy. Shockwave therapy is a non-invasive treatment that uses acoustic waves to stimulate blood flow and promote tissue regeneration in the penis. Stem cell therapy involves using stem cells from your own body to repair and regenerate damaged tissue, and hormone replacement therapy can help improve testosterone levels and alleviate symptoms of low testosterone."},{"t":"p","x":"For women, we offer treatments to improve sexual health, including vaginal rejuvenation and hormone replacement therapy. Vaginal rejuvenation can help improve vaginal laxity and dryness, and hormone replacement therapy can help alleviate symptoms of menopause, such as hot flashes and vaginal dryness."},{"t":"p","x":"In addition to these specialized treatments, we also offer general health services for both men and women, including lab testing, physician consultations, and IV therapy. Our lab testing services can help identify underlying health issues and guide personalized treatment plans. Our physician consultations provide personalized care and support for all of your health concerns. And our IV therapy can help boost energy levels, improve immune function, and promote overall health and well-being."},{"t":"p","x":"At Apex Anti-Aging Center, we are dedicated to providing the highest quality care and treatment options for both men and women. Our medical professionals will work with you to create a personalized treatment plan that addresses your specific health needs and helps you achieve your goals for improved health and wellness."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/pain-management":{"title":"Innovative Pain Management with Personalized Care at Apex Anti-Aging","desc":"Relieve chronic pain with Apex's personalized treatments. Restore mobility and enjoy a pain-free life.","date":"17/02/2025","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/man-holds-his-back-due-pain-e1739813248151.webp","alt":"Pain management"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/man-holds-his-back-due-pain-e1739813248151.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/man-holds-his-back-due-pain-e1739813248151.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Pain management"},{"t":"p","x":"Joint pain can be a debilitating condition that affects many people as they age. At Apex Anti-Aging Center, we offer a range of treatments to help alleviate joint pain and improve joint function. In addition to stem cell therapy, which is an effective and innovative treatment option for joint pain, we also offer other injection therapies such as platelet-rich plasma (PRP) therapy, hyaluronic acid therapy, and prolotherapy. PRP therapy involves injecting concentrated platelets from the patient’s own blood directly into the affected joint, while hyaluronic acid therapy involves injecting a synthetic version of a natural joint lubricant into the joint. Prolotherapy involves injecting a solution of dextrose and other substances directly into the affected joint to promote healing and reduce inflammation. To complement these injection therapies, we also use Indiba therapy, a non-invasive treatment that utilizes radiofrequency technology to promote cell regeneration and reduce inflammation. Our experienced medical professionals will work with you to determine the best treatment plan for your specific needs, ensuring that you receive personalized care and attention. With our comprehensive approach to joint pain treatment, you can achieve optimal joint health and function, allowing you to maintain an active and healthy lifestyle."},{"t":"h2","x":"Office syndrome"},{"t":"p","x":"Office syndrome, also known as computer vision syndrome, is a common condition that occurs as a result of prolonged computer use, causing symptoms such as neck pain, back pain, headaches, and eye strain. At Apex Anti-Aging Center, we offer a variety of treatment options for office syndrome, including Botox injections, Indiba therapy, and physical therapy."},{"t":"p","x":"Botox injections work by blocking the release of acetylcholine, a chemical that causes muscle contractions. By relaxing the muscles in the affected areas, Botox can reduce tension and relieve pain associated with office syndrome. Indiba therapy, on the other hand, uses high-frequency electromagnetic waves to increase blood flow and oxygenation to the affected areas, which can reduce inflammation and promote healing."},{"t":"p","x":"In addition to these treatments, physical therapy can also be an effective way to alleviate symptoms of office syndrome. Our physical therapists can help you improve your posture, strengthen weak muscles, and stretch tight muscles to reduce pain and improve range of motion."},{"t":"p","x":"At Apex Anti-Aging Center, we understand the negative impact that office syndrome can have on your daily life. Our medical professionals will work with you to determine the best treatment plan for your specific needs and help you find relief from the pain and discomfort associated with this condition."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/rhinoplasty":{"title":"Rhinoplasty","desc":"Apex is the leading rhinoplasty clinic, offering state-of-the-art treatment and surgery, based in the heart of Bangkok Thailand","date":"18/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Rhinoplasty with APEX: Your Path to Nose Perfection in Bangkok, Thailand"},{"t":"p","x":"If you’re dissatisfied with the size or shape of your nose, APEX offers top-notch rhinoplasty procedures in Bangkok, Thailand. Discover the world of nose reshaping through APEX and embark on a journey to unlock your newfound confidence."},{"t":"h2","x":"The Art of Rhinoplasty by APEX"},{"t":"p","x":"Rhinoplasty, often colloquially referred to as a “nose job,” stands as one of the world’s top five most popular plastic surgery procedures. At APEX, we understand the profound impact altering the nose’s size and shape can have on your overall appearance. When performed by our highly qualified cosmetic surgeons, rhinoplasty isn’t just about changing your nose; it’s about enhancing your entire facial harmony."},{"t":"h2","x":"Rhinoplasty: More Than Just Cosmetic"},{"t":"p","x":"Rhinoplasty at APEX isn’t limited to cosmetic concerns alone. While many seek this procedure to enhance their aesthetic appeal, it can also address structural defects causing breathing difficulties. Whether you’re pursuing rhinoplasty for aesthetic perfection or functional relief, we’re here to guide you through the process."},{"t":"h2","x":"A Choice Tailored to You"},{"t":"p","x":"Rhinoplasty can be performed as an outpatient or inpatient procedure, with most surgeries lasting between one to three hours. The ideal candidates for rhinoplasty at APEX in Bangkok are those with specific concerns, such as:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Prominent nasal humps."},{"x":"Wide noses."},{"x":"Nasal tips in need of refinement."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Two Paths to Nose Transformation"},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX, we offer two primary types of rhinoplasty procedures:"},{"t":"list","o":true,"items":[{"x":"Closed Rhinoplasty (Internal Approach Rhinoplasty): In this technique, incisions are discreetly made within the nasal interior, ensuring no visible external scarring."},{"x":"Open Rhinoplasty (Open Structure Rhinoplasty): An external incision is made on the columella, the tissue strip separating the nostrils, providing direct access to the nose’s interior. This technique is chosen for specific cases where greater access is required."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"What Rhinoplasty Can Achieve"},{"t":"p","x":"The results of rhinoplasty vary from person to person due to individual factors. At APEX, our goal is to help you achieve the best possible results tailored to your unique desires. Rhinoplasty can achieve several alterations, including:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Changing the nasal bridge’s size, either increasing or decreasing it."},{"x":"Reshaping and resizing the nose."},{"x":"Narrowing the nostrils."},{"x":"Adjusting the angle between the nose and upper lip."},{"x":"Refining the nasal tip."}]},{"t":"p","x":"The surgical techniques employed by our skilled surgeons will be based on the goals you establish during your consultation."},{"t":"h2","x":"The Rhinoplasty Procedure"},{"t":"p","x":"During the rhinoplasty procedure, our surgeons at APEX carefully work on the cartilage and bone that form your nose’s framework. In some cases, adjustments may be made to reposition certain bones, creating a narrower and straighter appearance. Should your nose require additional structural support, cartilage or bone grafts from areas like the septum or ear can be utilized. The skin and soft tissues are then delicately re-draped over this new framework."},{"t":"h2","x":"Your Road to Recovery"},{"t":"p","x":"Recovery after rhinoplasty typically involves the following:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Bruising and Swelling: Bruising around the eyes and cheeks is most noticeable during the first three days after surgery. However, most discoloration clears within a week. Makeup can be used as a concealer a few days post-surgery. While significant swelling may last several weeks, minor residual swelling, often affecting the nasal tip, may persist for several months."},{"x":"Procedure Details: Rhinoplasty at APEX is usually performed under local anesthesia with intravenous sedation, offering a safer and less side-effect-prone alternative to general anesthesia. However, if you prefer to be completely asleep during surgery, general anesthesia can be arranged."},{"x":"Incision Types: Rhinoplasty can be done using either a closed procedure, where incisions are concealed within the nose, or an open procedure, with an incision made across the columella. Incisions, when present, are discreet and virtually undetectable upon healing."},{"x":"Augmentation and Cartilage Use: Depending on your desired outcome, your surgeon may use cartilage grafts from other parts of your body to reduce or augment nasal structures. Cartilage from the septum is commonly employed, but occasionally, cartilage from the ear or even rib cartilage may be used."},{"x":"Splint and Bandaging: After the procedure, a plastic splint is applied to support the newly shaped nose as it heals. This helps maintain the desired outcome."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"The Path to Long-Lasting Results"},{"t":"p","x":"While rhinoplasty results are typically permanent, it’s important to note that cartilage may continue to reshape over time, potentially altering the outcome. Swelling may persist for several months and occasionally up to a year or longer before fully dissipating. However, with APEX’s expert care, you can enjoy lasting results."},{"t":"h2","x":"APEX: Redefining Rhinoplasty in Bangkok"},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX, we redefine the art of rhinoplasty in Bangkok, Thailand. Our skilled surgeons, state-of-the-art techniques, and commitment to your satisfaction ensure you achieve the nose you’ve always dreamed of. Contact APEX today to embark on your journey to nose perfection."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/stem-cell-therapy":{"title":"Stem Cell Therapy","desc":"Apex is the leading stem cell therapy clinic, offering state-of-the-art treatment and therapies, based in the heart of Bangkok Thailand","date":"17/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Advanced Stem Cell Therapy: Regenerative Treatment at Apex Center"},{"t":"p","x":"Stem cell therapy is a regenerative medicine technique that uses stem cells to promote healing and tissue repair in the body. Stem cells are unique cells that have the ability to differentiate into other types of cells, such as muscle cells, nerve cells, and bone cells. This makes them a powerful tool for repairing damaged or diseased tissues."},{"t":"p","x":"At Apex Anti-Aging Center, we use stem cell therapy to treat a variety of conditions, including joint pain, arthritis, and chronic wounds. We source our stem cells from either the patient’s own body (autologous) or from a donor (allogenic), depending on the specific treatment and patient needs."},{"t":"p","x":"During a stem cell therapy treatment, stem cells are harvested and then injected into the affected area of the body. The stem cells then promote healing and tissue regeneration by releasing growth factors and other molecules that stimulate cell growth and repair."},{"t":"p","x":"One of the main benefits of stem cell therapy is its ability to promote natural healing without the need for surgery or medication. It is a minimally invasive and safe procedure that has been shown to be effective in treating a range of conditions. However, it is important to note that stem cell therapy is not a cure-all and may not be effective for all patients."},{"t":"p","x":"It is important to note that while stem cell therapy has shown promising results, there is still much research to be done on its long-term safety and efficacy. At this time, stem cell therapy is not approved by the FDA for the treatment of most conditions, and it is considered an experimental treatment. However, many patients have reported significant improvement in their symptoms and quality of life after receiving stem cell therapy."},{"t":"p","x":"It is important for patients to understand that while stem cell therapy holds great promise, it is still an experimental treatment and there is much that is still unknown about its long-term safety and efficacy. Patients should carefully weigh the potential risks and benefits of stem cell therapy with the guidance of a qualified healthcare professional before deciding to undergo this treatment."},{"t":"p","x":"At Apex Anti-Aging Center, we carefully evaluate each patient’s individual case to determine if stem cell therapy is an appropriate treatment option. Our team of experienced professionals follows strict safety protocols . We also provide ongoing monitoring and follow-up care to ensure the best possible outcomes for our patients."},{"t":"p","x":"The Micro & Macro Focused Ultrasound technology is specially designed so that it can also be combined with previous cartridges (1.5, 3.0, 4.5mm) in order to enhance the effect."},{"t":"p","x":"Currently, 4 & 7Mhz transducers create Micro coagulation into dermis and SMAS while 2Mh transducers deliver Macro energy into subcutaneous fat to selectively remove fat cells. This innovation of transducers generates 8 times the ultrasound energy than procedures used previously maximizing customer satisfaction and reducing."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/thermage-body":{"title":"Thermage Body","desc":"Smooth and rejuvenate your skin with Apex's Thermage Body treatment. Enjoy non-invasive, effective skin tightening for a youthful, refreshed appearance.","date":"17/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"p","x":"Thermage® remodels the collagen in that pesky wrinkled skin. A technologically advanced, non-invasive treatment, powerful Thermage radiofrequency energy gives you a smoother, sleeker look in just one treatment."},{"t":"h2","x":"What is the Thermage procedure?"},{"t":"p","x":"Thermage is a safe, non-invasive, radiofrequency (RF) cosmetic procedure that’s clinically proven to help smooth and improve skin for an overall younger looking appearance. The treatment delivers natural looking results with little to no downtime—on all skin types on and off the face, all in a single procedure."},{"t":"h2","x":"What does Thermage treat?"},{"t":"p","x":"Thermage procedures can effectively and safely treat fine lines and wrinkles on most body parts, including the face, neck, eyes, tummy, arms, hands, thighs and buttocks. Thermage can also smooth uneven, dimpled skin on the body and temporarily reduce the appearance of cellulite."},{"t":"h2","x":"How many treatments will I need?"},{"t":"p","x":"Unlike many other procedures, Thermage treatment delivers results in a single treatment for most patients. In fact, when it comes to wrinkle treatments with little to no downtime, Thermage is one of the only non-invasive procedures on the market."},{"t":"h2","x":"How does treatment work?"},{"t":"p","x":"Thermage uses radiofrequency technology to heat the deep, collagen rich layers of your skin. The heat helps remodel existing collagen and produce new collagen, which improves the smoothness and texture of the skin’s surface."},{"t":"h2","x":"How is technology different from other procedures that treat wrinkles?"},{"t":"p","x":"Unlike some other procedures, Thermage involves no surgery, no injections and little to no downtime, and Thermage works on all skin types on and off the face. While laser treatments and other radiofrequency procedures also smooth the surface of the skin, no other treatment heats as deeply as Thermage. By heating the innermost layers of skin, Thermage is the most effective at renewing collagen , which results in smooth, sleek skin and an overall younger looking appearance."},{"t":"h2","x":"What does the procedure feel like?"},{"t":"p","x":"Each time the treatment device touches your skin, you’ll feel a brief cooling sensation, followed by a deep but brief heating sensation, followed by another cooling sensation. The heating sensation is a sign that the deep layers of your skin are reaching effective temperatures for collagen remodeling. If your doctor has the latest Thermage CPT technology you’ll also feel a gentle vibration sensation for added patient comfort. Throughout the procedure, your physician will ask for feedback on the level of heat sensation to help balance your comfort with maximum results."},{"t":"h2","x":"How do results compare with those of other treatments?"},{"t":"p","x":"Some people want the dramatic results of surgery. Others want the more subtle, gradual results of a non-invasive treatment with no downtime. This is where Thermage succeeds, delivering improved skin appearance, and overall texture. When lotions and potions are not enough and surgery is too much, Thermage is a safe, effective solution."},{"t":"h2","x":"What is Thermage CPT?"},{"t":"p","x":"CPT is Comfort Pulse TechnologyTM. At its core, Thermage® CPT builds on the proven efficacy of the Thermage platform – the only device to use monopolar, capacitively coupled radiofrequency energy for the treatment of wrinkles. But Thermage CPT goes a step further with integrated user and patient comfort features to deliver the best results AND the best treatment experience."},{"t":"p","x":"“Apex Profound Beauty is recognized as the No.1 health institute that performs the most Thermage procedures worldwide.”"},{"t":"p","x":"*Results may vary from person to person."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/tummy-tuck":{"title":"Tummy tuck","desc":"Apex is the leading tummy tuck clinic, offering state-of-the-art treatment and surgery, based in the heart of Bangkok Thailand","date":"18/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"APEX Tummy Tuck: Sculpting Your Dream Abdomen"},{"t":"p","x":"In the pursuit of a slimmer, more toned abdomen, many individuals turn to cosmetic surgery, and tummy tucks have become a popular choice. APEX, a trusted brand in the field of cosmetic surgery, offers top-notch tummy tuck procedures. In this comprehensive guide, we’ll explore what a tummy tuck is, the benefits it offers, and the step-by-step process of undergoing this transformative procedure."},{"t":"h2","x":"Understanding the Tummy Tuck"},{"t":"h3","x":"What Is a Tummy Tuck?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"A tummy tuck, medically known as abdominoplasty, is a cosmetic surgical procedure."},{"x":"It is designed to remove excess fat and skin from the abdominal area, while also restoring weakened or separated muscles."},{"x":"Tummy tucks are ideal for individuals who struggle with sagging skin, stubborn fat deposits, and abdominal muscle laxity."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Benefits of a Tummy Tuck"},{"t":"p","x":"A tummy tuck can provide numerous benefits, both aesthetic and functional:"},{"t":"h4","x":"Improved Abdominal Contour:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Achieve a flatter, more sculpted abdomen."},{"x":"Eliminate the appearance of a protruding belly."}]},{"t":"h4","x":"Enhanced Waistline Definition:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Create a more defined waistline for a shapelier silhouette."}]},{"t":"h4","x":"Elimination of Excess Skin:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Remove loose, hanging skin resulting from pregnancy or significant weight loss."}]},{"t":"h4","x":"Tightened Abdominal Muscles:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Strengthen and tighten abdominal muscles, especially beneficial for post-pregnancy or post-weight loss patients."}]},{"t":"h4","x":"Increased Confidence:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Boost self-esteem and body confidence with a more attractive abdominal appearance."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"The APEX Tummy Tuck Process"},{"t":"p","x":"Undergoing a tummy tuck with APEX involves several key steps:"},{"t":"h3","x":"Consultation and Evaluation"},{"t":"h4","x":"Initial Consultation:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Schedule a consultation with an experienced APEX surgeon."},{"x":"Discuss your goals, medical history, and expectations."}]},{"t":"h4","x":"Medical Evaluation:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Your surgeon will assess your health, skin elasticity, and abdominal muscle condition."},{"x":"Determine your candidacy for a tummy tuck."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Preparing for Surgery"},{"t":"h4","x":"Customized Treatment Plan:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Your APEX surgeon will create a tailored surgical plan to address your specific needs and goals."}]},{"t":"h4","x":"Preoperative Instructions:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Receive detailed instructions on how to prepare for surgery, including dietary guidelines and medication adjustments."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"The Surgical Procedure"},{"t":"h4","x":"Anesthesia:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"You’ll be administered either general anesthesia or intravenous sedation, ensuring comfort throughout the procedure."}]},{"t":"h4","x":"Incision Placement:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"The surgeon will make incisions, typically low on the abdomen, within the bikini line."},{"x":"The incision pattern may vary depending on the extent of correction needed."}]},{"t":"h4","x":"Skin and Fat Removal:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Excess skin and fat are carefully excised and discarded."},{"x":"Liposuction may be employed to enhance results."}]},{"t":"h4","x":"Muscle Repair:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"The surgeon tightens abdominal muscles by suturing them, restoring core strength."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Post-Surgery Recovery"},{"t":"h4","x":"Hospital Stay:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"In most cases, you’ll spend at least one night in the hospital for close monitoring."}]},{"t":"h4","x":"Recovery Timeline:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Expect a recovery period of several weeks."},{"x":"Follow postoperative care instructions diligently to ensure a smooth healing process."}]},{"t":"h4","x":"Resuming Normal Activities:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Gradually reintroduce physical activities following your surgeon’s guidance."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Results and Long-Term Care"},{"t":"h4","x":"Visible Improvement:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Enjoy a noticeably flatter, firmer abdomen."},{"x":"Results will continue to improve as swelling subsides."}]},{"t":"h4","x":"Scarring:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Incisions will leave scars, but they typically fade over time and can be concealed under clothing or swimwear."}]},{"t":"h4","x":"Maintaining Results:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"A healthy lifestyle, including diet and exercise, is key to preserving your tummy tuck results."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Trust APEX for Your Tummy Tuck Journey"},{"t":"p","x":"APEX, renowned for its commitment to patient care and surgical excellence, is the ideal choice for your tummy tuck procedure. With a team of experienced and board-certified surgeons, APEX ensures that you receive the highest standard of care, from initial consultation to postoperative support."},{"t":"p","x":"APEX tummy tucks offer an effective solution for individuals seeking to achieve a slimmer, more defined abdominal appearance. The procedure provides both aesthetic and functional benefits, helping you regain confidence and enhance your overall quality of life. With APEX’s expertise and dedication to patient satisfaction, you can embark on your tummy tuck journey with confidence, knowing you’re in capable hands."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/ulthera":{"title":"Ulthera","desc":"Apex is the leading Ulthera and Ultherapy clinic, offering state-of-the-art non-invasive treatment and therapies, based in the heart of Bangkok Thailand","date":"19/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"ULTHERAPY IS THE ONLY FDA-CLEARED PROCEDURE TO NON-INVASIVELY LIFT THE EYEBROW, NECK AND UNDER-CHIN"},{"t":"h2","x":"What is ultherapy?"},{"t":"p","x":"Ultherapy is a nonsurgical face and neck treatment that uses ultrasound to actually lift and tone loose skin without any downtime."},{"t":"p","x":"Ultherapy is also is the only procedure to use ultrasound imaging, which allows us to actually see the layers of tissue we target during the treatment and ensure the energy is deposited precisely to where it will be most effective."},{"t":"h2","x":"Does it hurt?"},{"t":"p","x":"Comfort thresholds vary from patient to patient, but there can be some discomfort while the ultrasound energy is being delivered. This is temporary and a positive signal that the collagen-building process has been initiated."},{"t":"p","x":"We take measures to make the experience as pleasant as possible [customize based on practice’s comfort management protocol (e.g. premedication, cooling fans)], and patients tell us they leave comfortable and excited about the benefits to come."},{"t":"h2","x":"How long does it last?"},{"t":"p","x":"Patients treated with Ultherapy still have fresh young collagen after a year’s time following the procedure, but skin continues to age. Future touch-up treatments can help keep pace with the aging process, which varies by individual."},{"t":"h2","x":"Is Ultherapy safe?"},{"t":"p","x":"The procedure has been cleared by the FDA after demonstrating safety in clinical studies, and tens of thousands of treatments have been performed safely worldwide. In addition, ultrasound energy has a proven track record, with use in the field of medicine for more than 50 years."},{"t":"h2","x":"How many treatments does it take?"},{"t":"p","x":"The majority of patients only need one treatment; however, some may benefit from more than one treatment (depending on how much laxity they have and their body’s own biological response to the ultrasound and the collagen-building process)."},{"t":"h2","x":"Who is a good candidate for Ultherapy?"},{"t":"p","x":"A good candidate for Ultherapy is someone with skin that has “relaxed” to the point of looking, and often feeling, less firm. A lowered eyebrow line or sagging skin on the eyelids, for instance, is often the first sign of “maturing” skin. Typically, those in their thirties and older who have mild to moderate skin laxity are candidates."},{"t":"p","x":"While Ultherapy is not a replacement for a surgical face lift, there are many people who want some lifting but are not ready for surgery, either mentally, financially or logistically. There also are younger people who want to “stay ahead of the game” as well as those looking to prolong the effects of cosmetic surgery."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/ultimate-cleanse-detox":{"title":"Cleanse & Detox: Enhance Health with Apex’s Ultimate Program","desc":"Detoxify your body with Apex’s Ultimate Cleanse. A comprehensive program to boost your health and vitality.","date":"17/02/2025","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/smiling-asian-male-ultimate-Cleanse-Detox.webp","alt":"smiling asian"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/smiling-asian-male-ultimate-Cleanse-Detox.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/smiling-asian-male-ultimate-Cleanse-Detox.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Ultimate Cleanse & Detox"},{"t":"p","x":"This program is designed to help eliminate toxins from the body and improve overall health and well-being. It includes a combination of colon cleansing, IV therapy, and ozone therapy. The program is divided into three phases, with each phase consisting of 5 sessions over the course of 3 weeks."},{"t":"p","x":"Phase 1 – Cleanse: This phase focuses on colon cleansing to remove waste and toxins from the digestive system. It includes 3 sessions of colon hydrotherapy and 2 sessions of IV therapy with essential nutrients to support detoxification."},{"t":"p","x":"Phase 2 – Purify: This phase focuses on ozone therapy to purify the blood and eliminate toxins. It includes 3 sessions of ozone therapy and 2 sessions of IV therapy with antioxidants to support the body’s natural detoxification processes."},{"t":"p","x":"Phase 3 – Rejuvenate: This phase focuses on restoring the body’s natural balance and vitality. It includes 3 sessions of ozone therapy and 2 sessions of IV therapy with essential vitamins and minerals to support immune function and overall health."},{"t":"p","x":"The clinical benefits of this program include improved digestion and elimination, increased energy levels, reduced inflammation, improved immune function, and overall detoxification of the body."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/under-chin-liposuction":{"title":"Under Chin Liposuction","desc":"Apex is the leading under-chin liposuction clinic, offering state-of-the-art treatment and surgery, based in the heart of Bangkok Thailand","date":"19/02/2025","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/under-chin-liposuction.webp","alt":"Under Chin Liposuction"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/under-chin-liposuction.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/under-chin-liposuction.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"APEX Chin Liposuction: Redefine Your Jawline and Confidence"},{"t":"p","x":"Unveiling APEX Chin Liposuction","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"APEX Chin Liposuction is a cutting-edge cosmetic surgical procedure designed to:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Sculpt your chin"},{"x":"Eliminate a double chin"},{"x":"Redefine your neck and jawline"},{"x":"Target stubborn fat deposits beneath the neck’s skin"},{"x":"Utilize state-of-the-art liposuction techniques"},{"x":"Result in a more pronounced jawline, a sleeker chin, and a beautifully contoured neck."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Alternative Names for APEX Chin Liposuction"},{"t":"p","x":"APEX Chin Liposuction is known by various names:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Submental Liposuction"},{"x":"Chin Lipo"},{"x":"Neck Liposuction"},{"x":"Double Chin Surgery"},{"x":"Double Chin Removal"},{"x":"Double Chin Correction"},{"x":"Double Chin Reduction"},{"x":"Customized Solutions with APEX"}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Tailored options:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Combine chin liposuction with a neck lift for those with significant chin fat and loose skin."},{"x":"Individuals with excellent skin elasticity may not require a lift."},{"x":"Minimal downtime and post-operative discomfort for convenience."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Who is an Ideal Candidate for APEX Chin Liposuction?"},{"t":"p","x":"Chin Perfection with APEX","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Consider APEX Chin Liposuction if you:"},{"x":"Have a Double or Triple Chin"},{"x":"Experience Jowls Obscuring Your Jawline"},{"x":"Suffer from Chin and Neck Fat Affecting Your Neckline"},{"x":"Are Not Significantly Overweight (subplatysmal fat is not accessible)"},{"x":"Possess Good Skin Elasticity (for optimal natural skin retraction)"},{"x":"Maintain Good Overall Health"},{"x":"Maintain a Stable Weight"}]},{"t":"h2","x":"The Advantages of Choosing APEX Chin Liposuction"},{"t":"p","x":"Enjoy a Swift Recovery"},{"t":"h3","x":"Benefits of APEX Chin Liposuction include:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Rapid Recovery (1-2 days)"},{"x":"Cost-Effectiveness (less time in the operating room)"},{"x":"Double Chin Reduction"},{"x":"Sculpted Jawline"},{"x":"Reduction of Bulky Jowls"},{"x":"Elimination of Chin and Neck Fat"},{"x":"Defined Neck and Chin Contour"},{"x":"Enhanced Chin Profile"}]},{"t":"p","x":"APEX Chin Liposuction is a versatile and effective solution for individuals seeking to address issues such as double chins, undefined jawlines, and excess chin and neck fat. With its customized approach, minimal downtime, and impressive benefits, APEX empowers individuals to achieve the facial aesthetics they desire, boosting their self-confidence and helping them put their best face forward. Explore the possibilities with APEX Chin Liposuction and rediscover your jawline’s true potential."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/vaser-liposuction":{"title":"Vaser Liposuction at APEX","desc":"Sculpt your body with Apex's Liposuction. Achieve precise contouring and remove stubborn fat for a sleek, confident silhouette. Transform your shape today!","date":"18/02/2025","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/liposuction-surgery-before-and-after.webp","alt":"APEX Liposuction, Thailand: Sculpting Your Ideal Body Shape"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/liposuction-surgery-before-and-after.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/liposuction-surgery-before-and-after.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"APEX Liposuction, Thailand: Sculpting Your Ideal Body Shape"},{"t":"p","x":"In the quest to achieve the perfect body shape, an increasing number of people are turning to cosmetic procedures like liposuction in Thailand. As a leading expert in aesthetic enhancement, APEX has become a respected, renowned brand. When you partner with us to undergo liposuction surgery, you will find yourself in the capable hands of the industry’s most professional, attentive team of experts. Our focus is on our clients’ comfort, safety, and mental well-being at all times, and we always go the extra distance to ensure their complete satisfaction."},{"t":"p","x":"This comprehensive guide delves into the intricate process behind this transformative procedure and how APEX liposuction surgery can benefit you and change your life."},{"t":"h2","x":"Understanding Liposuction Surgery"},{"t":"p","x":"Liposuction, often called ‘lipo,’ is a cosmetic surgical procedure to remove stubborn fat deposits from specific body areas. Although stomach liposuction is most common, fat deposits can be successfully removed from most accessible areas, creating the body shapes and contours our clients wish to see. Technically, liposuction in Thailand is not considered a weight loss procedure but a body contouring technique targeting localized fat pockets."},{"t":"h2","x":"Types of Liposuction Surgery and Their Uses"},{"t":"p","x":"Liposuction procedures have become increasingly refined and advanced. Modern techniques and technology have significantly improved safety, efficiency, and results."},{"t":"p","x":"As a premium health center in Thailand, our liposuction surgeons at APEX have embraced these advancements that make the liposuction of fat safer, more effective, and accessible to a broader range of patients. These procedures produce enhanced results, often significantly reducing downtime, and include innovations like VASER liposuction (Vibration Amplification of Sound Energy at Resonance), an advanced ultrasound technique."},{"t":"h2","x":"Who is Liposuction Recommended For?"},{"t":"p","x":"Liposuction is recommended for individuals close to reaching their ideal weight but still struggling with stubborn pockets of fat that diet and exercise seem ineffective at reducing. Common target areas for liposuction surgery include:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Abdomen"},{"x":"Thighs"},{"x":"Buttocks"},{"x":"Hips"},{"x":"Arms"},{"x":"Chin"},{"x":"Neck"}]},{"t":"h2","x":"The Advantages of APEX Liposuction"},{"t":"p","x":"As a trusted brand in aesthetic enhancement, APEX offers state-of-the-art liposuction techniques with numerous advantages, including:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Enhanced body contouringAPEX liposuction utilizes precise, targeted fat removal, allowing experienced surgeons to sculpt, define, and contour your body, creating a more proportionate, aesthetically pleasing appearance."},{"x":"Improved confidence and self-esteemEliminating unwanted fat deposits can significantly boost self-esteem and body confidence, giving clients a new lease on life. This is fundamental to APEX’s vision, and we provide a premium service that positively changes how our clients view themselves moving forward."},{"x":"Minimal scarringThe precise, targeted nature of APEX’s fat removal techniques is designed to leave minimal scarring."},{"x":"Rapid recoveryUsing less invasive techniques results in shorter recovery times, and many patients return to their daily activities within a few days to a week."},{"x":"Long-lasting resultsAPEX liposuction results are typically long-lasting if a healthy lifestyle is maintained post-surgery. Fat cells removed during the procedure do not return to the treated areas."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"The APEX Liposuction Process"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"ConsultationYour journey with APEX begins with an in-depth consultation with a specialist. Your goals and expectations are discussed during this meeting, and the specific areas you wish to target are examined. Whether you want liposuction on your stomach or elsewhere, the surgeon will assess your candidacy for treatment and create a personalized plan."},{"x":"Pre-operative preparationBefore the procedure, you will be given detailed instructions on how to prepare, including dietary guidelines and medication adjustments. APEX leaves no stone unturned in ensuring patients are in optimal condition for liposuction surgery."},{"x":"AnesthesiaLiposuction procedures are performed under general anesthesia. During general anesthesia, patients are unconscious and have no awareness or sensations."},{"x":"Incision and injection of tumescent solutionOnce sedated, tiny incisions are made in inconspicuous areas near the treatment site. A special tumescent solution, consisting of saline and epinephrine, is injected into the target area to minimize bleeding and facilitate fat removal."},{"x":"Fat removalAPEX employs advanced techniques such as laser or ultrasound-assisted VASER liposuction for precise fat removal. A cannula (thin tube) is inserted through the incisions to break up and suction out the fat."},{"x":"Sculpting and contouringThe surgeon sculpts and contours the treated area during the liposuction surgery to achieve the desired shape and proportions. APEX’s skilled surgeons pay meticulous attention to detail to ensure the best possible outcome."},{"x":"ClosureOnce the fat removal and sculpting are complete, the incisions are expertly closed with sutures. APEX prioritizes minimal scarring, and, combined with strategically placed incisions, visibility is reduced to an almost imperceptible level."},{"x":"Post-operative careAfter the procedure, patients are taken to a relaxing recovery area and carefully monitored. You will receive detailed post-operative care instructions to avoid straining the sutures, remain comfortable, and ensure a smooth recovery."},{"x":"Recovery and resultsAfter liposuction, the stomach and other treated areas may be sensitive and swollen, but this is perfectly normal. Most patients can return to light activities within a few days and resume regular exercise after a few weeks. As the swelling subsides, the results of your APEX liposuction will become apparent, revealing your new, beautifully contoured body."},{"x":"Long-term maintenanceTo maintain your APEX liposuction results, it’s essential to implement a healthy diet and exercise regimen. After liposuction, fat cells removed during the procedure do not regenerate, but new ones can develop, and overall weight gain can affect your results."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Why APEX Medical Center is the Right Choice for Liposuction Surgery"},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX, we aim to help you pursue your ideal body shape. Our unrivaled liposuction offers a transformative solution that combines precision, artistry, and advanced techniques. Whether you’re looking to sculpt your abdomen with liposuction on your tummy, give form to your thighs, or target other troublesome spots, APEX’s experienced surgeons can help you achieve the results you desire. With a commitment to patient satisfaction and safety, APEX remains a trusted name in aesthetic enhancement."},{"t":"h2","x":"Is APEX Liposuction Right for You?"},{"t":"p","x":"The ideal candidates for APEX liposuction are individuals in good overall health, close to their target weight, with localized fat deposits that are stubbornly resistant to diet and exercise. We never let our clients make rash decisions without all the information and guidance they need, and an APEX specialist will assess your specific needs to help determine if liposuction is the right choice for you."},{"t":"h2","x":"The Importance of Realistic Expectations"},{"t":"p","x":"It’s crucial to have realistic expectations about the results of APEX liposuction. While stomach liposuction and others can significantly improve body contouring, they cannot replace a healthy lifestyle. It is critical to address the behaviors that led to the unwanted fat in the first place and make lifestyle changes that reflect your new vigor and appreciation of the way you look."},{"t":"h2","x":"Schedule a Consultation"},{"t":"p","x":"Please get in touch with APEX Medical Center today if you’re ready to take the next step towards a beautifully sculpted, healthy body that reflects your inner beauty and confidence. Our experienced, knowledgeable team is standing by to discuss your goals, address any concerns, answer questions, and schedule a consultation with one of our experts."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/weight-management":{"title":"Weight Management","desc":"Reach your weight management goals with Apex’s personalized programs. Sustainable solutions for lasting results","date":"17/02/2025","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/close-up-portrait-slim-sportswoman-measuring-her-waist-e1739813777456.webp","alt":"Weight management"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/close-up-portrait-slim-sportswoman-measuring-her-waist-e1739813777456.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/close-up-portrait-slim-sportswoman-measuring-her-waist-e1739813777456.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Personalized Weight Management: Comprehensive Solutions at Apex"},{"t":"p","x":"Weight management is an important aspect of overall health and wellness, and there are many options available at anti-aging clinics to help individuals achieve their weight loss goals. These options can include a combination of lifestyle changes, dietary modifications, and medical interventions."},{"t":"p","x":"At Apex Anti-Aging Center, we offer a comprehensive weight management program that includes personalized nutrition and exercise plans, as well as the use of advanced technologies to aid in fat reduction and body shaping such as CoolSculpting, Z Wave, and Emsculpt, which use non-invasive techniques to target stubborn fat and sculpt the body."},{"t":"p","x":"This program may also include IV therapy and hormone testing to identify any underlying imbalances that could be contributing to weight gain."},{"t":"p","x":"In addition, we offer a variety of FDA-approved weight loss medications and supplements to assist with weight loss, as well as prescription injections like lipo-B and lipo-C, which contain a combination of essential vitamins and amino acids to help boost metabolism and burn fat."},{"t":"p","x":"Our weight management program is tailored to the individual needs of each patient, and our team of experienced medical professionals work closely with patients to develop a customized plan that fits their lifestyle and goals. We prioritize long-term, sustainable weight loss and overall health improvement, rather than quick fixes or fad diets."},{"t":"p","x":"Overall, our weight loss program combines a holistic approach to health and wellness, including medical interventions, nutrition, exercise, and technology, , and personalized attention to help patients achieve and maintain a healthy weight for a better quality of life."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"service/zygoma-reduction":{"title":"Zygoma Reduction","desc":"Reduce cheekbone prominence with Apex’s zygoma reduction surgery. Sculpt your face for a more balanced appearance.","date":"18/02/2025","hero":null,"og":null,"thumb":null,"blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"APEX Cheekbone Reduction/ Zygoma"},{"t":"p","x":"Achieve Your Perfect Facial Balance","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Are you looking to enhance your facial appearance and achieve a more beautiful, balanced, and attractive face? APEX Cheekbone Reduction, also known as Zygoma Reduction, is the answer. This surgical procedure, offered exclusively by APEX, is designed to reshape prominent cheekbones and reduce facial width. Say goodbye to excessively high and wide cheekbones, and say hello to a sleeker, slimmer, and softer facial contour that radiates beauty."},{"t":"h2","x":"A Perfect Candidate for APEX Cheekbone Reduction"},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX, we understand that achieving the ideal facial balance is a personal journey. Our APEX Cheekbone Reduction procedure is tailored for individuals who exhibit the following characteristics:"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Excessively prominent front cheekbones"},{"x":"Broad cheekbones"},{"x":"Disproportionate or unbalanced facial structure"}]},{"t":"p","x":"If you resonate with these concerns, you are the perfect candidate for APEX Cheekbone Reduction. Our specialized surgical techniques can remove or correct bone protrusions, resulting in a more refined and attractive facial line."},{"t":"h2","x":"Preparing for Your APEX Cheekbone Reduction Journey"},{"t":"h3","x":"1. Consultation with APEX Experts"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Schedule a consultation with our skilled surgeons to discuss your unique goals and expectations."},{"x":"During this consultation, our experienced team will assess your facial structure and work with you to determine the best approach for your Cheekbone Reduction."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"2. Comprehensive Physical Examination"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Your safety is paramount to us. A comprehensive physical examination is conducted to assess your overall health."},{"x":"This examination may include a blood test, chest X-ray, and, if you are over 40 years old, an ECG (electrocardiogram) to evaluate any potential heart-related risks."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"3. Facial X-Ray Analysis"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX utilizes advanced technology, including facial X-ray analysis, to gain a deep understanding of your facial structure."},{"x":"This analysis helps us choose the most suitable technique to achieve the desired results."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"4. Lifestyle Adjustments"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Two weeks prior to your APEX Cheekbone Reduction surgery, it is crucial to discontinue smoking to promote optimal healing and minimize risks."},{"x":"Avoid anti-inflammatory medications such as Aspirin and Ibuprofen for at least two weeks before surgery."},{"x":"Additionally, refrain from taking herbal supplements and vitamins that may increase the risk of bleeding during and after surgery."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"The APEX Cheekbone Reduction Procedure"},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX, we take pride in our innovative and exclusive surgical techniques for Cheekbone Reduction. Our procedure involves an L-shaped osteotomy or two-site osteotomy and rotation method, ensuring minimal scarring and exceptional results."},{"t":"h3","x":"1. Two-Incision Approach"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX Cheekbone Reduction utilizes a two-incision approach, ensuring minimal scarring and a discreet appearance."},{"x":"One incision is intra-oral, specifically for the zygomatic body, while the other is located in front of the ear, behind the sideburn, for the zygomatic arch."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"2. Osteotomy Techniques"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Our skilled surgeons perform frontal site osteotomy, which involves cutting the zygomatic body into an L-shape."},{"x":"In addition, posterior osteotomy is conducted to cut the zygomatic arch."},{"x":"These precise osteotomy techniques allow for the necessary bone adjustments."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"3. Rotation and Fixation"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"To achieve the desired facial contour, the cheekbone is carefully rotated inwardly during the procedure."},{"x":"A mini-titanium plate and screws are used to secure the repositioned bone, preventing further movement."},{"x":"The result is a smooth and harmonious facial appearance."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"4. Expert Closure"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"The intra-oral incision is closed using absorbable sutures, ensuring a comfortable recovery process."},{"x":"External incisions are meticulously closed with fine sutures, minimizing the visibility of scars."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose APEX for Cheekbone Reduction?"},{"t":"p","x":"When it comes to enhancing your facial aesthetics through Cheekbone Reduction, APEX stands out as the brand of choice. Here’s why:"},{"t":"h3","x":"Expertise"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX boasts a team of highly skilled and experienced surgeons who specialize in facial aesthetics."},{"x":"Our surgeons are well-versed in the intricacies of Cheekbone Reduction, ensuring precise and satisfactory results."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Innovative Techniques"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX Cheekbone Reduction employs cutting-edge techniques, such as L-shaped osteotomy and two-site osteotomy."},{"x":"These innovative approaches minimize scarring and maximize the effectiveness of the procedure."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Personalized Care"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"At APEX, we understand that each individual is unique. We tailor our Cheekbone Reduction procedure to your specific facial characteristics and goals."},{"x":"Your journey with APEX is characterized by personalized care and attention to detail."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Safety First"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Your safety is our top priority. We conduct thorough physical examinations and utilize advanced technology to assess your health and facial structure."},{"x":"APEX surgeons are trained to prioritize your well-being throughout the entire process."}]},{"t":"h3","x":"Exceptional Results"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"APEX Cheekbone Reduction is designed to provide exceptional results that leave you feeling confident and beautiful."},{"x":"Our surgeons’ expertise and the use of advanced techniques ensure that you achieve the facial balance you desire."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Your Transformation Begins with APEX Cheekbone Reduction"},{"t":"p","x":"Embark on your journey to a more beautiful, balanced, and attractive face with APEX Cheekbone Reduction. Our specialized surgical techniques, personalized care, and commitment to excellence make APEX the premier choice for individuals seeking facial enhancement."},{"t":"p","x":"Don’t wait any longer to achieve the facial balance you’ve always dreamed of. Contact APEX today to schedule your consultation and take the first step towards a more confident and radiant you."},{"t":"p","x":"Contact Us","b":1},{"t":"p","x":"Phone : +66 85 000 2001Line Official : @apexmedicalcenter"}]},"snore-laser":{"title":"Snoring Treatment","desc":"Snoring, is it dangerous? Treat snoring with laser to cure snoring, breathe easier, no need for surgery, recover quickly, starting at only 9,900 baht.","date":"23/08/2024","hero":{"src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/snoring-treatment-cover.webp","alt":"แก้นอนกรน"},"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/snoring-treatment-laser.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/snoring-treatment-cover.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"Snoring Treatment with Laser – No Surgery Required"},{"t":"p","x":"Snoring is more than just a nighttime nuisance—it can negatively impact your quality of life and long-term health. Fortunately, modern snoring treatments, such as laser therapy, offer an effective, non-invasive solution with fast recovery times. If you’re concerned about the dangers of snoring and sleep apnea, APEX is here to help you understand the causes and explore the best treatment options available."},{"t":"h2","x":"What Is Snoring?"},{"t":"p","x":"Snoring occurs when airflow through the upper airway is obstructed during sleep, causing soft tissues in the throat to vibrate and create noise. Common causes include a lax soft palate, an oversized tongue, or excess weight. Chronic snoring can contribute to serious health conditions such as high blood pressure, heart disease, and obstructive sleep apnea (OSA). If your snoring disrupts sleep quality for you or your partner, seeking medical advice is recommended."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/what-causes-snoring-en.webp","alt":"causes snoring"},{"t":"h2","x":"What Causes Snoring?"},{"t":"p","x":"Snoring is caused by the narrowing or obstruction of the upper airway. Here are some key factors:"},{"t":"p","x":"✔ Relaxed Soft Palate: A drooping soft palate can partially block the airway.✔ Enlarged Tongue: A large tongue may obstruct airflow during sleep.✔ Short Jaw Structure: Abnormal jaw alignment can make the airway narrower.✔ Chronic Nasal Inflammation: Swelling in the nasal passages can restrict airflow.✔ Excess Weight: Fat deposits around the neck can compress the airway.✔ Alcohol Consumption: Alcohol relaxes throat muscles, increasing snoring.✔ Smoking: Smoking irritates and inflames the respiratory passages.✔ Allergies: Allergic reactions can cause nasal congestion and airway swelling.✔ Sleeping Position: Sleeping on your back can worsen snoring."},{"t":"h2","x":"At What Age Does Snoring Start?"},{"t":"p","x":"Snoring can affect people of all ages, but it becomes more common in adults, particularly as they age. Muscle tone in the throat decreases over time, increasing the risk of airway obstruction."},{"t":"p","x":"However, snoring is not exclusive to adults – children can also experience it, especially between ages 2-6, due to enlarged tonsils or adenoids."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/is-snoring-dangerous-en.webp","alt":"snoring dangerous"},{"t":"h2","x":"Is Snoring and Sleep Apnea Dangerous?"},{"t":"p","x":"Snoring itself is not always harmful, but it can be a sign of obstructive sleep apnea (OSA), a condition where breathing repeatedly stops during sleep. If left untreated, OSA can lead to severe health issues, including heart disease, stroke, diabetes, and chronic fatigue."},{"t":"h2","x":"How to Treat Snoring?"},{"t":"p","x":"There are two widely used methods for treating snoring:"},{"t":"h3","x":"Laser Snoring Treatment (SnoreLase)"},{"t":"p","x":"Laser therapy is a non-invasive solution that tightens throat tissues, reducing airway obstruction and snoring. This procedure is quick, requires no surgery, and offers a fast recovery time. The effectiveness varies based on the severity of the condition, and a doctor’s consultation is advised for personalized treatment plans."},{"t":"h3","x":"CPAP Therapy"},{"t":"p","x":"A Continuous Positive Airway Pressure (CPAP) machine delivers a steady flow of air to keep the airway open, preventing snoring and apnea episodes. While effective, some patients find CPAP uncomfortable or inconvenient to use at night."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/snoring-treatment-en.webp","alt":"snoring treatment"},{"t":"h2","x":"Snorelase vs. CPAP – Which Is Better?"},{"t":"p","x":"If you suffer from snoring or mild sleep apnea and prefer a solution that doesn’t require wearing a CPAP mask every night, laser treatment is a great alternative. Unlike CPAP, which can cause discomfort and dryness, SnoreLase is a pain-free, quick procedure that directly targets the root cause of snoring without medication, surgery, or long recovery periods."},{"t":"h2","x":"Benefits of SnoreLase Treatment:"},{"t":"p","x":"✔ Non-surgical & non-invasive✔ Pain-free & requires no anesthesia✔ Only 30 minutes per session✔ No downtime or side effects"},{"t":"h2","x":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"Does Snorelase Hurt?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"No! The procedure is pain-free. You may feel a mild warmth during treatment, but no anesthesia or sedation is required. Some patients may experience slight throat dryness for a day or two, which can be relieved by drinking water frequently."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How Many Sessions Are Needed?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"The results vary per individual. After one session, most patients experience 20% improvement in breathing and sleep quality. However, doctors generally recommend 3-6 sessions for optimal results, depending on the severity of snoring and individual factors such as age, gender, and overall health."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Is Snorelase a Permanent Solution?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Laser therapy significantly reduces snoring and has been clinically proven to be effective. The longevity of results depends on individual factors, including lifestyle and the severity of snoring. A doctor’s evaluation will help determine the best treatment plan for long-term improvement."}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Conclusion: Effective Snorelase at APEX"},{"t":"p","x":"Snoring is caused by airway obstruction, and if left untreated, it can lead to serious health risks, including sleep apnea. Laser snoring treatment is one of the most advanced and effective solutions, offering a quick, non-surgical, and pain-free way to improve sleep quality."},{"t":"p","x":"Book a Private Consultation at APEX today to learn more about personalized snoring treatment options!"},{"t":"h2","x":"Example of a snoring treatment case by Ping Adison"},{"t":"yt","id":"NKTCtBhXOz0"},{"t":"h2","x":"Customer service reviews"},{"t":"gallery","items":["~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/snore-laser-review-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/snore-laser-review-04.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/snore-laser-review-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/snore-laser-review-03.webp"]},{"t":"p","x":"Results may vary from person to person."}]},"ultherapy-prime":{"title":"Ultherapy Prime","desc":"Get to know the Ultherapy Prime program or Ulthera Prime, a new technology that helps tighten and rejuvenate the skin.","date":"26/10/2024","hero":null,"og":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Ultherapy-Prime.webp","thumb":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Ultherapy-Prime.webp","blocks":[{"t":"h2","x":"What is Ultherapy Prime and How Does It Work?"},{"t":"p","x":"Ultherapy Prime is the latest advancement in non-surgical skin lifting and tightening technology, building on the globally recognized Ultherapy (Ulthera), which has been trusted for over 15 years. With continuous innovation, Ultherapy Prime enhances facial and neck treatments with greater precision, improved comfort, and 20% faster treatment times."},{"t":"p","x":"This next-generation ultrasound lifting technology features an upgraded Full HD display that is 35% larger, offering real-time imaging with higher clarity for more precise treatment. Additionally, the new MFU-V technology provides customized skin-tightening solutions tailored to each individual’s skin condition."},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/ultherapy-prime-vs-classic-comparison.webp","alt":"เปรียบเทียบ Ultherapy Prime กับรุ่นเก่า"},{"t":"h2","x":"How is Ultherapy Prime Different from the Previous Version?"},{"t":"p","x":"1. Enhanced Device Design","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Sleeker, more modern, and compact for easier maneuverability."},{"x":"Ergonomic design ensures better comfort for both doctors and patients, improving treatment precision."}]},{"t":"p","x":"2. Advanced Full HD Imaging","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"35% larger display with a higher refresh rate, providing real-time, ultra-clear visualization of skin layers."},{"x":"Enhanced accuracy in assessing skin depth, reducing the risk of energy misplacement."}]},{"t":"p","x":"3. Faster & More Efficient Processing","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"20% faster treatment time, minimizing discomfort and reducing session duration."},{"x":"Improved ultrasound energy precision, enhancing skin rejuvenation and tightening results."}]},{"t":"p","x":"4. Increased Patient Comfort","b":1},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Quieter operation for a more relaxing experience."},{"x":"Reduced discomfort due to enhanced energy control and optimized treatment speed."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Ultherapy Prime Results: What to Expect?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Immediately after treatment: Skin appears firmer and lifted by about 20% due to deep tissue stimulation."},{"x":"1 month post-treatment: Skin tightens further, becoming visibly more radiant and youthful."},{"x":"2-3 months post-treatment: Optimal results achieved with enhanced collagen production, leading to defined facial contours and lifted skin."},{"x":"Long-lasting effects: Results last 1-2 years, depending on individual skin care and post-treatment habits."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Who is Ultherapy Prime Suitable For?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Individuals with undefined jawlines seeking improved facial contours."},{"x":"Those with sagging skin looking to lift cheeks, jawline, and reduce double chin."},{"x":"People with fine lines and wrinkles who want non-surgical anti-aging solutions."},{"x":"Individuals with drooping eyelids or under-eye sagging, achieving a refreshed look."},{"x":"**Anyone seeking a non-invasive alternative to facelift surgery."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Who Should Avoid Ultherapy Prime?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Pregnant or breastfeeding women."},{"x":"Individuals with open wounds or skin infections in the treatment area."},{"x":"Those with metal implants or electronic medical devices near the treatment area."},{"x":"Patients with severe uncontrolled medical conditions (e.g., heart disease, epilepsy)."},{"x":"Those who recently had laser treatments or chemical peels, should wait until full recovery."}]},{"t":"img","src":"~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/ultherapy-prime-6-areas.webp","alt":"จุดที่นิยมทำ Ultherapy Prime"},{"t":"h2","x":"Popular Treatment Areas for Ultherapy Prime"},{"t":"list","o":true,"items":[{"x":"Forehead & Eyebrows – Lifts sagging brows and smoothens forehead wrinkles."},{"x":"Eye Area – Reduces crow’s feet and tightens upper eyelids."},{"x":"Cheeks – Lifts sagging cheeks for a youthful appearance."},{"x":"Jawline – Enhances jawline definition and reduces double chin."},{"x":"Chin – Refines chin shape and minimizes sagging skin."},{"x":"Neck – Reduces neck wrinkles and loose skin."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Post-Treatment Care for Long-Lasting Results"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Avoid excessive facial touching for the first 1-2 days."},{"x":"Use gentle skincare and avoid strong chemical products (e.g., Retinol, AHA, BHA) for one week."},{"x":"Protect skin from direct sunlight with high SPF sunscreen for 1-2 weeks."},{"x":"Stay hydrated and get enough rest to support collagen regeneration."},{"x":"Avoid extreme heat (saunas, hot baths) for 48 hours."},{"x":"Use a hydrating moisturizer to keep skin nourished."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Why Choose APEX for Ultherapy Prime?"},{"t":"list","o":false,"items":[{"x":"Newest Ultherapy technology – Achieve precise and long-lasting results with the latest Ulthera Prime."},{"x":"Expert medical team – Our doctors specialize in non-surgical face lifting for tailored treatments."},{"x":"Premium patient care – We provide comprehensive aftercare for long-term skin health."},{"x":"Convenient locations – With 54 branches across Bangkok, including prime locations like Ploenchit, we are easily accessible for your convenience."}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Frequently asked questions"},{"t":"faqs","items":[{"t":"faq","q":"Does Ultherapy Prime hurt?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Ultherapy Prime is less painful compared to the previous version. Thanks to advanced technology, discomfort during the treatment is significantly reduced. Patients typically experience a warm sensation or mild tingling under the skin."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How soon can I see results from Ultherapy Prime?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"You will notice an immediate improvement of about 30% in skin tightness right after the treatment. However, the full effects develop over 2-3 months as collagen production is stimulated."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"When should I repeat Ultherapy Prime?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Results can last up to 1 year, depending on individual skin conditions and post-treatment care. For optimal and long-lasting skin firmness, it is recommended to repeat the treatment once a year."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"How long does swelling last after Ultherapy Prime?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Mild redness, swelling, or tenderness may occur in the treated area. These symptoms typically subside within 2-3 days."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Can Ultherapy Prime be combined with other treatments?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Yes, Ultherapy Prime can be combined with other aesthetic procedures. However, a sufficient interval between treatments is required. A consultation with a doctor will help determine the most suitable treatment plan."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Is Ultherapy Prime suitable for all skin types?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"Yes, Ultherapy Prime is safe for all skin types because the ultrasound energy does not damage the outer layer of the skin."}]},{"t":"faq","q":"Why is Ultherapy Prime a better choice?","a":[{"t":"p","x":"With 20% faster treatment time, enhanced skin lifting effects, and reduced discomfort, Ultherapy Prime provides a more efficient and comfortable experience. Results last 1-2 years, and there is no downtime, making it ideal for those seeking an advanced and effective skin-tightening solution."},{"t":"p","x":"At APEX, we prioritize safety, quality, and exceptional results. Our team of highly skilled medical professionals specializes in non-surgical lifting treatments, ensuring personalized care for every client."}]}]},{"t":"h2","x":"Our Exclusive Clients"},{"t":"gallery","items":["~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Ultherapy-Prime-Review-02.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Ultherapy-Prime-Review-04.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Ultherapy-Prime-Review-01.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Ultherapy-Prime-Review-03.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Ultherapy-Prime-Review-05.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Ultherapy-Prime-Review-08.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Ultherapy-Prime-Review-06.webp","~/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Ultherapy-Prime-Review-07.webp"]},{"t":"p","x":"Results may vary from person to person."}]}};
